<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">- Tsishingini (tsw)</book>
  <para style="h">2 Alabari</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Alb</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Alabari</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Alabari</para>
  <para style="mt2">2 Alabari</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Alabari</para>
  <para style="is">Ucuɗuwu wa aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="ip">Aatagada e ire wa Alabari a lyuwa ta̱ elime diga uba̱ta̱ u na Aatagada o ufaru wa Alabari e isawain. Alabari'i e teme ta̱ diga a mantsa mo tsugono tsa Mogono Sulemanu hali acina mantsa mo ukwisa̱ ma̱ yi. Aatagada'a u ca ta̱ alabari o u'ya̱susa̱n wa aci wu upasu wu ugana wa aza a Isra'ila e ekere a Rehobowam ulobo wa̱ Sulemanu, u'ya̱susa̱n wa aci a na Yerobowam rono yi aɗanga. Alabari'i we e isawan ta̱ o una̱ wa alabari o tsugono tsu upasu wu uyagi wa Isra'ila wa aza a Yahuda, hali a cina mantsa ma̱ ma̱riya̱ ma̱ Urishelima a̱tsuma̱ a'wan ukpakuton na̱ kupa kula̱ na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱li (586) BC. Aciya adanshi aatagada'a a̱ yi ɗa ko na wo o'woi mantsa ma tsu gura ta̱ vadala, amma A̱sulazuva o to oɓolo na ama a̱ yi. Waru mantsa suru u tu ufoɓu u na wa kamba aza a na a yuwusan tsutoni na̱ nzuwulai ma̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="is">Ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="io1">Tsugono tsa Sulemanu 1:1-9:31</para>
  <para style="io1">Aa'wan o ufaru 1:1-17</para>
  <para style="io1">Usaa wa̱ A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa 2:1-7:10</para>
  <para style="io1">Aa'wan a̱ca̱pa̱ 7:11-9:31</para>
  <para style="io1">U'ya̱susa̱n wa aci wu ugundo wu ugana 10:1-19</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngono ma Yahuda 11:1-36:12</para>
  <para style="io1">A̱risa̱ a̱ Urishelima 36:13-23</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="s">Sulemanu pati ta̱ ugbozu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />Mogono Sulemanu ulobo wa̱ Da̱wuda shuwa̱ ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ yi nu ucira lon, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱yi a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi waru u zuwai ta̱ u tsura̱ tsugbain lon.<verse eid="2CH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" />A̱vu Sulemanu ɗe aza a Isra'ila suru: Azagbain a nan yali ya̱ a̱soja vu ukpakukupa kupa na̱ a̱za̱ o ukpaku ukpaku, no ozo o uge'etosu na̱ azagbain a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila suru, na azagbain a 'wa. <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" />Reve Sulemanu oɓolo ni iɓolo ya ama'a suru a̱ ka̱ra̱ a gawan uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Gibiyon, adama a na ɗe ɗa Oogodo o Uga'asusan wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ da̱na̱i, za na Musa aagbashi a̱ A̱sulazuva a yuwain a̱tsumona. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" />Amma Da̱wuda tara ta̱ ɗe Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sula̱ diga a̱ lyuci va Kiriyat Jeyarim a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u na u foɓoo niyi, adama a na u shuwa̱ ta̱ ɗe oogodo adama a̱yi ɗe Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" />Amma masa'a ma̱ rumushili ma na Bezale ulobo wa̱ Uri ulobo wa̱ Huru yuwain, u shi ta̱ ɗe a Gibiyon elime o Oogodo o Uga'asusan, reve Sulemanu ni iɓolo ya ama'a a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ ɗe uba̱ta̱'a̱. <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Sulemanu kumba ta̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u masa'a ma̱ rumushili'i a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ o Oogodo o Uga'asusan, a̱vu u ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu ukpakukupa (1,000) zuva va̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />Na ayin o ndolo reve A̱sulazuva o roco aciya̱yi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Sulemanu, a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Pati ili i na vu cigai n ca wu biti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" />A̱vu Sulemanu damma, vu roco ta̱ dada va̱ Da̱wuda isa'ani, na vu zuwai mo o'woi mogono o una̱ wa̱ yi. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" />&lt;&lt;Gogo, A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱, lyawa nzuwulai n na vu yuwayin dada va̱ Da̱wuda wo o'wo amayun, na vo o'woto numu mogono e ekere ama a̱bunda̱ na a̱ ri tsa̱ ma̱buta̱ mo o uvaɗi. <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" />Adama o ndolo vu ca mu ugbozu nu urevu u na ma gura yuwan tsugbain ulobonu, adama a na zane ɗa aa gura yuwan tsugbain tsa ama a̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ wu a nda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />A̱vu A̱sula̱ a̱ usu Sulemanu, &lt;&lt;Ana wo o'woi ili i nda i ɗa okolo a̱ wu a cigai, agba vu pati utsuru ko ili yu ukere shi, ko tsugbain shi, ko vu zami ukwa̱ wu n'yuwatan ma̱ wu shi, agba ko vu pati ujumu u wuma shi, amma she ugbozu nu urevu cine vaa yuwan tsugbain tsa ama a̱ va̱ aza a na n zuwa nuwu vo o'wo mogono me le, <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />adama o ndolo a ta ca wu ugbozu nu urevu. Agba waru n ta ca wu utsuru, ni ili yu ukere, na̱ tsugbain, aza a na babu mogono kafu a̱vu ma na ma̱ da̱na̱i na̱ cu'un le, na̱ waru a̱ca̱pa̱ babu mogono ma na ma̱a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />A̱vu Sulemanu ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Urishelima diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Gibiyon, diga uba̱ta̱ wo Oogodo o Uga'asusan. Reve u yuwan tsugono aciya aza a Isra'ila suru.<verse eid="2CH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utsuru wa̱ Sulemanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 10:26-29">1 Ngo 10:26-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />Sulemanu ɓoloto ta̱ ikeke yi ido ni ido ukpakukupa nu ukpakuna̱shi (1,400), ni ikeke yi ido ukpakukupa kupa nu ukpakukupa ure (12,000), aza a na u zuwai e ilyuci yi ikeke yi ido i na o foɓoi ozo o ro waru oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" />Mogono ma zuwa ta̱ azurufa na̱ zinariya mo o'wo pere a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima tsa atali. Ne ɗa waru wu shuwa̱i ɗanga sida, reve a bala ununa vu revei ɗanga vu ubiri a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i mugaɗi ma Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" />A̱vu Sulemanu zuwa a̱ ta̱wa̱ ni ido diga e iɗa ya Masar a̱ tyo Kuwe. A̱vu azagbain o ukobu u mogono a tsulusa le diga Kuwe<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">U.Wl 17:16</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Agba waru u zuwa ta̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ ni ikeke yi ido diga e iɗa ya Masar, za ta̱ suru azurufa ukpaku kupota̱li (600), ni ido azurufa ukpaku uta̱ na̱ kupoton (150). Agba waru a̱ tsu winasa le ta̱ e ekere a̱za̱ a̱ tsugono tsa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Hitiya na aza a Suriya.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="s">Ifoɓi adama o usaa wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 5:1-18">1 Ngo 5:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />Sulemanu ca ta̱ udammu adama a na a suwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa adama Aala A̱sulazuva nu ukobu u mogono adama aciya̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" />U ɗangula ta̱ ama ukpakukupa kupocindere (70,000) aza a na a̱ tsu purusa̱ itana, nu ukpakukupa kupakunla̱ (80,000) aza a na a tsu oɓoso aatali a agaɗi, na ama ukpakukupa uta'atsu na̱ ukpakuta̱li (3,600) aza a na a̱da̱na̱ a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ ulinga u le.<verse eid="2CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" />Sulemanu lyungu ta̱ ni ikaka i nda uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Hiram mogono ma Taya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 2:3">&lt;&lt; Lyunguwa̱a̱ mu na̱ ɗanga Sida ununa vu yuwayin Dada va̱ Da̱wuda na vu lyunguwa̱ niyi na̱ Seda na u suwai ukobu u na u da̱nuyi. <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" />Amma gogo a̱mu ɗa nda e ifoɓi adama a na ma suwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa adama Aala A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱, waru n tawai adama o ukula̱tosu wi ili i ma̱guru na adama a na a zuwa opopofu a na a tawai kuci, nu ucasu kucci vu ukula̱tosu suru vu usana nu ulivu nu urana wa ashibi na̱ a̱buki o woto u sa'avu na̱ a̱buki a na a zuwai a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱tsu. A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ili i na a zuwayi aza a Isra'ila na ri n yuwusan hali hali.<verse eid="2CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" />&lt;&lt;A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a na ma suwa u ta̱ da̱na̱ mgbain, adama a na A̱sula̱ a̱tsu a la'a ta̱ akapi a̱ musula̱ suru. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" />Amma zane ɗa rawai na wa suwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa adama a̱yi, a̱yi na zuva va zuva gura tara niyi shi! A̱mu za ne ɗa na ma gura suwaa yi A̱a̱'isamapaɗa, she de uba̱ta̱ u na a̱da̱na̱ a̱ kula̱tosu kucci elime a̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" />&lt;&lt;Adama o ndolo lyawa na va̱a̱ lyunguwa̱ mu na̱ vuma na gurai ulinga u zinariya na̱ azurufa, na̱ rumushili ni irumu nu ushili u ma̱ɗiya̱ nu ushili u san na̱ a̱punda̱ a̱ mini ma̱ bulu na̱ za na waru gurai cu'un vu ulinga yi she'en shi, a na wa yuwan ulinga a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda a̱ Urishelima oɓolo na ama a̱ va̱ na a gurai ulinga, aza a na Dada va̱ Da̱wuda foɓoi.<verse eid="2CH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8" />&lt;&lt;Reve waru vu lyunguwa̱ mu na akpata a sida, na aza a fir, na aza algumu diga a Lebanon, adama a na n reve ta̱ na ama a̱ wu a gura ta̱ mapaɗa ma akpata ɗe uba̱ta̱'a̱. Agbashi a̱ va̱ a ta yuwan ulinga oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ wu, <verse eid="2CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:9" />na o ɓolotowo mu akpata a̱bunda̱, adama a na A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a na n cigai n suwa u ta̱ da̱na̱ mgbain na asalama lon. <verse eid="2CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />N ta tsupa agbashi a̱ wu, aza na a paɗasa akpata, ukunzuwu ukpakukupa ushin (20,000) vi ishina, nu ukunzuwu ukpakukupa ushin (20,000) u yitabo, nu ukpakukupa ushin (20,000) wu ndele n mini ma̱ ina̱bi, nu ukpakukupa ushin (20,000) wu ndele n mani'in ma̱ zetun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />A̱vu Hiram mogono ma Taya lyunguwa̱a̱ Sulemanu nu usuwu u mepepelime, u damma, &lt;&lt;Adama a na A̱sulazuva a ciga ta̱ ama a̱yi, ɗaɗa u ɗangula nuwu mogono me le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />A̱vu Hiram dammisa, ica za va A̱sulazuva ɗa, A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, za na yuwain zuva ni iɗa! Waru u ca ta̱ Mogono Da̱wuda ulobo wu ugbozu, za va aaci, nu urevu, za na a suwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa adama A̱sulazuva nu ukobu adama aciya̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />&lt;&lt;N ta̱ lyunguwa̱a̱ wu na̱ Huram Abi, vuma na gurai ulinga wu ukere lon, <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" />za na mma va̱ yi diga o ugundo wa Dan ɗa, dada va yi vuma va Taya ɗa. U gura ta̱ ulinga na̱ zinariya na̱ azurufa na̱ rumushili na̱ rumu na aatali na akpata na̱ ushili u ma̱ɗiya̱ na̱ mini ma̱ bulu nu ushili san no okoro a sa'ani, waru u gura ta̱ cu'un vu ulinga vu ushe'en biti na a zuwa niyi na we she'en, u ta yuwan ulinga na̱ a̱za̱ o uguru wa̱ wu na aza a dada va̱ wu zagbain va̱ Da̱wuda.<verse eid="2CH 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />&lt;&lt;Gogo lyawa zagbain va̱ lyunguwa̱a̱ agbashi a̱yi no oroci a yitabo na̱ yitabo oɓolo na̱ mani'i ma̱ zetun na̱ mini ma̱ inabi ma na vu yuwain nzuwulai. <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" />A̱tsu waru tsu ta paɗa akpata diga a Lebanon aza na vu cigai suru reve tsu ta̱wa̱to le nge'en m mala ma Japa. A̱vu vu tara le agawan a̱ tyo Urishelima.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" />Sulemanu kece ta̱ omocin a na a̱ da̱na̱i a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila suru, ununa Dada va̱ yi Da̱wuda yuwain, agba a rawa ta̱ a̱bunda̱ ama ukpakukupa ukpaku nu ukpakukupa kupoton na aza ata'atsu nu ukpakuta̱li (153,600). <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" />A̱vu u zuwa ama ukpakukupa kupocindere (70,000) o o'wo a̱za̱ e itana, ama ukpakukupa kupakunla̱ (80,000) o o'wo a̱za̱ she'en va atali a masasan, na ama ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpakuta̱li (3,600) na a̱da̱na̱ a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ aza na a yuwusan ulinga adama a yuwan ulinga.<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="s">Sulemanu teme ta̱ usaa wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />A̱vu Sulemanu teme usaa wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a Masasan ma Moriya, uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva o rocoyi aciya̱yi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Da̱wuda. Uba̱ta̱ wo osoroto a Aruna vuma va Jebusiya, uba̱ta̱ u na Da̱wuda foɓoi. <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />Reve u reme usaa o urana we ire u woto we ire a'wan a̱ na̱shi o tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" />A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a na Sulemanu suwayi A̱sulazuva washin wa̱ yi u rawa ta̱ uga'an mishin udasu kupa kucci na̱ washin udasu mata'atsu. <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Ukobu u na u ri lo elime a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a una̱ta̱ ɗa na̱ washin wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a udasuwu ushin waru uga'an wa̱ yi mishin udasuwu ukpaku nu ushin.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 3:4">A̱vu u sura suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱yi na̱ zinariya can. <verse eid="2CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" />A̱vu u ku'wa̱ asula a gbain na akpata a fir, a̱vu u sura le na̱ zinariya can. Reve u yuwan yironishi yo oroci aɗanga vu shuwa na akani ɗe. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />A̱vu wu kala A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a na atali e ikebe. Waru zinariya na u yuwayin ulinga zinariya va Farwayim ɗa. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />U sura ta̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a na̱ zinariya na akpata a na a̱ kuruyi zuva na akpata a̱ na̱ntsu na̱ na̱ntsu va̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa, a̱vu a yuwan yironishi i nan Kerobobi o ɓaɓu'u.<verse eid="2CH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />U suwa ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u na u la'ai Akiza una̱ta̱ na̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a, uga'an wa̱ yi udasuwu mata'atsu washin wa̱ yi waru udasuwu mata'atsu. A̱vu u sura a̱tsuma̱ a̱yi nu ukpakuta̱li (600) u zinariya can. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" />Ume wi ikusa i zinariya u rawa ta̱ kilo ukpakuton na̱ kupocindere (570). Waru u sura ta̱ asula a zuva na̱ zinariya can.<verse eid="2CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />Sulemanu she'en ta̱ oroci e ikerobobi e re vu ɗanga, a̱vu sura le na̱ zinariya can reve u zuwa le Uba̱ta̱ u na u La'ai Akiza. <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11" />Uga'an wa̱ evelu e kerobobi e re'e, n na̱ a̱ buba̱ruwa̱ le a ta rawa udasu mata'atsu, adama a na suru uvelu uta̱ u kerobobi u rawa ta̱ udasuwu ucindere na akapi. A̱vu kerobi vu ufaru'u u buba̱ruwa̱ uvelu uta̱ wa̱ yi u ju'wa̱n uɓaɓu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a na̱ yi, reve u buba̱ruwisa̱n uvelu wa̱ i re u ju'wa̱n uvelu wu za va̱ yi. <verse eid="2CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 3:12" />Ne ɗa waru kerobi va̱ re'e wu ba̱ruwa̱i uvelu uta̱ wa̱ yi u ju'wa̱in za va̱ yi na̱ yi, reve wu buba̱ruwisa̱n uvelu wa̱ i re u ju'wa̱n uɓaɓu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa. Uga'an wu uvelu biti udasuwu ucindere u ɗa na akapi. <verse eid="2CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:13" />Uga'an we evelu e ikerobobi o ndolo na̱ a̱ ba̱ruwa̱ le a ta rawa udasuwu mata'atsu. A̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ mishin a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ aasula a gbain.<verse eid="2CH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" />U yuwan ta̱ apalutsu adama o uba̱ta̱ u na u la'ai akiza a̱ mini ma̱ bulu na̱ za vu ushili u mini u ma̱ɗiya̱ na̱ za shili san no okoro a sa'ani, reve a yuwan yironishi yo oroci e ikerobobi zuva va̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atsura e re a̱ rumushili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />Elime A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a u yuwan ta̱ lo atsura e re, ele ra a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ udasuwu ushin na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ cindere, waru atsura suru a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ ta̱ eegbezu a na a rawai udasuwu ucindere na akapi. <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />U yuwaan ta̱ eegbezu atsura biti yikalishi ya akani za na u ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i eegbezu atsura'a. Waru u yuwan ta̱ oroci o uɗanga u muwun m peme ukpaku ukaɓulai zuva va akani'i. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" />A̱vu u shuwa̱ atsura'a eleme a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a, za ta̱ a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ uyagi za ta̱ waru ugana. Za na ri a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ uyagi u ɗe yi ta̱ Yakin za vu upasu wu ugana waru Buwaza.<verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="s">Itana adama a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 7:23-51">1 Ngo 7:23-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />Mogono Sulemanu yuwan ta̱ masa'a ma̱ rumushili, za na uga'an wa̱ yi u rawai udasuwu mata'atsu, washin wa̱ yi waru udasuwu mata'atsu, mishin ma̱ yi waru udasuwu kupa no ozo o ton. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" />A̱vu u yuwan a̱ba̱jini o ura'atsu adama a na a zuwa mini za na u zuɗa̱i na̱ rumushili, za na e ɗesu Mala. A̱ru'un a̱yi a rawa ta̱ udasuwu ucindere na akapi, washin wa̱ yi waru udasuwu kupa no ozo o ton. Oɓolo na amunga a na a rawai udasuwu amunga no ozo o ton na a gura ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ una̱ wu ura'atsu'u. <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ za̱la̱ vu ura'atsu'u u da̱na̱ ta̱ nu uzuɗu wu yo oroci e inan a̱ rumushili ugeru u re, uga'an wu yo oroci a nan suru u rawa ta̱ udasuwu kupa no ozo o ton, eɓele a̱ ta̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱li eɓele a̱ ta̱ waru a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱li. A̱ jeruwe to ta̱ rumushili'i a̱vu a̱ zuɗa̱ yi uɓolu na̱ a̱ba̱jini o ura'atsu'u.<verse eid="2CH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />A zuwa ta̱ a̱ba̱jini o ura'atsu'u zuva vo oroci o ogono e inan kupa ne ejere. Urewesu wo ogono e ina'an a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ alanga. Urewesu wo ogono e inan ata'atsu a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ upasu wa asana, aza a ta'atsu waru a̱a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ upasu wa̱ a̱livu, aza a ta'atsu waru a̱a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ upasu wu uyagi, aza ata'atsu waru a̱a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ upasu wu ugana. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />Ugba̱mu wu nge'en wa̱ a̱ba̱jini o ura'atsu'u udasuwu u ta'atsu u ɗa, agba a̱ba̱jini o ura'atsu'u u ta gura tara a̱bunda̱ aakpatalutsu a̱ mini ukpakukupa kupota̱li (60,000). Una̱ wu ura'atsu'u urotsu ta̱ una̱ u mokkoto ko oroci a̱ yipa̱lu a na o ɓosoi.<verse eid="2CH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" />A̱vu u yuwan a̱ba̱jini aakpatalutsu adama a na a̱da̱na̱ a yuwusan wuza̱'u, a̱vu u zuwa ozo o ton upasu wu uyagi, ozo o ton o ndolo waru upasu wu ugana. A̱ tsu eleleceshe ta̱ itana i na a yuwayin kucci vu ukula̱tosu ne le a̱tsuma̱ akpatalutsu'u. Amma a̱ba̱jini o ura'atsu a na a̱ tsu ɗe Mala, nan ganu ɗa goon a yuwan ulinga na̱ yi adama o usumbu.<verse eid="2CH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />A̱vu u yuwan wisawatan kupa a zinariya na a̱ guza̱ ifitila ununa o foɓoi. A̱vu waru u zuwa le pe a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa, upasu wu uyagi u zuwa ta̱ ozo o ton, upasu wu ugana waru u zuwa ta̱ ɗe ozo o ton.<verse eid="2CH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" />A̱vu waru u yuwan apada kupa na u zuwai pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa. A̱vu u zuwa ozo o ton upasu wu uyagi, ozo o ton waru upasu wu ugana. A̱vu waru u yuwan a̱ba̱jini ara'atsu ukpaku a zinariya.<verse eid="2CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" />U yuwan ta̱ uba̱ta̱ a damma a nan ganu, oɓolo na̱ a̱ba̱jini o uba̱ta̱ u ro, oɓolo na̱ na̱ntsu na va uwa pe uba̱ta̱'a̱. Reve u sura na̱ntsu'u ni irumushili. <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" />A̱vu u zuwa a̱ba̱jini o ura'atsu u na a̱ tsu ɗe Mala'a u pasu wu uyagi a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ asana a̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa.<verse eid="2CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />Huram yuwan ta̱ mpondo, na̱ a̱ sheburu na̱ ntaɗa adama wu kyo'onusu. Ne ɗa Huram kotoi ulinga u na Mogono Sulemanu zuwa niyi u yuwan suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />Apa ili i na u yuwain:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">Atsura e re,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">na̱ eegbezu aza a na a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱i tsu ura'atsu zuva va atsura'a,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:12">na̱ re e re na a kalai va akani zuva va̱ eegbezu na a̱ ri zuva va atsura'a,<verse eid="2CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" />ni yironishi yo oroci a̱ muwun mu ɗanga m peme ukpakuna̱shi (400), ugeru biti u da̱na̱ ta̱ nu ukpaku, nu ugeru u re zuva va atsura biti.<verse eid="2CH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" />Waru u yuwan ta̱ wisawatan na̱ a̱bunda̱, wisawatan suru na aakpatalutsu a̱yi,<verse eid="2CH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />na̱ Mala ma̱ ta̱ adama a na a̱ tsu mini, no oroci ogono e inan kupa ne ejere aza na a̱ guzusa̱ a̱ba̱jini o ura'atsu'u.<verse eid="2CH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" />Na̱ npondo ni isheburu ni ikune ya akatsu adama o ulinga wi inama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:16">Suru itana i na Huram Abi yuwayin Mogono Sulemanu adama A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva u yuwan ta̱ ulinga ni irumushili na o gboroi. <verse eid="2CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Agalaci a na a̱ da̱na̱i zuzu nu upasu wu Uɗolu wa̱ Urudu, memere ma Sukot na̱ Zereda, Mogono ma zuwa ta̱ na a̱ tsu pe irumu i na a̱ ejejeruwetoyi a̱tsuma̱ olo'o a na o foɓoi adama a na a̱ zuɗa̱ itana'a. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" />Sulemanu yuwan ta̱ itana lon hali na a gura reve a̱bunda̱ o ume wi irumushili'i shi.<verse eid="2CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Sulemanu yuwan ta̱ suru itana i na a zuwai a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 4:19" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:19">masa'a ma zinariya</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 4:19">na apada e izuwa yo opopofu na a tawai,<verse eid="2CH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />Na̱ wisawatan na a̱ guza̱ ifitila suru i zinariya can adama a na a ca ekan uba̱ta̱ u na u La'ai Akiza ununa u na u foɓoi.<verse eid="2CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />Na̱ wukalu u yironishi i yipa̱lu i zinariya ni ifitila ni ili i na e kene akinkina akina aza na a yuwain na̱ zinariya can,<verse eid="2CH 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />Ni ili i na a̱ kimusa̱ ifitila na̱ a̱ba̱jini ara'atsu na̱ mupondo na̱ ntaɗa n na a̱ guza̱ ili i ma̱guru za na a yuwain na̱ zinariya can nu uwata wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva, nu una̱ntsu wu uba̱ta̱ wa akiza nu una̱ntsu vu uba̱ta̱ u na u La'ai Akiza, oɓolo na̱ za va asula a A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva, aza a na a surai na̱ zinariya can.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />Ana Sulemanu kotoi ulinga wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva suru, reve u ta̱wa̱a̱ pe ni itana i na dada va̱ yi Da̱wuda tawai, reve u ta̱wa̱ na̱ zinariya na̱ azurufa na̱ suru itana yu ulinga u zuwa le a̱tsuma̱ asula e izuwa ya̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱.<verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ na Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />A̱vu Sulemanu zuwa mbara ma Isra'ila na azagbain o gundo, na azagbain a 'wa vu nkaya va aza a Isra'ila na oɓoloto uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, na a̱ ta̱wa̱ na Akpati a Nzuwulai A̱sulazuva diga a̱ lyuci va Da̱wuda za na a̱yi ɗa Sihiyona. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" />A̱vu a ama a Isra'ila oɓoloto uba̱ta̱ mogono Sulemanu a mantsa ma na a yuwan A̱buki o Ogodo o Ucuwusan o woto wa̱ cindere.<verse eid="2CH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4" />A mantsa ma na mbara ma Isra'ila n rawai suru, a̱vu nan Levi a tara Akpati a Nzuwulai'i. <verse eid="2CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:5" />A̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ niyi a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva. Reve nan ganu na̱ nan Levi a tara Oogodo o Uga'asusan, oɓolo na̱ ntaɗa n na tawai na ri pe a̱tsuma̱ Oogodo'o, a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ ne le a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />Mogono Sulemanu oɓolo na ama a Isra'ila suru aza a na o ɓolotoi elime a Akpati a Nzuwulai A̱sulazuva, a̱vu a casu kucci vi ikyon ni inan ya̱ a̱bunda̱, na a gura kece le shi ko na a kurato le shi.<verse eid="2CH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />A̱vu nan ganu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ na̱ Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱ A̱sulazuva'a pe pe Uba̱ta̱ u na u La'ai Akiza, reve a zuwai uba̱ta̱ wu nden ma̱ yi za̱la̱ ve evelu e ikerobobi e re o ndolo. <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Evelu e ikerobobi'i na a̱ ba̱ruwa̱i a̱vu a̱ ɓa̱ru uba̱ta̱ u na a zuwai Akpati'i oɓolo na aɗanga na a tanusa le. <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" />Aɗanga'a a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ uga'an lon, hali na va cinkaya le diga elime o uba̱ta̱ u na u ri na Akiza. Amma diga alanga va gura ene le shi, hali n gogo a buwa ta̱ pe. <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" />Ili i ro i da̱na̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ Akpati'i shi, amma she aɓaci a atali e re aza a na Musa zuwai pe a̱tsuma̱ yi ɗe Horeb, uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva a yuwain nzuwulai na ama a Isra'ila a mantsa ma na o uta̱i a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Masar.<verse eid="2CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" />Avu nan ganu o uta̱ pe diga uba̱ta̱ u na u ri na Akiza. Agba nan ganu a na o ɓolotoi suru o o'wo ta̱ ɗe na Akiza, ko na wo o'woi a̱da̱na̱ oɓolo oɓolo shi. <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" />A̱vu nan Levi na a̱ da̱na̱i ashipi suru, Asaf na̱ Heman na̱ Yedutun oɓolo na̱ muwun nle ni imaci i le a̱vu oto a̱tugu a na a yuwain no okoro a sa'ani. Reve e isawan asana na̱ masa'a'a a lapusa nyangi ni ikumburu na̱ igaraya. Waru a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ nan ganu ukpaku nu ushin (120) aza a na e ivulusa̱ avana. <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" />A̱vu a̱za̱ a̱ wivulu wa avana na ashipi a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n uɗyo u le una̱ta̱ a yuwusan ica nu ugodyusho uba̱ta̱ A̱sulazuva. Reve a canasa ishipa a mantsa ma na akapi'i e ivulusa̱ avana waru a lapusa nyangi na lapusai akapi e itana i tsuwe'e. Reve a cuwa A̱sulazuva ni ishipa i na ya dansa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 5:13">&lt;&lt;U tu ulobonu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 5:13">icigi ya̱ yi i ri nu ukotu shi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 5:13">A̱vu A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva a shiwan ne eleshe. <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" />Hali na nan ganu a gura yuwan ulinga u le shi, adama a na tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva a shiwan ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱.<verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="s">Sulemanu zuwaa ta̱ ama aba'un</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:12-21">1 Ngo 8:12-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />A̱vu Sulemanu damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ u ta̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu pici, <verse eid="2CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />agba gogo n suwa ta̱ a̱ba̱jini A̱a̱'isamapaɗa adama a̱ wu, uba̱ta̱ u na va̱ da̱nu hali hali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />A mantsa ma na oɓolo a ama a Isra'ila a̱ da̱na̱i lo mishin uba̱ta̱'a̱, a̱vu mogono ma vadala a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ le a̱vu u zuwaa le una̱ wa aba'un.<verse eid="2CH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" />A̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Ica za va̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa, A̱sula̱ aza a Isra'ila, za na nu ukere wa̱ yi u ɗa u shitoyin nzuwulai na u yuwain nu una̱ wa̱ yi e ekere a dada va̱ Da̱wuda, adansa, <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />&lt;Diga a mantsa ma na mu uta̱yi ama a̱ va̱ diga a Masar, n ɗangula lyuci diga a̱tsuma̱ o gundo va aza a Isra'ila adama a na a suwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa adama a ala a̱ va̱ a̱da̱na̱ ɗe shi, ko n ɗangula zagbain na a yuwan tsugono tsa a ama va̱ Isra'ila shi. <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" />Amma gogo n ɗangula ta̱ Urishelima uba̱ta̱ u na Aala a̱ va̱ a̱da̱na̱ ɗe, agba n ɗangula ta̱ Da̱wuda na wa yuwan tsugono tsa a ama a̱ va̱ aza a Isra'ila.&gt;<verse eid="2CH 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" />&lt;&lt;Gogo gba dada va̱ Da̱wuda da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ majiyan Ookolo a̱yi na wa suwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa adama Aala A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />Amma a̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma dada va̱ Da̱wuda, &lt;U tu ulobonu na vu foɓoi okolo a̱ wu na va suwaa mu A̱a̱'isamapaɗa adama a na a ca Aala a̱ va̱ tsugbain. <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />Suru na̱ ne, a̱vu ɗa za na a suwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a shi, amma ulobo wa̱ wu u ɗa, za na ri mpasa na̱ lipu va̱ wu za na a suwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa adama Aala a̱ va̱.&gt;<verse eid="2CH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />&lt;&lt;Gogo A̱sulazuva o shiton ta̱ nzuwulai n na u yuwain. Ana'an mo o'wo ta̱ mogono o una̱ wa Da̱wuda dada va̱ waru gogo n da̱nu ta̱ ootogu o tsugono tsa aza a Isra'ila, ununa A̱sulazuva a yuwain nzuwulai, waru n suwa ta̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa adama Aala a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" />Ɗe ɗa n zuwai Akpati nzuwulai za na A̱sulazuva a yuwain na ama a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Avasa a Sulemanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:22-53">1 Ngo 8:22-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Reve Sulemanu isawan elime masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva elime ama a Isra'ila suru, a̱vu u canana ukere wa̱ yi zuva. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" />Adama a na Sulemanu yuwan ta̱ ɗe uba̱ta̱ u ro u na a̱ tsu isawusan na̱ rumushili, udasuwu uton uga'an, nu udasuwu uton washin, a̱vu u zuwai alanga e memere mo ukowo'o. Reve wi isawan aciya uba̱ta̱'a̱ a̱vu u kingyo elime ama a Isra'ila suru a̱vu u canana e ekere yi a̱ tyo zuva. <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />A̱vu u yuwan avasa u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, babu lo A̱sula̱ tsa̱ wu ɗe zuva ko o uvaɗi, a̱vu za na tsu shitosun nzuwulai mi icigi ya̱ wu uba̱ta̱ wa agbashi a̱ wu za na yuwain mmalu o ure wa̱ wu no okolo a̱ ta̱. <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" />Avu ɗa vu shitoyin nzuwulai n na vu yuwain na̱ dada va̱ Da̱wuda aagbashi a̱ wu, za na vu dammai nu una̱ wa̱ wu na vu shitoyin ne e ekere wu cine u ri ana'an.<verse eid="2CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" />&lt;&lt;Gogo A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, lyawa vu shiton nzuwulai n na vu yuwain na̱ dada va̱ Da̱wuda na vu dammai, &lt;Va lamba to vuma na aa yuwan tsugono elime wu o Ootogu aza a Isra'ila shi, n na̱ olobo wu a yuwan ugbozu a̱tsuma̱ ili i na a yuwusan na a yuwan mmalu elime a̱ va̱ ununa wila̱ u va̱ u dammai, ununa a̱vu vu yuwain.&gt; <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />Amma gogo, A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, lyawa nzuwulai n na vu yuwayin aagbashi a̱ wu Da̱wuda wo o'wo amayun.<verse eid="2CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />&lt;&lt;Amma amayun a ɗa na A̱sula̱ a̱ da̱nu oɓolo na ama o uvaɗi? Agba waru zuva ɗe zuva rawa wu shi. Hali n na va dama adama A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a na n suwai nda! O'o u rawa ili i shi! <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" />Na̱ ne suru, vu uwwa mesun na avasa a na agbashi a̱ wu a yuwan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱, vu zuwa atsuvu a̱ wu uba̱ta̱ wa avasa a na aagbashi a̱ wu a yuwan elime a̱ wu. <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" />Lyawa esu a̱ wu a̱da̱na̱ ukpa̱tu'u usana na ayin uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a nda, uba̱ta̱ u na vu zuwai na a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ adama Aala a̱ wu. Lyawa na va uwwa avasa a na aagbashi a̱ wu a yuwan uba̱ta̱ u nda. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Lyawa na va uwwa ipati ya aagbashi a̱ wu oɓolo na aza ama a̱ wu Isra'ila a mantsa ma na a yuwan avasa a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ uba̱ta̱ u nda. Vu uwwa diga zuva, uba̱ta̱ wu nden ma̱ wu, waru a mantsa ma na vu uwwai, a̱vu vu yuwan le gafura.<verse eid="2CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />&lt;&lt;N na̱ vuma ro yuwaan moron ma̱ nden ma̱ yi unusu a̱vu a zuwai na wa tara akucunu reve u ta̱wa̱ u tara akucunu elime a masa'a ma̱ wu a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa, <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />reve vu uwwa diga zuva vu ge'eto agbashi a̱ wu. Vu ge'eto za vu unusu, waru vu zuwa za vu unusu tara unusu adama aciya̱yi. Vu roco za va̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱yi za babu unusu ɗa o una̱ wa amayun a̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na ama a̱ wu Isra'ila n'yuwatan nle n lyuwa nle nu uvon, adama a na a yuwaan nuwu unusu a mantsa ma na a̱ ka̱mba̱i a̱vu a cuwa Aala a̱ wu, a yuwusan avasa ni ipati elime a̱ wu a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a nda, <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />reve vu uwwa le diga zuva a̱vu vu yuwaan ama a̱ wu Isra'ila gafura vu unusu u le reve vu ka̱mbuwa̱ le a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na vu ca nle, ele na̱ nkaya nle.<verse eid="2CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na zuva ɓa̱ruyi agba a yuwan iro'i shi adama a na ama a̱ wu a yuwaan nuwu unusu, reve a yuwan avasa a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ uba̱ta̱ u nda a̱vu a cuwa Aala a̱ wu a̱vu a avadala diga uba̱ta̱ wu unusu u le adama a na vu ge'eto nle, <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />a̱vu vu uwwa diga zuva vu yuwaan agbashi wu ama a Isra'ila gafura vu unusu ule. Vu roco le u re u wuma u sa'ani u na otoni, vu lyungu na̱ mini e iɗa i na vu cayi ama a̱ wu adama a agadu.<verse eid="2CH 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />&lt;&lt;Mantsa ma na ambulu ko mɓa̱la̱ n uwai e iɗa, ko mu upa̱luwusa̱ ko va akpala ko akyun ko apapari, ko gba shi mantsa ma na n'yuwatan n ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ nle nu uvon a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci le, meleshe ko mɓa̱la̱ n ne n ɗa ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱, <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />n na̱ vuma ta̱ ko ama suru a yuwan avasa ko ipati, ko adama a na a gura revei ili i na ya damatosun le hali na a̱ 'ya̱susa̱a̱n ekere le a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a, <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />a̱vu vu uwwa le diga zuva, uba̱ta̱ wu nden ma̱ wu. Vu yuwan gafura, a̱vu vu tsupa suru za o una̱ wi ili i na u yuwain, adama a na vu revei okolo a̱ yi na wo o'woi a̱vu ɗa goon vu revei okolo a ama, <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />ne ɗa a uwwa wovon wa̱ wu a̱vu a yuwan mmalu a̱tsuma̱ o ure wa̱ wu a̱tsuma̱ a wuma u le suru a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na vu cayi nkaya ntsu.<verse eid="2CH 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />&lt;&lt;Ekere o mocin waru fo za na ri a̱tsuma̱ ama wu aza a Isra'ila shi, a̱vu u ta̱wa̱ diga e iɗa ya alanga adama a̱ba̱jini Aala a̱ wu nu ukere wu ucira wa̱ wu nnu u ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama a na wa yuwan avasa a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a nda, <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" />Vu uwwa yi diga zuva, uba̱ta̱ wu nden wa̱ wu, a̱vu vu yuwan ili i na moci'in u pati nuwu, adama a na ama o uvaɗi suru e reve Aala a̱ wu a̱vu a cuwa wa̱ wu, ununa aza a Isra'ila a cuwa nuwu, ne ɗa e reve a na u'wa u nda n suwai ta̱ na Aala a̱ wu.<verse eid="2CH 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na ama a̱ wu o uta̱i a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon na̱ n'yuwatan nle, uba̱ta̱ u na suru vu lyungu nle, na aa yuwan avasa a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ lyuci na vu ɗangulai na̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a na n suwai adama Aala a̱ wu, <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />vu uwwa avasa ni ipati i le diga zuva, a̱vu vu yuwan le ili i na yintsayi.<verse eid="2CH 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na a yuwaan nuwu unusu adama a na babu za na tsu yuwan wu unusu shi a̱vu vu yuwan upan ne le reve vu ca le ekere a n'yuwatan nle, aza a na atara nle a̱ tyo tsugbashi e iɗa ya alanga ko zuzu, <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />a mantsa ma na a yuwain majiyan a vadalai okolo ele a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na a tara nle a̱ tyo tsugbashi, a̱vu a vadala a pati wu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na a yuwusan tsugbashi a damma, &lt;Tsu yuwan ta̱ unusu, tsu yuwan wu mejege shi, tsu yuwan ta̱ iwuya,&gt; <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" />reve a vadala a̱ ka̱mba̱ ya̱'a̱ wu no okolo ele na asuvu ele suru suru pe e iɗa yi n'yuwatan nle n na m pura̱ nle a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ tsugbashi, reve gba a yuwan avasa a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ wu a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ iɗa i na vu cayi nkaya nle a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ lyuci na vu ɗangulai na̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a na n suwai adama a Ala a̱ wu, <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />lyawa diga zuva uba̱ta̱ wu nden ma̱ wu vu uwwa avasa le ni ipati i le, a̱vu vu yuwan le ili i na yintsayi. A̱vu vu yuwaan ama a̱ wu gafura, aza a na a yuwaan nuwu unusu.<verse eid="2CH 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />&lt;&lt;Gogo, A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱, lyawa esu a̱ wu a̱da̱na̱ ukpa̱tu'u a̱vu fo vu polo atsuvu a̱ wu uba̱ta̱ wa avasa a na a yuwusan uba̱ta̱ u nda.<verse eid="2CH 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />&lt;&lt;Vu 'yon gogo, A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 6:41">vu ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u wivuwun wa̱ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 6:41">a̱vu na Akpati o ucira wa̱ wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:41">A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 6:41">lyawa nan ganu a̱ wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 6:41">a̱da̱na̱ ni iwawi ya̱ wu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:41">lyawa aza a na a̱ ri e icigi ya̱ wu a yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 6:41">adama e isa'ani ya̱ wu.<verse eid="2CH 6:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 6:42">she vu vadalaa mogono ma na vu ɗangulai ucina̱ wan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 6:42">Vu cuwan ni icigi ya̱ wu i na i tsu vadala shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 6:42">na vu yuwayin aagbashi a̱ wu Da̱wuda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="s">Ucasu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 8:62-66">1 Ngo 8:62-66</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />Ana Sulemanu kotoi a yuwusan avasa, a̱vu akina o uta̱ diga zuva a̱vu ukuloto kucci vu ukula̱tosu oɓolo na akapi a̱ kucci, a̱vu tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva tsa̱ shiton A̱a̱'isamapaɗa. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" />Nan ganu a gura uwa pe a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva'a shi, adama a na tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva tsa̱ shiton ta̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" />Ana aza a Isra'ila suru enei akina a̱ cipusa̱ oɓolo na̱ tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva zuva va̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa, a̱vu a̱ kingyo nu urewesu u le a̱ tyo e iɗa, reve a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ nu ugodyusho uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, adansa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 7:3">&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva za vi isa'ani iɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 7:3">icigi ya̱ yi waru i tsu vadala shi hali hali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />A̱vu mogono oɓolo na akapi ama'a suru a ca kucci elime a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />A̱vu mogono Sulemanu ca kucci vi inan ukpakukupa ushin ne ejere (22,000), ni ikyon na̱ mgbele ukpakukupa ukpaku nu ukpakukupa ushin (120,000). A̱vu mogono oɓolo na ama suru a yuwan ucasu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sula̱. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" />A̱vu nan ganu e isawan uba̱ta̱ u na a zuwa nle, oɓolo na̱ nan Levi fo uba̱ta̱ u le uɓa̱nu ni itana yi ishipa ni itana i wivulu aza a na Mogono Da̱wuda foɓoi adama a na a lyuwa elime ni ishipa yu ugodyusho uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva adansa, &lt;&lt;Icigi ya̱ A̱sulazuva i tsu vadala shi hali hali.&gt;&gt; A̱vu a yuwan ishipa yi ica ya̱ A̱sulazuva oɓolo ni itana yi ishipa ununa Da̱wuda damma nle. Upasu u na u ri ya̱ a̱ka̱nla̱ a nan Levi, a̱vu nan ganu e isawan e ivula̱ avana, a mantsa ma na ama Isra'ila suru a̱da̱na̱i mishin.<verse eid="2CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />A̱vu mogono Sulemanu tawa memere mo ukowo elime a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, uba̱ta̱ u ɗaɗa u cayi kucci vu ukula̱tosu na abaji a mani'in a̱ kucci muwwulai, u yuwan ta̱ ne adama a na masa'a ma̱ rumushili na u yuwain u ka̱la̱ma̱ ta̱, u gura tara a̱bunda̱ a̱ kucci'i shi, na̱ za vi ishina na̱ za va abaji e iliyamunga.<verse eid="2CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Sulemanu zuwa ta̱ a yuwan rana cindere a yuwusan a̱buki. A̱vu ama a Isra'ila suru oɓoloto, a̱ba̱jini e iɓolo i ɗa lon. Waru ama a̱ ta̱wa̱ diga e iɗa ya alanga, diga o upasu u ma uwa ma Hamat wu ugana wi iɗa'a a̱ tyo o ukosu wu ka̱ri wi iɗa ya Masar wa̱ a̱livu. <verse eid="2CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" />O urana wa kunla̱ a̱vu a yuwan iɓolo i gbain, adama a na a yuwan ta̱ ɗe rana cindere a yuwusan a̱buki o ucasu u masa'a. Reve waru a̱da̱shi yuwisan rana cindere ro a yuwusan a̱buki. <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />A̱tsuma̱ o urana wu ushin na aza ata'atsu a̱tsuma̱ o woto wa̱ cindere, a̱vu u lyawa ama a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo a 'wa le, a̱vu ama'a a̱ ka̱ra̱ na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ mere a̱tsuma̱ okolo ele adama e isa'ani i na A̱sulazuva o rocoyi Da̱wuda na̱ Sulemanu, oɓolo na ama a̱yi Isra'ila.<verse eid="2CH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva o roco ta̱ aciya̱yi ya̱ Sulemanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 9:1-9">2 Ngo 9:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" />Ne ɗa Sulemanu kotoi masuwa ma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva oɓolo nu ukobu u mogono. Suru a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na Sulemanu foɓoi na wa yuwan a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva oɓolo nu ukobu wa̱ yi u tsura̱ ta̱ ulyuwu we elime. <verse eid="2CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱da̱shi rocowiso aciya̱yi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Sulemanu na ayin u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Mu uwwa ta̱ avasa a̱ wu, waru n ɗangula ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u nda adama aciya̱va̱, na wo o'wo uba̱ta̱ u na a̱da̱na̱ a yuwusan mu kucci.<verse eid="2CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na n ɓa̱ruyi zuva na aa yuwan mini shi, ko na̱ nlyungu na apapari a̱ lungusa̱ itana yu una, ko na̱ nlyungu mɓa̱la̱ a̱tsuma̱ ama a̱ va̱, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" />n na̱ ama a̱ va̱ na e ɗesu le na̱ aala a̱ va̱ a tara aciyele ili i ro shi, a̱vu a yuwan avasa a zami urewesu u va̱, a̱vu a vadala aa lyawa ure wi iwuya i le, n ta uwwa le diga ɗe zuva, a̱vu n yuwaan le gafura vu unusu u le, a̱vu waru n ca iɗa i le lafiya. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" />N ta zuwa esu e isa'ani i va̱ uba̱ta̱ u nda, waru n zuwa atsuvu avasa a na a yuwusan suru A̱a̱'isamapaɗa ma nda. <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />Adama a na n ɗangula ta̱ reve n tawa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a nda tsura̱ Aala a̱ va̱ a̱tsura̱ tsugbain uba̱ta̱'a̱ hali hali. Esu a̱ va̱ no okolo a̱ va̱ a̱da̱na̱ uba̱ta̱'a̱ mantsa suru.<verse eid="2CH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />&lt;&lt;Amma adama aɗa a̱ wu gba, n na̱ vu yuwan mmalu elime a̱ va̱ cine Dada va wu Da̱wuda yuwain, a̱vu waru vu yuwan i li i na n damma nuwu suru, a̱vu vu yuwan tsutoni nu udammu u va̱ na̱ wila̱ u va̱, <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" />to, n ta̱ shuwa̱ tsugono tsa̱ a̱ wu tsa lyuwa elime, ununa n yuwain Nzuwulai na̱ Da̱wuda dada va̱ wu na n dammai, &lt;Vaa lamba nanza diga a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wa̱ wu na a yuwan tsugono a aci aza a Isra'ila shi.&gt;<verse eid="2CH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />&lt;&lt;Amma n na̱ i vadala a̱vu i lyawa tsutoni nu udammu u va̱ ni ili i na n zuwaa n ɗu, a̱vu i 'ya̱wa̱ i yuwaan musula̱ n ro a̱ga̱nda̱, <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" />adama o ndolo n ta tawa Isra'ila diga a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i va̱, za na n ca nɗu, a̱vu waru n 'yuwan A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a na n tawai adama Aala a̱ va̱. Reve mo o'woto yi ili i tsuzo'o ni ili ya adanshi e ekere a ama suru. <verse eid="2CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" />Ko na wo o'woi A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a nda wo o'wo ta̱ ili ya̱ a̱ka̱nla̱, a̱ tyo elime suru za na a̱ ka̱ra̱ lo ta damma, &lt;Nye zuwai A̱sulazuva a yuwain tsundolo ni iɗa i nda? Oɓolo na̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱yi?&gt; <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Ama a̱ta̱ usu le a̱vu a damma, &lt;Adama a na a vadalaa ta̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya nle za na uta̱ nle diga e iɗa ya Masar ucina̱. A̱vu avadala aa yuwusaan musula̱ n ro a̱ga̱nda̱. Adama o ndolo a ɗa A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱yi na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ aciyele.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="s">Linga ro na Sulemanu yuwain</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 9:10-28">1 Ngo 9:10-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />U tara ta̱ Sulemanu a'wan ushin na u suwai A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva oɓolo nu ukobu wa̱ yi, <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />Sulemanu da̱shi ta̱ suwisa ilyuci i na Huram ca niyi. A̱vu u zuwa pe ama a Isra'ila a̱ da̱nu pe. <verse eid="2CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />A mantsa mo ndolo ma ɗa Sulemanu yuwain uvon na̱ lyuci va Hamat Zoba a̱vu u usai. <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" />A̱vu u da̱shi suwa lyuci va Tadmo za na ri a̱tsumona, na̱ suru ilyuci yi izuwa yu upasu wa Hamat. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />A̱vu u da̱shi suwa ilyuci ya Bet Horon vo Gon na̱ Bet Horon va̱ Za̱la̱ reve wo o'woto le ilyuci yu ukari vu ucira. A̱vu u suwaa le na̱ntsu gbain na a̱ tsu katsu ni irumu. <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />Sulemanu suwa ta̱ lyuci va Ba'ala ni ilyuci yi izuwa na̱ za na a yuwan aguɓa e ido ya̱ yi oɓolo na̱ za vi izuwa yi ikeke yi ido yu uvon ya̱ yi. Waru Sulemanu suwa ta̱ suru ili i na u foɓoi na wa suwa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima na̱ Lebanon nu ukosu wu upasu u tsugono tsa̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" />Ama a na a buwai suru aza a Hitiya na̱ Amoriya na̱ Periziya na̱ Hiviya na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Jebusiya aza a Isra'ila ɗa shi, <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" />ele gundo u na u buwai a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a aza na aza a Isra'ila o kototoi shi, ele ɗa aza a na Sulemanu zuwai ulinga wu usa̱n cine u ri ana'an. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Amma Sulemanu zuwa aza a Isra'ila ulinga wu usa̱n shi, ele ɗa a̱soja a̱yi na̱ nan yali ya̱ a̱soja na̱ nan yali yi ikeke yi ido na akumbi e ido ya̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Waru ele ɗa azagbain o ulinga o Mogono Sulemanu, azagbain ukpaku ure na̱ kupoton (250) na̱ da̱na̱ e idanasa ama.<verse eid="2CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />A̱vu Sulemanu ta̱wa̱ nu usheli wa Firi'awuna diga a̱ Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda a̱ tyo o ukobu u na u suwaa niyi. Adama a na u damma ta̱ &lt;&lt;Ka va̱ a̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ o ukobu wa̱ Da̱wuda mogono ma Isra'ila shi, adama a na suru uba̱ta̱ u na Akpati a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ri, uba̱ta̱ u ɗa wa akiza.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />A̱vu Sulemanu ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a Masa'a ma na u suwai elime o ukobu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva'a. <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" />U ca ta̱ ununa a zuwai a yuwan wu urana suru cine Musa zuwai: Ukula̱tosu adama a rana va Ashibi, na̱ A̱buki o Woto u Sa'avu na̱ suru mantsa ma̱ a̱buki a ta'atsu a'wan na̱ A̱buki Opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ Wolilo shi na̱ A̱buki a Ajuma Ajuma na̱ A̱buki o Ogodo. <verse eid="2CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" />Ununa dada va̱ yi Da̱wuda foɓoi, Sulemanu foɓo ta̱ nan ganu oɓolo oɓolo adama a na o foɓo le na a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱. A̱vu u ca nan Levi ulinga u na a yuwan ica nu ulinga wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ na aa kamba nan ganu cine wuntsayi o urana suru. A̱vu waru u zuwa aza a na a yuwan ipiri yu U'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva oɓolo oɓolo o una̱ wa̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ na̱ntsu'u. Adama a na ne ɗa Da̱wuda vuma va̱ A̱sula̱ dammai a yuwan. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Nan ganu na̱ nan Levi avadala e ili i na mogono ma damma nle na a yuwan shi, ko ekere asula e izuwa ya̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa shi.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Ne ɗa Sulemanu kotoi ulinga wa̱ yi suru, diga urana u na u varai ikyun yu usaa hali a̱ tyo o ukosu u na u kotoi usaa wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. Na̱ ne ɗa o kotoi ulinga wu usaa wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="2CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Reve Sulemanu ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Eziyon Geba na̱ Ela ilyuci i na ri ege'en m mala me iɗa ya̱ Edom. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Huram lyunguwa̱a̱ ta̱ Sulemanu na antsun a̱ mini na aza a na o ronuso le, aza a na a gurai mala lon. A̱za̱ o ulinga wa Huram na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Sulemanu a̱ ka̱ra̱ ta̱ a̱ tyo Ofi a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ Mogono Sulemanu na̱ zinariya za na ri nu ume u kilo ukpakukupa kupa nu ukpakukupa uton (15,000).<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="s">Egbere va Sheba bura ta̱ Sulemanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 10:1-13">1 Ngo 10:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />Ana Egbere va Sheba uwwai alabari o ugbozu wa̱ Sulemanu, reve u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Urishelima adama u lyungwa̱ yi na̱ yeci yu usa̱n. U da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ o ushewusun a̱bunda̱, reve u ru'wa̱ arakumi a̱yi na̱ ne'e icu'un icu'un, ne'e vi ili i ma̱guru na atali e ikebe na̱ zinariya. Ana a ga'ain na̱ mogono'o, reve u yuwan yi yeci i na u ri ne ele o okolo suru. <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Reve gba u usu yeci'i suru, adanshi o ro a̱da̱na̱ lo usa̱n u na waa ca urevu wa̱ yi shi. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Ana Egbere va Sheba e enei cu'un vu ugbozu u na Sulemanu ri na̱ yi, na̱ cu'un vu ukobu u na u suwai, <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />na̱ cu'un vi ilyalya zuva va apada a̱yi, na̱ nda̱na̱ta̱ ma azagbain a̱yi na agbashi a̱yi ni itana i sa'ani i na o otoyi, na̱ agbashi a̱yi na a casu yi ili yoso ni itana i sa'ani i na o otoyi, waru na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu u na u yuwain a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. Reve u lamba ili i na wa damma.<verse eid="2CH 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Reve u damma mogono'o, &lt;&lt;Alabari a na mu uwwai a̱ lyuci va̱ adama a ɗa a̱ wu nu ugbozu wa̱ wu amayun a ɗa. <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />N shi n usu ili i na mu uwwai shi, she na n ta̱wa̱i me enei ne esu a̱ va̱. Ashe! Ko uɓatsulai a damma mu shi! Amayun ugbozu wa̱ wu nu utsuru wa̱ wu u la'a ta̱ ucira wi ili i na mu uwwai. <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />Amayun ama a̱ wu na aza a na a yuwusan wu a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱tsura̱ ta̱, adama o ulinga u na a yuwusan pa kuci a ta uwwusa ugbozu wa wu! <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" />Ica za va̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu a ɗa, za na a uwwusa uyo'o wa̱ wu, na u ɗangula nuwu mogono vu da̱nu o ootogu o tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi. Adama a na A̱sula̱ a cigai Isra'ila waru u cigai tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi tsa lyuwa elime hali hali, u zuwa wu ta̱ vo o'wo mogono e ekere ele, adama a na va yuwan tsugono tsa amayun na̱ a̱ɓula̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Reve u ca mogono'o uritowu u zinariya u kilo ukpakukupa una̱shi (4,000) na atali e ikebe ni itana yu ucita ya̱ a̱bunda̱. Koto she e ene cu'un vi itana yu ucita tsundolo shi tsa aza a na Egbere va Sheba ta̱wa̱yi Mogono Sulemanu shi.<verse eid="2CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />Reve ama a Huram oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Sulemanu a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ zinariya diga Ofi, a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ waru na̱ ɗanga va algumu na atali e ikebe. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Mogono ma yuwan ta̱ ulinga na̱ ɗanga va algumu u yuwan ndasata ma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa ma̱ A̱sulazuva no ozo o ukobu u mogono, ni igaraya ni ikumburu adama a̱za̱ e ishipa. Ko to ene cu'un vi ili tsundolo a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Yahuda shi.<verse eid="2CH 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Reve mogono Sulemanu ca Egbere va Sheba ili i na u cigai suru ni ili i na u patiyi biti, u ca yi ta̱ u la'a wu ni ili i na u ta̱wa̱a̱ niyi. Reve u ka̱mba̱ e iɗa ya̱ yi oɓolo na aza a na a̱ shewun niyi.<verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utsuru wa̱ Sulemanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 10:14-29">1 Ngo 10:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 5:1">1 Ngo 5:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />Suru a'wan Mogono Sulemanu tsu ushi ta̱ zinariya va̱ a̱bunda̱ na rawai kilo ukpakukupa ushin nu ukpakukupa uta'atsu (23,000), <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" />babu nu utafa u na a̱za̱ eden a tsu tsupa, na aza a atsulu na awina. Waru ngono ma Arabiya suru na̱ nan gwamna e iɗa'a a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ Sulemanu na̱ azurufa na̱ zinariya.<verse eid="2CH 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15" />Mogono Sulemanu yuwan ta̱ a̱ba̱jini a̱ra̱ga̱ ukpakure (200), za ta̱ suru a yuwain ta̱ na̱ zinariya na rawai kilo cindere. <verse eid="2CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:16" />A̱vu waru u yuwan a̱ra̱ga̱ ke'en ke'en a zinariya na rawai kilo re, mogono mazuwa ta̱ a̱ra̱ga̱'a̱ o ukobu wa̱ a̱a̱rumbu a Lebanon.<verse eid="2CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Waru Mogono ma yuwan ta̱ a̱ba̱jini ootogu o tsugono na aanga agiwa, a̱vu a surai na̱ zinariya can. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18" />Ootogu o tsugono'o u ta̱ nu udasata uta̱li, nu uba̱ta̱ u mazuwa ma ana ma zinariya, za na ri uɓolu no Ootogu'u. Eɓele o Ootogu'u suru u ta̱ na̱ uba̱ta̱ u mazuwa mo ukere, za na ri ni iroci yi kamu za na ri lo mishin. <verse eid="2CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:19" />Sulemanu yuwan ta̱ iroci yi kamu kupa na̱ ejere. A̱vu a zuwa iroci yi kamu ta̱ mishin upasu suru wu udasata ta̱li. Babu nɗa n na a yuwain cu'un vo Ootogu o tsugono tsundolo. <verse eid="2CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Suru ili yoso a̱ mini ma Sulemanu a yuwan le ta̱ na̱ zinariya. Na̱ suru itana yu ulinga yu ukobu a̱tsuma̱ a̱a̱rumbu a Lebanon, a yuwan le ta̱ na̱ zinariya can. A yuwan le na̱ azurufa shi, adama a na a mantsa ma Sulemanu azurufa da̱na̱ ili i ro shi. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" />Mogono ma̱ shi ta̱ na antsun a̱bunda̱ a mala adama a atsulu na awina oɓolo na agbashi a Huram. A̱tsuma̱ a'wan a ta'atsu a̱ tsu ka̱mba̱ ta̱ diga Tarshishi uta̱ utanuwu na̱ zinariya na̱ azurufa na aanga a agiwa ni iyomo oɓolo na̱ a̱gba̱da̱gi.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />Mogono Sulemanu ma̱ shi ta̱ ma la'a ngono mu uvaɗi suru utsuru nu ugbozu. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Suru ozo o tsugono tsu uvaɗi a̱ 'ya̱wusa̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u Mogono Sulemanu adama a na a uwwa ugbozu u na A̱sula̱ a ca niyi. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" />Suru nle a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ yi ta̱ nu une'e u azurufa na̱ zinariya na̱ a̱tugu, ni itana yu uvon ni itana yu ucita ni ido na̱ nloli mi ido. A̱vu a yuwusan ne a'wan suru.<verse eid="2CH 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" />Sulemanu da̱na̱ ta̱ no ogodo ukpakukupa una̱shi (4,000) adama e ido ya̱ yi ni ikeke yi ido yu uvon ya̱ yi. U da̱na̱ ta̱ ni ido ukpakukupa kupa nu ukpakukupa ure (12,000) aza a na u zuwai e ilyuci yi ikeke yi ido, ozo o ro waru ɗe Urishelima oɓolo na̱ yi. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" />Sulemanu yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsun ngono diga o Uɗolu wa̱ Yufireti a̱ tyo e iɗa ya Filistiya hali a̱ tyo o ukosu wi iɗa ya Masar. <verse eid="2CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" />A̱vu mogono ma zuwa azurufa mo o'wo ili ya̱ pere she damma atali a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima na̱ ɗanga sida tsu ɗanga vu ubiri e iɗa i mugaɗi ma Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" />Sulemanu tsula ta̱ ido diga e iɗa ya Masar na̱ akapi e iɗa yu uvaɗi.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwisa̱ wa̱ Sulemanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 11:41-43">1 Ngo 11:41-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />Suru akapi o ulinga wa Sulemanu diga o ufaru a̱ tyo o ukosu a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ pe uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada a Natan vumava̱sula̱ na adanshi e ikaka ya Ahija vuma va Shilo na̱ Iddo za yindi e enei adama Yerobowam ulobo wa Neba. <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" />Diga Urishelima Sulemanu yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa aza a Isra'ila suru a'wan amunga. <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" />Reve u kuwa̱ ucina nkaya ma̱ yi reve a̱ciɗyo yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda, za na a̱yi ɗa Urishelima. Reve Rehobowam ulobo wa̱ yi wo o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="s">Isra'ila yuwaan ta̱ Rehobowam aciyogbamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 12:1-20">1 Ngo 12:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />Rehobowam 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ a̱ lyuci va Shekem, adama a na ama a Isra'ila suru oɓoloto ta̱ a katalai okokolo o tsugono ɗe. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" />A mantsa ma na Yerobowam ulobo wa Neba uwwai a labari a na a katala ta̱ Rehobowam mogono, a̱vu Yerobowam ka̱mba̱ diga Masar uba̱ta̱ u na u ri na̱ nden adama a na u shi ta̱ u suma adama o Mogono Sulemanu. <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />A̱vu a̱ lyungu na e ɗe Yerobowam u ta̱wa̱. A̱vu a̱yi na̱ ama a Isra'ila suru a̱ ka̱ra̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Rehobowam a damma yi, <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" />&lt;&lt;Dada va wu zuwaa tsu ta̱ a̱a̱gba̱la̱ a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon. Gogo na̱ vu ta a jiba tsu ulinga wu usa̱n u nda, na̱ ili yu usa̱n i na i ri zuva va aciya̱tsu, tsu ta yuwaan wu a̱ga̱nda̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />A̱vu mogono Rehobowam damma le, &lt;&lt;I ka̱mba̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱ nda na̱ rana ta'atsu.&gt;&gt; Reve a ama'a a̱ ka̱ra̱.<verse eid="2CH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Adama o ndolo a̱vu mogono Rehobowam zami ucuɗuwu e ekere a mbara n na a yuwayin dada va̱ yi Sulemanu a̱ga̱nda̱ a mantsa ma na u da̱na̱i wuma. A̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;Cu'un va̱ a̱sa̱la̱ a̱ ne ɗa ya ca a̱mu adama a na ma̱ usu ama a nda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />A̱vu a̱ usu yi, &lt;&lt;N na̱ vu ta̱ ene iliyali ya ama a nda, a̱vu waru vu yuwan le isa'ani, vu yuwan le adanshi a sa'ani, oto o'wo agbashi a̱ wu aza a amayun kuci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Amma a̱vu Rehobowam 'yuwan na wa̱ usu wa̱ a̱sa̱la̱ a na mbara n ca niyi, a̱vu u 'ya̱wa̱ u zami ya̱ a̱sa̱la̱ uba̱ta̱ wo o olobo a na u kungwai oɓolo ne ele. Aza a na a yuwusan yi a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />A̱vu we ece ele, &lt;&lt;Nye ɗa a̱sa̱la̱ a̱ ɗu? Cine ma̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ama a nda aza a na a dammu, &lt;Vu ta jiba tsu usa̱n wa̱ a̱a̱gba̱la̱ a na dada va wu zuwaa n tsu&gt;?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />A̱vu olobo'o a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Apa usuwu u na vaa damma aza a na a damma nuwu ana, &lt;Dada va̱ wu zuwaa tsu ta̱ a̱a̱gba̱la̱ o ume, amma lyawa vu jiba tsu usa̱n u nda.&gt; A̱vu vu damma le, &lt;Akatsu e ke'en o ukere u va̱ u la'a ta̱ ikyun ya dada va̱ ugba̱mu. <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Dada va̱ zuwaa ɗu ta̱ a̱a̱gba̱la̱ o ume, amma n ta̱ da̱shi ɗu ulinga wu usa̱n. Dada va̱ faba ɗu ta̱ na asuɗu, amma a̱mu n ta fufaba ɗu na agashi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Ana a yuwain rana ta'atsu, a̱vu Yerobowam na ama'a suru a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Rehobowam cine mogono ma damma nle, &lt;&lt;I ka̱mba̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱ nda na̱ rana ta'atsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Reve mogono ma̱ usu le nu upan, u 'yuwan a̱sa̱la̱ a mbara, <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />a̱vu u usu a̱sa̱la̱ o olobo u damma le, &lt;&lt;Dada va̱ zuwaa ɗu ta̱ a̱a̱gba̱la̱ o ume, amma a̱mu n ta̱ da̱shi ɗu ulinga wu usa̱n. Dada va fufaba ɗu ta̱ na asuɗu, amma a̱mu n ta fufaba a̱ ɗu na agashi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" />Mogono ma zuwaa ama'a atsuvu shi, adama a na ne ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a cigai. U yuwan ta̱ ne adama a na wa̱ shiton adanshi a na u yuwain na̱ Yerobowam ulobo wa Neba o una̱ wa Ahija vuma va Shilo.<verse eid="2CH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />Amma a mantsa ma na aza a Isra'ila suru a gura revei na wu uwwa le shi, a̱vu ama'a a̱ usu mogono'o a damma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">&lt;&lt;N nye i bura ntsu na̱ Da̱wuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">tsu ri na agadu e ekere o ulobo wa̱ Yese shi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 10:16">A̱ɗu Isra'ila, ka̱mba̱i ogodo a̱ɗu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 10:16">Lyawa Da̱wuda idana u'wa wa̱ a̱yi.&gt;&gt; Adama o ndolo a̱vu ama Isra'ila e bete'we, a̱vu a̱ ka̱mba̱ a'wan le suru. <verse eid="2CH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Amma a̱vu Rehobowam lyuwa elime na̱ tsugono tsa a ama Isra'ila aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden e ilyuci ya Yahuda goon.<verse eid="2CH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Adama o ndolo a̱vu Mogono Rehobowam lyunguwa̱a̱ Adoniram za na ee idanasa a̱za̱ o ulinga wu usa̱n a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Isra'ila, amma a̱vu a vuvara yi na̱ atali hali ukwa̱. Ana Mogono Rehobowam enei ne a̱vu u jika̱ u tara keke vi ido ya̱ yi a̱vu u suma a̱ tyo Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Diga a mantsa mo ndolo, reve aza a Isra'ila e reme a̱ 'ya̱susa̱a̱n u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda a aci hali na ana'an.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="s">Adanshi e ikaka ya Shemaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 12:21-24">1 Ngo 12:21-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />A mantsa ma na Rehobowam rawai Urishelima, a̱vu u ɓoloto a̱soja na a gurai uvon ukpakukupa ukpaku nu ukpakukupa kupakunla̱ (180,000) diga a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa Yahuda na̱ Banyami na a yuwan uvon na aza a Isra'ila, adama a na a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ le za̱la̱ tsugono tsa Rehobowam.<verse eid="2CH 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Amma a̱vu A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Shemaya vuma va̱ A̱sula̱ u damma, <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 11:3" />&lt;&lt;Vu damma Rehobowam ulobo wa Sulemanu mogono ma a Yahuda na̱ suru aza a Isra'ila na a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda na̱ Banyami, <verse eid="2CH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" />&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, she i yuwan uvon na̱ mmaci n ɗu aza a Isra'ila wan. Ka̱mba̱i a 'wa ɗu, adama a na ili i na i farai u yuwun u va̱ u ɗa! Reve a yuwan tsutoni na adanshi A̱sulazuva gba a yuwan uvon na̱ Yerobowam waru shi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rehobowam suwa ta̱ ukari wu ucira a̱tsuma̱ o upasu wa Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Rehobowam da̱nu ta̱ Urishelima, a̱vu u suwa ilyuci adama a na a yuwan mapari ma Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />Ilyuci i na u suwai ele ɗa: Batalami na̱ Etam na̱ Tekowa <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />na̱ Bet Zur na̱ Soko na̱ Adulam <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />na̱ Gat na̱ Maresha na̱ Zif <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />na̱ Adorayim na̱ Lakish na̱ Azeka <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />na̱ Zora na̱ Ajalon na̱ Heburon. Ele nda ele ɗa ilyuci vu kari vu ucira a̱tsuma̱ o upasu wa Yahuda na̱ Banyami. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />A̱vu u zuwa na a suwa ukari wu ucira adama a na a yuwan mapari ma lyuci'i, adama o ndolo a̱vu u zuwa nan yali ya̱ a̱soja aciyele, ni ilyalya na̱ mani'in ma̱ zetun oɓolo na̱ masayan ma̱ inabi. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Rehobowam gba ɓoloto ta̱ a̱ra̱ga̱ ni ibata a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci'i suru adama a̱ da̱shi le ucira lon. Na̱ tsundolo tsa a ɗa u guza̱i Yahuda na̱ Banyami.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nan ganu na̱ nan Levi a̱ ka̱mba̱ ta̱ Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Nan ganu na̱ nan Levi na̱ ri e iɗa ya Isra'ila suru a̱ ka̱mba̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono Rehobowam diga uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ ri na̱ nden suru. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" />Adama a na nan Levi a lyawa ta̱ a̱ɗuma̱ ele ni itana i le a̱vu a̱ ka̱mba̱ Yahuda na̱ Urishelima, adama a na Yerobowam no olobo a̱yi a putsaa ta̱ nan ganu na̱ nan Levi na a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ a tsuganu tsa̱ ele uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" />Yerobowam ɗangula ta̱ nan ganu a̱yi adama a̱ ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ na adama mgbele na̱ musula̱ m mudindim n na u zuɗa̱i. <verse eid="2CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" />Amma a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wa Isra'ila suru a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ na ama na a zuwai okolo ele na a zami urewesu wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila a̱vu o toni nan Levi a̱ tyo Urishelima na a ca kucci a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya nle. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" />A̱vu a zuwa tsugono tsa a Yahuda yuwan ucira. A̱vu a yuwan a'wan ata'atsu a yuwusan tsutoni na̱ Rehobowam ulobo wa Sulemanu ulobo wa̱ Da̱wuda, a̱vu a yuwusan mmalu o ure wa Sulemanu na̱ Da̱wuda.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />Rehobowam zuwa ta̱ Mahala, za na da̱na̱i usheli wa̱ Yerimo wu ulobo wa̱ Da̱wuda, waru aala a mma va̱ yi ɗa Abihayi usheli wa̱ Eliyabu mawun ma tsukaya ma̱ Yese. <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />A̱vu u matsaan yi olobo: Yewushe na̱ Shemariya na̱ Zaham. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Waru u zuwa ta̱ Ma'aka usheli wa Absalom, za na matsaan niyi: Abija na̱ Atai na̱ Ziza na̱ Shelomi. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />Rehobowam gba ciga ta̱ Ma'aka lon usheli wa Absalom hali u la'a akapi a̱ma̱ci a̱yi na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ nge'en, adama a na u zuwa ta̱ a̱ma̱ci kupa na̱ kunla̱, u da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ nge'en kupota̱li. U ta̱ na̱ muwun mo olobo ushin na̱ kunla̱ na̱ muwun me esheli kupota̱li.<verse eid="2CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" />A̱vu Rehobowam zuwa Abija ulobo wa Ma'aka na wo o'wo zagbain a̱tsuma̱ a̱za̱ a̱yi, na̱ majiyan ma na a katala yi okokolo na wo o'wo mogono. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Rehobowam yuwan ta̱ ugbozu na u tarai muwun mo olobo ma̱ a̱yi a̱ tyo upasu wa a Yahuda na̱ Banyami a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci yu ukari vu ucira u na u suwai. A̱vu u lyunguwa̱a̱ le ni ilyalya ya̱ a̱bunda̱. A̱vu waru u taraa le a̱ma̱ci na̱ a̱bunda̱.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="s">Shisha riya̱a̱ ta̱ Urishelima nu uvon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 14:25-28">1 Ngo 14:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />A mantsa ma na Rehobowam enei tsugono tsa a̱yi tsa̱ shuwa̱ ta̱ reve u yuwan ucira, a̱vu a̱yi na ama a Isra'ila suru a 'yuwan a yuwan tsutoni na̱ wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" />Adama a na a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ nu ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱tsuma̱ a'wan a tawun o Mogono Rehobowam, a̱vu mogono Shisha va Masar riya̱a̱ Urishelima nu uvon. <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />Shisha da̱na̱ ta̱ ni ikeke yi ido ukpakukupa nu ukpakure (1,200), na akumbi e ido ukpakukupa kupota̱li (60,000), oɓolo na̱ a̱soja na a tsu gura kece shi a̱tsuma̱ ele a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱soja a Libiya na aza a Sukim na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Kush<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ama o upasu wu Uɗolu wa̱ Nilu</char></note> aza a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱yi diga Masar. <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" />A̱vu usa ilyuci i na i ri na̱ kari vu ucira wa aza a Yahuda hali a̱ tyo Urishelima.<verse eid="2CH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" />A̱vu vumava̱sula̱ Shemaya ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Rehobowam na̱ akapi azagbain a Yahuda aza a na o ɓolotoi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima adama a na a ta uwwusa wovon wa Shisha na wa̱ ta̱wa̱ u damma le, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱, &lt;I lyawa mu ta̱, adama o ndolo a̱mu fo n ta lyawa a̱ ɗu na ma ca a̱ɗu e ekere a Shisha.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />A̱vu mogono na azagbain a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱ɗa̱to aciyele a damma, &lt;&lt;Amayun A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ ili i na i ri mejege.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" />A mantsa ma na A̱sulazuva enei a̱ ka̱ɗa̱to ta̱ aciyele, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ da̱shi yuwan adanshi na̱ Shemaya u damma, &lt;&lt;Ana wo o'woi gogo a tara aciyele ili i ro shi, mo kototo le shi, amma n ta kamba le. Upan u va̱ wa̱ cipa̱ aciya Urishelima e ekere a Shisha shi. <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" />Amma adama o ndolo oto o'wo agbashi a Shisha, adama a na a gura kurato mayan ma̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ na̱ mayan ma̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ e ekere aza a na a yuwusan tsugono tso o uvaɗi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />Ana mogono Shisha va Masar riya̱yi Urishelima nu uvon, a̱vu waru u pura̱ itana isa'ani diga a̱tsuma̱ e izuwa ya̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, na aza a sa'ani a na a̱ ri pe a̱tsuma̱ o ukobu u mogono. U pura̱ ta̱ a̱ra̱ga̱ a zinariya aza a na Sulemanu yuwain. <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />Reve mogono Rehobowam yuwan a̱ra̱ga̱ a̱ rumushili o una̱ wa aza a na a̱ pura̱i. A̱vu u ca nan yali e ipiri yu una̱ntsu wu ukobu u mogono. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />Mantsa ma na mogono ma̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva suru, a̱vu aza a na a yuwusan ipiri a̱ pura̱ le a̱ guza̱ o toni yi. A mantsa ma na u ka̱ra̱i a̱vu a tara itana'a a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ le uba̱ta̱ u na a tsu zuwusa le.<verse eid="2CH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" />Ana Rehobowam ka̱ɗa̱toi aciya̱yi, avu upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva o von aciya̱yi. Agba A̱sulazuva o kototo yi suru suru shi. Suru na̱ ne a̱vu u ta̱wa̱ ni isa'ani a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />Mogono Rehobowam shuwa̱ ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi nu ucira a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, a̱yi na a'wan amunga na̱ za̱ ta̱ nu u matsun ɗaɗa wo o'woi mogono. U yuwan ta̱ tsugono a'wan kupa na̱ a̱za̱ cindere a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima e ilyuci i na A̱sulazuva a ɗangulai diga a̱tsuma̱ o gundo va Isra'ila suru na wa zuwa Aala yi. Aala mma va Rehobowam ɗa Na'ama za va Amon. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />Rehobowam gba yuwan ta̱ iwuya adama a na u 'yuwan na wa zami urewesu wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />Suru linga na Rehobowam yuwain, diga o ufaru acina ukosu, a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada o ucuɗuwu u vumava̱sula̱ Shemaya na̱ Iddo za yindi. Uvon u da̱na̱ ta̱ lo mantsa suru e ekere a Rehobowam na̱ Yerobowam. <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" />Reve Rehobowam kuwa̱ ucina nkaya ma̱ yi reve a̱ ciɗo yi a̱ Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda. A̱vu ulobo wa̱ yi Abija wo o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="s">Abija mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 15:1-8">1 Ngo 15:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />A̱tsuma̱ a'wan kupa na̱ kunla̱ o tsugono tsa̱ mogono Yerobowam ulobo wa Nebat, Abija temei tsugono tsa a Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" />U yuwan ta̱ tsugono a'wan ta'atsu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima. Aala a mma va̱ yi ɗa Ma'aka usheli wa Uriyel diga a Gibiya. Uvon u da̱na̱ lo e ekere Abija na̱ Yerobowam. <verse eid="2CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Abija yuwan ta̱ uvon na̱ a̱soja a na a gurai uvon lon ukpakukupa ukpakuna̱shi (400,000), Yerobowam gba foɓo ta̱ a̱soja na a gurai uvon lon ukpakukupa ukpakukunla̱ (800,000).<verse eid="2CH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />A̱vu Abija isawan zuva Masasan ma Zemarayim za na ri ɗe a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu, a̱vu u ya̱sa̱n uɗyo wa̱ yi u damma,&lt;&lt;Yerobowam na̱ Isra'ila suru, uwa numu! <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" />Ashe, i reve a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila u ca ta̱ tsugono tsa Isra'ila e ekere a̱ Da̱wuda nu ugundo wa̱ yi e ekere a nzuwulai ma akpaɗi hali hali shi? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" />Suru na̱ ne Yerobowam ulobo wa Neba aagbashi a̱ Da̱wuda ulobo wa̱ Sulemanu u 'yon ta̱ a̱vu u 'ya̱sa̱a̱n zagbain va̱ yi a aci. <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />A̱vu Yerobowam ɓoloto ama a vama oɓolo na̱ a̱yi na aza awuya a na a yuwan tsushu'un na̱ Rehobowam ulobo wa Sulemanu, a mantsa mo ndolo Rehobowam ulobo u ɗa za na da̱na̱i nu ugbozu lon shi, agba u gura rono ne ele shi.<verse eid="2CH 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />&lt;&lt;Gogo i ciga ta̱ a na yoo o kototo tsugono tsa̱ A̱sulazuva za na u zuwai o ugundo wa̱ Da̱wuda? Ye ene ta̱ aciya̱ɗu i ta̱ a̱bunda̱, a̱vu i tara musula̱ n na Yerobowam zuɗa̱i na o o'wo musula̱ n ɗu. <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" />Ashe fo i gba̱ra̱ nan ganu A̱sulazuva, ozo o ugundo wa Haruna na̱ akapi a nan Levi shi? Agba waru i katalaa ta̱ aciya̱ɗu nan ganu cine akapi a nɗa a yuwain shi? Suru za na ta̱wa̱i no moggono a nan na̱ a̱giri'i a̱ cindere na wa tawa aciya̱yi, wo o'wo ta̱ ganu n musula̱ fo, za va̱ A̱sula̱ ɗa shi.<verse eid="2CH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />&lt;&lt;Amma a̱tsu gba, A̱sulazuva a ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱tsu, agba tsu 'yuwain shi. Waru tsu ta̱ nan ganu a na a yuwusaan A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱ limatan va Haruna, waru nan Levi a ta yuwusan ulinga oɓolo ne ele. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" />Agba a tsu casu ta̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ mani'i ma̱ ma̱guru aza a na a̱ ri nu uyo'o u mawwa e ekere A̱sulazuva usana nu ulivu suru. A̱ tsu zuwa ta̱ opopofu na a tawai zuva va apada a na a̱ ri cece, waru a tsu daɓusa ta̱ ifitila i zinariya ulivu suru. Adama a na tsu ta yuwusan tsutoni nu udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱tsu, amma a̱vu i 'yuwan yi. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" />A̱sula̱ oto o oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu, a̱yi ɗa mogono ma̱ a̱tsu. Nan ganu waru a̱ ta̱ ivulusa̱ tsu avana na tsa yuwan uvon na̱ a̱ɗu. Ugundo wa Isra'ila, she i yuwan uvon na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya nɗu wan, adama a naa ya̱a̱ tsura̱ u lyuwu wa aci shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Ele lo, a̱vu Yerobowam da̱shi zuwa a̱soja a na a̱da̱na̱ lo upa'an a̱ wu, na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ nu uvon uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱soja a Yahuda nu ucina̱. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14" />A mantsa ma na a̱soja a Yahuda a vadalai na enei a̱soja a Yerobowam na a yuwan uvon ne ele suru, a̱vu a yuwan mesun a̱ tyo wu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. A̱vu nan ganu e ivula̱ avana. <verse eid="2CH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:15" />A̱vu a̱soja a Yahuda a̱ ya̱sa̱n uɗyo u le na a yuwan uvon. Ana a yuwain ne, A̱sula̱ a̱ tsura̱ ta̱ ulyuwu wa aci e ekere a Yerobowam na̱ aza a Isra'ila, a̱vu u zuwa le a suma elime ama a Abija na̱ a̱soja a Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" />A̱vu a̱soja a Isra'ila a sumaa a̱soja a Yahuda. A̱sula̱ gba a ca ta̱ aza a Isra'ila e ekere a̱soja a Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Abija na̱ a̱soja a̱yi o una ta̱ a̱soja na a gurai uvon wa aza a Isra'ila ukpakukupa ukpakuton (500,000). <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" />Ne ɗa a̱ tsura̱i ulyuwu wa a aci wa aza a Isra'ila a mantsa'a. A̱soja a Yahuda a̱tsura̱ ta̱ ulyuwu wa a aci adama a na a zuwa ta̱ ucira u le uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya nle.<verse eid="2CH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" />Abija yuwan ta̱ uvon na̱ Yerobowam a̱vu usaa yi iɗa ya Betel na̱ Yeshana na̱ Efuron na̱ mulyuci nle. <verse eid="2CH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" />Yerobowam da̱shi da̱na̱ nu ucira shi a mantsa mo tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi suru a rana tsugono tsa a Abija. A̱sulazuva gba o kototo ta̱ Yerobowam a̱vu u kuwa̱.<verse eid="2CH 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Amma Abija da̱shishi ta̱ ucira. A̱vu u zuwa a̱ma̱ci kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi, a̱vu a matsayin muwun mo o olobo ushin ne ejere na̱ muwun me esheli kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱li.<verse eid="2CH 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Akapi o ulinga u tsugono tsa Abija ni ili i na u yuwain ni ili i na u dammai a̱ tu pe uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada alabari a vumava̱sula̱ Iddo.<verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />A̱vu Abija kuwa̱ ucina nkaya ma̱ yi reve a̱ ciɗo yi a̱ Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda. A̱vu ulobo wa̱ yi Asa wo o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ yi. A̱vu lyuci'i u tsura̱ nden n lafiya hali acina a'wan kupa.<verse eid="2CH 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asa mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 15:9-15">1 Ngo 15:9-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Asa gba yuwan ta̱ ili i na i ri mejege uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" />A̱vu u tawa Masa'a ma̱ musula̱ na̱ ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱. A̱vu u kototo atali a na a yuwusaan a̱ga̱nda̱, a̱vu waru u gagasa a̱shuwutsu a Ashera. <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />Asa damma ta̱ ama a Yahuda na a zami A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya nle, a̱vu waru a yuwan tsutoni nu uritosu wa̱ a̱yi nu udammu wa̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" />A̱vu waru u kototo suru ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱, na̱ Masa'a ma na a yuwusan ukula̱tosu wi ili ma̱guru suru uba̱ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ lyuci va Yahuda. A̱tsuma̱ a'wan o tsugono tsa Asa a̱ a̱tsura̱ ta̱ nden n lafiya. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" />A̱vu u lapula ilyuci i na i ri nu ukari vu ucira ya Yahuda, adama a na lyuci'i u da̱na̱ta̱ na̱ nden n lafiya. Agba waru babu za na yuwain uvon ne ele a̱tsuma̱ a'wa'an, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ca yi ta̱ asuvu nden.<verse eid="2CH 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />A̱vu Asa damma ama a Yahuda, &lt;&lt;Lyawa na tsa̱ da̱shi suwisa ilyuci a̱vu tsu ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i na̱ kari na atsura na a̱ ri uga'an na̱ na̱ntsu ni irumu. Iɗa i nda za tsu ɗa hali n gogo, adama a na tsu zami ta̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱tsu. Tsu toniyi ta̱, a̱vu waru u ca tsu asuvu nden uba̱ta̱ suru.&gt;&gt; Avu a yuwusan usa, nu utsuru wu lyuwu we elime.<verse eid="2CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Mogono Asa da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱soja ukpakukupa ukpakuta'atsu (300,000) aza a na a gurai uvon lon diga o ugundo wa Yahuda, suru nle a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ uguzu na̱ a̱ra̱ga̱ ni ibata. Agba waru u da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱soja ukpakukupa ukpakure na̱ kupakunla̱ (280,000) aza a na a gurai uvon lon diga o ugundo wa Banyami, suru nle a̱ ta̱ uguzu na̱ a̱ra̱ga̱ na̱ tan.<verse eid="2CH 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Zera vuma va Kush ta̱wa̱ ta̱ nu uvon na̱ a̱soja na a yuwain ukpakukupa udoɓonuwu ni ikeke yi ido ukpaku uta'atsu (300). A̱vu u rawa Maresha na wa yuwan uvon ne ele. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Adama o ndolo, a̱vu Asa uta̱ a̱vu a dara adama o uvon a Zefata zuzu na̱ Maresha.<verse eid="2CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" />A̱vu Asa yuwan mesun a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱yi, u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱vu A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱tsu, babu za na ri nu ucira tsa̱ wu, za na a kamba za na ri nu ucira shi e ekere aza a na a̱ ri nu ucira. Vu kamba a̱tsu, a̱vu A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱tsu, adama a na tsu zuwa ta̱ ucira u tsu ya̱ wu! A̱vu A̱sulazuva, a̱tsuma̱ aala a̱ wu a ɗa tsu ta̱wa̱i na tsa yuwan uvon na̱ a̱soja a nda. A̱vu A̱sulazuva, a̱vu ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱tsu! She vu lyawa nanza la'a ucira wa̱ wu wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" />A̱sulazuva gba o kototo ta̱ a̱soja a̱ Kush elime o mogono Asa na̱ a̱soja a Yahuda, reve a̱za̱ a̱ Kush a suma. <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />A̱vu Asa na̱ a̱soja a̱yi o toni le hali a̱ tyo Gera. A̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ mo una ma̱ a̱soja a̱ Kush hali a gura oɓoloto na a lyuwa elime nu u uvon waru shi, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ɗa na̱ a̱soja a̱yi a yuwain uvon ne ele. A̱soja a Yahuda gba a usa ta̱ itana na̱ a̱bunda̱ e ekere a̱ a̱soja a̱ Kush. <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" />A̱vu o kototo ilyuci i na i ri yu uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ Gera, a̱vu a usa itana i le, adama a na A̱sulazuva a zuwa ta̱ ɗe wovon u guza̱ ama a̱ Kush. Adama a na a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ ni itana i sa'ani ya̱ a̱bunda̱. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />A̱vu a̱ riya̱a̱ va̱la̱ta̱ va aza a aguɓa e iliyamunga, a̱vu a usa inan i le na̱ mgbele nle na̱ arakumi e le na̱ a̱bunda̱. Reve a̱ ka̱mba̱ Urishelima.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="s">Yilapulishi i na Asa yuwain</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 15:13-15">1 Ngo 15:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />A̱vu Ruhu va A̱sula̱ cipa̱a̱ Azariya ulobo wa Oded, <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" />a̱vu wu uta̱ adama a na wa ga'asan na̱ Mogono Asa a̱yi a̱ ma̱a̱ ka̱mba̱ diga uba̱ta̱ o uvon, reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Vu uwwa a̱mu, a̱vu mogono Asa, a̱vu na a ama a Yahuda na̱ Banyami suru! A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu n na̱ vu ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi! Mantsa ma na vu zami niyi suru vu ta̱ tsura̱i. Amma ni i lyawai, a̱yi fo u ta lyawa a̱ɗu. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" />Adama a na aza a Isra'ila a jima ta̱ na a̱ tsura̱i A̱sula̱ amayun na̱ ganu na ri lo na wa̱ rito le na̱ wila̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ waru. <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" />Amma suru mantsa ma na a̱ ri pe a̱tsuma̱lima̱, a̱vu a vadala uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, a̱vu a zami yi, waru a̱ ta̱ tsura̱i. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" />A mantsa ma na a̱ ri na̱ nden n lafiya shi uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na a̱ ri ya̱ mota̱ na̱ ma uwa, adama a na iɗa'a u ri a̱tsuma̱ addama. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" />Reve a ama a ɓatsa. Iɗa i ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ iɗa, lyuci waru u ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ lyuci, adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ le ta̱ na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ na̱ meleshe icu'un icu'un. <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" />Amma a̱ɗu, i yuwan okolo o ugbamu, she yu uta̱a̱ okolo wan, adama a na i ta ushi atsupu o ulinga u ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />A mantsa ma na Asa uwwai cu'un vu udammu ni idanshi yi ikaka diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva o una̱ u vumava̱sula̱ Azariya ulobo wa Oded, a̱vu u yuwan okolo o ugbamu. A̱vu u kototo musula̱ mi idaba a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Yahuda na̱ Banyami, oɓolo ni ilyuci i na u usai a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya agaɗi ya Ifiramu. A̱vu u da̱shi lapula masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva za na ri elime o ukobu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="2CH 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" />A̱vu Asa ɓoloto ama a Yahuda na aza a Banyami na aza a Ifiramu na aza a Manase na aza a Saminu suru aza a na a̱ ri a̱ nden n tsumoci a̱tsuma̱ ele. Adama a na ama a Isra'ila na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ ta̱ na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ o upasu wa Yahuda a mantsa ma na e revei A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Asa ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />A̱vu oɓoloto a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a̱tsuma̱ o woto wa ta'atsu wa a'wan kupa na̱ ozo o ton a mantsa mo tsugono tsa Asa. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" />A̱tsuma̱ a rana ndolo a ca ta̱ kucci vi ili i na pura̱i diga uba̱ta̱ wu uvon a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva vi inan ukpakucindere (700), ni ikyon na̱ mgbele ukpakukupa ucindere (7,000). <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" />A̱vu a yuwan akucunu na a yuwaan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya nle a̱ga̱nda̱ no okolo ele na̱ wuma u le suru. <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" />A̱vu a damma suru za na 'yuwain na wa yuwaan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila a̱ga̱nda̱ oto o unai, ko na̱ shi vuma ke'en ɗa ko vuma gbain ko vali ko ka. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />A̱vu a yuwan akucunu a̱ tyo wu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva nu uɗyo wu ucira, na̱ yisali na̱ wi ivulusa̱ wa abulu na avana. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" />A̱vu ama a Yahuda suru a yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ na a yuwain akucunu nu ucigu wo okolo e le. A zami ta̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ okolo ele suru a̱vu a̱ tsura̱i. Reve A̱sulazuva a ca le wivuwun uba̱ta̱ suru.<verse eid="2CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />Hali na Mogono Asa ma̱ cipa̱to yi akaya a̱yi Ma'aka diga nden ma egbere, adama a na u yuwain ma̱sula̱ mi idaba ma ka Ashera. Asa kototo ta̱ ma̱sula̱, a̱vu wi ira yi, a̱vu ukuloto yi o Uka̱ri wa̱ Kidron. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Amma u shi u kototo ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ ro na ri a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Isra'ila shi. Suru na̱ ne okolo a Asa a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a rana wuma wa̱ yi suru. <verse eid="2CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />A̱vu u ta̱wa̱a̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sula̱ suru itana i azurufa na̱ zinariya na̱ akapi e itana yu ulinga aza a na a̱yi na̱ Dada va̱ a̱yi a tawai.<verse eid="2CH 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Agba a̱ da̱shi yuwan uvon shi hali acina a a'wan mata'atsu no ozo o ton o tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="s">A'wan o ukosu o tsugono tsa Asa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 15:17-22">1 Ngo 15:17-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />A̱tsuma̱ a'wan mata'atsu na̱ a̱za̱ ta̱li o tsugono tsa mogono Asa va Yahuda, a̱vu mogono Basha va Isra'ila riya̱a̱ Yahuda nu uvon, a̱vu u lapula ukari wu ucira u lyuci wa Rama adama a na wa putsaa na̱ ma uwa na̱ mota̱ na̱ ma uwwa mo upasu u mogono Asa va Yahuda.<verse eid="2CH 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />A̱vu Asa tara azurufa na̱ zinariya aza a na a̱ ri pe asula e izuwa a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ a̱za̱ o ukobu wa̱ a̱yi, a̱vu u lyunguwa̱a̱ mogono Ben Hada va Suriya za na ri ɗe a yuwusan tsugono tsa Dimaska. <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />A̱vu u damma &lt;&lt;Lyawa tsu yuwan nzuwulai cine Dada va̱ wu na̱ Dada va̱ a yuwain ɗe nu ufaru. Apa une'e u azurufa na̱ zinariya n ta̱wa̱ nuwu. Lyawa vu 'ya̱wa̱ a na va kuɗa nzuwulai na vu yuwain na̱ mogono Basha va Isra'ila na wa lyawa iɗa i va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Mogono Ben Hada gba usu ta̱ adanshi Asa, a̱vu u lyungu nan yali ya̱ a̱soja a̱yi na riya̱a̱ iɗa ya Isra'ila nu uvon. A̱vu a lyuwa ilyuci ya Iyon na̱ Dan na̱ Abel Ma'aka, ni iɗa yi izuwa yu upasu wa Nafutali suru. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />A mantsa ma na Basha uwwai ili i na ya farasa, a̱vu u lyawa masuwa mo ukari wa Rama, a̱vu u lyawa ulinga u na wa yuwusan. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Adama o ndolo a̱vu Mogono Asa ɓoloto ama diga Yahuda suru, a̱vu u zuwa le na a̱ pura̱ atali na akpata a na Basha yuwain ulinga ne le na u suwai Rama. Asa yuwan ta̱ ulinga ne ele u lapula ukari u lyuci wa̱ Geba na̱ za va Mizfa.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya Hanani vumava̱sula̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />A mantsa mo ndolo, a̱vu Hanani za yindi ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Asa mogono ma Yahuda, a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ana wo o'woi vu zuwa ta̱ ucira wa̱ a̱ wu uba̱ta̱ u mogono ma Suriya na wo o'woi vu zuwai ucira wa̱ a̱ wu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu shi, to, gogo a̱soja a Suriya ala'a ta̱ e ekere wa̱ wu. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" />Agba a̱soja a̱ Kush na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Libiya a̱za̱ a̱bunda̱ ɗa na amayun. A̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ ni ikeke yi ido yu uvon na a kambi e ido a̱bunda̱. Amma na̱ a̱bunda̱ e le suru, adama a na vu zuwa ta̱ okolo a̱ wu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu u ca wa̱ le ekere a̱ wu. <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" />Adama a na esu A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ idanasa suru uvaɗi na wa kamba aza a na o toni shi yi no okolo a̱ ta̱. Vu yuwan ta̱ tsulo. Adama o ndolo, diga gogo vu ta teme a yuwusan uvon kuci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" />Asa yuwan ta̱ upan na̱ za yindi'i adama o ndolo, a̱vu u ca udammu na a zuwa Hanani za yindi a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa ali. Diga mantsa mo ndolo ma ɗa Asa farai a casu ama a̱ yi a̱tsuma̱lima̱.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukosu u tsugono tsa Asa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 15:23-24">1 Ngo 15:23-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />Ulinga wa Asa diga o ufaru a cina ukosu u tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi u da̱na̱ uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada o tsugono tsa a Yahuda na aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />A̱tsuma̱ a'wan mata'atsu na̱ kuci o tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi, Asa reme ta̱ mɓa̱la̱ maa ana. Amma suru na̱ ne u zami A̱sulazuva shi, adama o ndolo reve u zami i kambi uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na a casu a̱guma̱. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Asa kuwa̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a'wan amunga na̱ za ta̱ o tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi, a̱vu ucina nkaya ma̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" />A̱vu a̱ ciɗo a̱yi a̱tsuma̱ aason a na u ka̱ba̱yi aciya̱yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda. A̱vu o votoyin a̱a̱kpa̱ga̱ na o shiton yi nu ucita ni ili i ma̱guru, a̱vu a̱ ivula̱ akina adama a na a ca yi tsugbain.<verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="s">Yehoshafat wo o'wo ta̱ mogono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />Yehoshafat ulobo wa Asa wo o'wo ta̱ mogono o una̱ wa dada va̱ yi. Waru u zuwa ta̱ upasu wa Yahuda u da̱shi ucira lon, hali na u gura yuwain uvon nu upasu wa Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" />Waru u yuwan ta̱ va̱la̱ta̱ va̱ a̱soja suru a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci na ri na̱ kari vu ucira vu upasu wa Yahuda, a̱vu u zuwa pe o oɓolo a̱soja na a yuwan ipiri a̱tsuma̱ o upasu wa Yahuda na̱ a̱tsuma̱ o upasu u mulyuci wa Ifiramu aza a na Dada va̱ yi Asa lyuwai nu uvon.<verse eid="2CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3" />A̱sulazuva a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ Yehoshafat adama a na nu ufaru u yuwan ta̱ tsutoni nu ure wa Dada va̱ yi Da̱wuda. U yuwaan a̱ma̱li a Ba'al a̱ga̱nda̱ shi, <verse eid="2CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:4" />amma u zami ta̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a dada va̱ yi, a̱vu u yuwan tsutoni nu udammu wa̱ yi, u toni wuma wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Isra'ila shi. <verse eid="2CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" />Adama o ndolo A̱sulazuva a ca yi ta̱ ucira u na wa yuwan tsugono tsa Yahuda, a̱vu aza a Yahuda suru a̱ ta̱wusa̱a̱ Yehoshafat na̱ ne'en, a̱vu u tsura̱ utsuru wa̱ a̱bunda̱ na̱ tsugbain lon. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />Yehoshafat ca ta̱ aciya̱yi ulobonu a̱tsuma̱ e itoni ya̱ A̱sulazuva. Adama o ndolo a̱vu u kototo ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ na̱ a̱shuwutsu a Ashera diga e iɗa ya Yahuda.<verse eid="2CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />A̱tsuma̱ a'wan ta'atsu o tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi, a̱vu Yehoshafat lyungu azagbain a̱yi a̱ tyo a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci yu upasu wa Yahuda na o rito wa ama'a. Azagbain a na a̱ lyunguyi ele ɗa: Benhayi na̱ Obadiya na̱ Zakariya na̱ Netane na̱ Mikaya. <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" />Nan Levi o ro oɓolo na̱ nan ganu e re a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ oɓolo ne ele. Nan Levi ele ɗa: Shemaya na̱ Nataniya na̱ Zebadiya na̱ Asahe na̱ Shemiramo na̱ Yehonata na̱ Adonija na̱ Tobiya na̱ Tobadoniya. Nan ganu'u ele ɗa: Elishama na̱ Yehoram. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" />A̱vu a tara aatagada a̱ wila̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva o tonishi suru ilyuci yu upasu wa Yahuda o ritosu ama.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utsuru wa̱ Yehoshafat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />A̱vu wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva u reme nda̱na̱ta̱ n na n ri uka̱nda̱ruwu ni iɗa yu upasu wa Yahuda suru, adama o ndolo a̱ ta̱wa̱ le nu uvon shi. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" />Ozo o ro a̱tsuma̱ aza a Filistiya a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ Yehoshafat u une'e wi itana na̱ azurufa adama o utafa. Aza a Araba a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ a̱yi ta̱ ni ikyon ukpakukupa ucindere nu ukpakucindere (7,700) na̱ mgbele ukpakukupa ucindere nu ukpakucindere (7,700).<verse eid="2CH 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Yehoshafat da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱da̱shishi ucira. Wu suwa ta̱ ilyuci yi kari vu ucira ni ilyuci yi izuwa a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />U yuwan ta̱ izuwa yi itana ya̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci ya Yahuda. A̱vu u zuwa a̱soja na a gurai uvon lon a̱tsuma̱ a Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />Apa mekece me le o una̱ wu nkaya nle.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2CH 17:14" />
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 17:14">Diga o ugundo wa Yahuza nan yali o oɓolo o ukpakukupa ele ɗa,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 17:14">Adna yali ya̱ a̱soja vu ukpakukupa ukpakuta'atsu (300,000).<verse eid="2CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />Za na toni niyi a̱yi ɗa Yehohana yali ya̱ a̱soja o ukpakukupa ukpaku ure na̱ kupakunla̱ (280,000).<verse eid="2CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" />Za na toni niyi a̱yi ɗa Amasiya ulobo wa Zikiri za na cayi aciya̱yi adama o ulinga wa̱ A̱sulazuva, waru u da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱soja ukpakukupa ukpakure (200,000).<verse eid="2CH 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />Diga o ugundo wa Banyami:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="2CH 17:17">Eliyada ɗa yali ya̱ a̱soja vuma ɗa na gurai uvon lon, u da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱soja ukpakukupa ukpakure (200,000), za suru da̱na̱ ta̱ uɓa̱nu na̱ tan na̱ a̱ra̱ga̱.<verse eid="2CH 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />Za na toni niyi a̱yi ɗa Yehozabad, waru u da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱soja ukpakukupa ukpaku na̱ kupakunla̱ (180,000) aza a na a gurai uvon. <verse eid="2CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Ele nda ele ɗa a̱soja naa a yuwayin mogono ulinga a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, babu na aza a na Yehoshafat shushuwa̱i e ilyuci vu kari vu ucira a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda suru.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya Mika aciya Ahabu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 22:1-28">1 Ngo 22:1-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />Mogono Yehoshafat va Yahuda da̱na̱ ta̱ nu utsuru lon na̱ tsugbain. Agba u da̱na̱ ta̱ a muwwulai na̱ mogono Ahabu va Isra'ila na u zuwai ulobo wa̱ yi u zuwai usheli wa Ahabu. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2" />Ana a yuwain a'wan wa'a a̱vu Yehoshafat ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Samariya a Isra'ila na we ene mogono Ahabu. A̱vu Ahabu yuwan a̱buki wu paɗa ikyon ni inan ya̱ a̱bunda̱ adama a na wa ca Yehoshafat tsugbain na ama a̱yi. A̱vu Ahabu kpara Yehoshafat na wo oɓolo a aci na̱ yi na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ Ramot Giliyadu nu uvon. <verse eid="2CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:3" />A̱vu mogono Ahabu va Isra'ila damma mogono Yehoshafat va Yahuda, &lt;&lt;Ko vu ta̱ ta̱wa̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱mu na tsa yuwan uvon na̱ Ramot Giliyadu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:3">A̱vu mogono Yehoshafat usu u damma, &lt;&lt;N tu ufoɓu tsu wala. Ili yi lo shi, a̱soja a̱ va̱ a̱za̱ a̱ wu ɗa fo. Tsu ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon oɓolo na̱ a̱vu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Amma a̱vu Yehoshafat damma mogono ma Isra'ila, &lt;&lt;Tsu zami urewesu wa̱ A̱sulazuva ne'e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />A̱vu mogono Ahabu va Isra'ila ɓoloto ama̱sula̱ ukpaku una̱shi (400) a̱vu we ece ele, &lt;&lt;Tsu ka̱ra̱ tsu riya̱a̱ Ramot Giliyadu nu uvon, ko tsu lyawa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:5">A̱vu a̱ usu suru nle a damma, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu u jima, mogono! Vu ka̱ra̱, adama a na A̱sula̱ ta ca le e ekere a̱ wu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Amma a̱vu Yehoshafat da̱shi dammisa, &lt;&lt;Babu vumava̱sula̱ va̱ A̱sulazuva na tsa̱ da̱shi yuwan yeci?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />A̱vu mogono Ahabu va Isra'ila usu u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱ ta̱ tsura̱ vuma ta̱ na tsa zami urewesu wa̱ A̱sulazuva uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱yi, aala a̱yi ɗa Mikaya ulobo wa Imla. Amma gba n 'yuwan ta̱ mpasa ma̱ a̱yi adama a na u tsu ca udammu u sa'ani aciya̱va̱ shi, she iwuya goon.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:7">A̱vu Yehoshafat damma, &lt;&lt;O'o Mogono she vu yuwan adanshi tsundolo wan!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />A̱vu mogono Ahabu va Isra'ila ɗe za ro a̱tsuma̱ a̱soja a̱yi u damma, &lt;&lt;Vu jika̱ na va̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ Mikaya ulobo wa Imla pa nda.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />A̱vu mogono Ahabu va Isra'ila na̱ mogono Yehoshafat va Yahuda oto a̱tugu o tsugono, a̱vu a̱ da̱nu o otogu zuzu no osoroto a na a̱ ri zuzu nu una̱ntsu wa Samariya. A̱vu ama̱sula̱ suru a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a a yuwusan adanshi e ikaka elime ele. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ ele, Zedekiya ulobo wa Kena'ana, a̱vu u yuwan avana a̱rumu, u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;Na avana a nda a ɗa va sapa aza a Suriya hali o kototo le.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />A̱vu akapi ama̱sula̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva suru a ca udammu uta̱, adansa, &lt;&lt;Vu riya̱a̱ Ramot Giliyadu vu ta̱ tsura̱ ulyuwu wa a aci,&gt;&gt; A̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a ta ca le e ekere a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Malingata ma na a̱ lyunguyi na we ɗe Mikaya a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt; Ama̱sula̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva suru a yuwaan ta̱ ɗe mogono udammu u na wa̱ tsura̱ ulyuwu we elime. Adama o ndolo lyawa a̱vu fo vu yuwan ne, vu yuwan adanshi a na wo yo'onoto mogono okolo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" />Amma a̱vu Mikaya usu u damma, &lt;&lt;N kucina ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva a na a̱ ri wuma, n ta damma ili i na A̱sula̱ a dammai n damma goon.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />A mantsa ma na u rawai elime o mogono Ahabu, a̱vu mogono me ece yi, &lt;&lt;Mikaya, tsu ka̱ra̱ adama na tsa yuwan uvon na̱ Ramot Giliyadu, ko n lyawa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:14">A̱vu Mikaya usu yi u damma, &lt;&lt;Vu riya̱a̱ le vu ta̱ tsura̱ ulyuwu wa aci, adama a na a ta ca wu le e ekere a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Amma a̱vu mogono ma̱ usu yi, &lt;&lt;Hali uyan ɗa maa zuwa wu na va kucinaa a̱mu na va damma mu ili i ro wan na ka̱ra̱i amayun a̱tsuma̱ a ala a̱ A̱sulazuva?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" />A̱vu Mikaya usu u damma, &lt;&lt;Me ene ta̱ aza a Isra'ila suru ubetu'wu zuva vu nsasan va damma ikyon i na a̱ ri na̱ za va aguɓa shi. A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;Ele nda a̱ ri na̱ zagbain shi, lyawa za suru ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa̱ a̱yi na asuvu nden.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />A̱vu mogono ma Isra'ila ma damma Yehoshafat, &lt;&lt;Ashe n damma a̱ wu shi? A̱yi wa yuwan adanshi a sa'ani adama aciya̱va̱ shi, she iwuya shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />A̱vu Mikaya damma, &lt;&lt;Gogo, vu uwwa adanshi A̱sulazuva. Me ene'e ta̱ A̱sulazuva nden ootogu o tsugono tsa a̱yi oɓolo na̱ a̱soja a zuva suru lo mishin o ukere u sa'ani nu ugula̱ wa̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;Zane ɗa ri lo na 'ya̱wa̱ u luluma̱ Ahabu mogono ma aza a Isra'ila na wa̱ 'ya̱wa̱ nu uvon adama a na wa̱ kuwa̱ a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Ramot Giliyadu?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:19">&lt;&lt;Reve a̱ ta̱wusa̱a̱ na̱ a̱sa̱la̱ icu'un icu'un. <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />O ukosu a̱vu ruhu ro uta̱ a̱vu wi isawan mishin elime a̱ A̱sulazuva u damma, &lt;N ta̱ luluma̱ yi.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:20">&lt;&lt; A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ usu yi u damma, &lt;Cine tsu ɗa va gura?&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu ruhu'u u damma yi, &lt;N ta̱ ka̱ra̱ na mo o'wo ruhu ve epen a̱tsuma̱ o una̱ wa ama̱sula̱ a̱yi.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 18:21">&lt;&lt;A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;'ya̱wa̱ na va̱a̱ luluma̱ yi, vu ta lyuwa aciya̱yi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />A̱vu Mikaya damma &lt;&lt;Adama o ndolo A̱sulazuva a zuwa ta̱ ruhu ve epen a̱tsuma̱ o una̱ wa ama̱sula̱ a̱ wu, adama a na A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ wu na̱ meleshe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />A̱vu Zedekiya ulobo wa Kena'ana 'yon u ɓasa Mikaya o ugbaguzu, a̱vu we ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nu ure u ne u ɗa ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva toniyi a̱vu u lyawa mu reve u yuwan adanshi na̱ a̱vu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />A̱vu Mikaya usu u damma, &lt;&lt;Vu ta̱ reve a̱tsuma̱ o urana u na va suma vu pa'an pe pe a̱tsuma̱ asula.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Adama o ndolo a̱vu Ahabu mogono ma Isra'ila ma ca udammu, &lt;&lt;Remei Mikaya a̱vu i tarai a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa Amon zagbain lyuci nu uba̱ta̱ wa Yowash ulobo mogono. <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />A̱vu i damma, &lt;Apa ili i na mogono ma dammai, a zuwa Mikaya a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa ali a̱vu a casu yi opopofu ke'en na̱ mini hali acina mantsa ma na ma̱ ka̱mba̱ gbaga diga uba̱ta̱ o uvon.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />A̱vu Mikaya damma, &lt;&lt;N na̱ vu ta̱wa̱ gbaga, A̱sulazuva a ɗa a yuwain adanshi na̱ a̱mu shi.&gt;&gt; A̱vu u da̱shi u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱ɗu ama yu uwwa adanshi a̱ va̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">O una ta̱ Ahabu a̱tsuma̱ Ramot va Giliyadu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 22:29-35">1 Ngo 22:29-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />A̱vu mogono Ahabu va Isra'ila na̱ mogono Yehoshafat va Yahuda a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Ramot Giliyadu. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />A̱vu mogono Ahabu damma Yehoshafat, &lt;&lt;N ta vadala iroci i va̱ na ma uwa uvon, amma a̱vu vo oto a̱tugu o tsugono tsa̱ wu.&gt;&gt; A mantsa mo ndolo a̱vu Ahabu mogono ma Isra'ila ma vadala iroci ya̱ a̱yi a̱vu u uwa uvon.<verse eid="2CH 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Mogono ma Suriya ma̱ shi ta̱ ma ca udammu e ekere a nan yali yi ikeke yi ido, &lt;&lt;She i yuwan uvon na̱ za ro wan, ko vuma ke'en ko zagbain wan, she mogono ma Isra'ila goon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Ana nan yali yi ikeke yi ido'o e enei Yehoshafat, a yuwan ta̱ majiyan, &lt;&lt;A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa mogono ma Isra'ila.&gt;&gt; Reve a vadala adama a yuwan uvon na̱ a̱yi, amma a na u showeyin A̱sulazuva a kamba yi, reve u kamba yi. Reve A̱sula̱ a wawa yi e ekere le. <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />A mantsa ma na nan yali yi ikeke yi ido'o e revei na a̱yi ɗa mogono ma Isra'ila shi, a̱vu a lyawa masaɓa ma̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Amma a̱vu nanza tewin liya va̱ yi ivama, a̱vu u tawan mogono ma Isra'ila nu upasu wi itana yu uvon ya̱ yi. A̱vu mogono ma damma za na a̱a̱ gba̱rusa̱ ikeke yi ido ya̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Vadala vu uta̱a̱ mu uba̱ta̱ wu uvon u nda, adama a na a amaton mu ta̱ lon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Uvon u suɗuwa ta̱ lon urana u ndolo ma̱ɓula̱. A̱vu e keɗe mogono ma Isra'ila a gawan a̱tsuma̱ a̱ keke vi ido va̱ yi elime aza a Suriya hali acina ulivu. Urana a̱ ma̱riya̱a̱ reve u ukwa̱.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="s">Yehoshafat ɗangula ta̱ a̱za̱ o uge'etosu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Reve Mogono Yehoshafat ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima gbaga. <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" />A̱vu Yehu za yindi, ulobo wa Hanani, uta̱ adama u ga'aton yi, a̱vu u damma mogono Yehoshafat, &lt;&lt;Vu ta kamba aza a na a yuwusan iwuya a̱vu vu ciga aza a na a 'yuwain A̱sulazuva? Adama ndolo, upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva uta̱ da̱na̱ aciya̱wu. <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" />Suru na̱ ne, a̱ a̱tsura̱ ta̱ ili i sa'ani ya̱ wu, na vu tawai a̱shuwutsu a Ashera a̱vu vu ta̱wa̱ no okolo wu uba̱ta̱ wi izami ya̱ A̱sula̱. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Yehoshafat da̱na̱ ta̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ Urishelima, a̱vu u da̱na̱ a̱ 'ya̱wusa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa ama a̱yi, diga a̱ lyuci va Biyasheba a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci va agaɗi ya Ifiramu adama a na wa vadala le na a̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ nkaya nle. <verse eid="2CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" />A̱vu u ɗangula a̱za̱ o uge'etosu a̱ lyuci, e ilyuci i na i ri na̱ ka̱ri vu ucira a̱tsuma̱ o upasu wa Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" />A̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;I zuwa ugbozu e ili i na yaa yuwan, adama a na uge'etosu u na yaa yuwusan nda za vuma ɗa shi amma za va̱ A̱sulazuva ɗa. Za na ri oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu a mantsa ma na yaa yuwusan uge'etosu. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" />Gogo lyawa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu. I da̱na̱ nu ugbozu o uge'etosu, adama a na uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱tsu babu ɗe ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ ko tsuzo'o ko utosu wu una̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />A̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Urishelima waru, Yehoshafat ɗangula ta̱ ozo o ro a̱za̱ a̱ Levi na̱ nan ganu na azagbain a 'wa va aza a Isra'ila, na a yuwan uge'etosu u wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva adama a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ mejege uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱za̱ o nronuloi. Reve a̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ a Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" />A̱vu u ca le udammu u nda, i yuwan ulinga a̱tsuma̱ amayun na̱ wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva no okolo a̱ɗu suru. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" />A̱tsuma̱ adanshi a na biti ama a̱ɗu a̱a̱ ta̱wa̱yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden e ilyuci yi iɗa'a, u ta gura o'wo ili i na i burai wocosu wu mpasa ɗa, ko makuɗa ma̱ wila̱ wa Musa, ko ili i na a zuwai, ko ili i na ya̱a̱ kuru, ko udammu, mantsa ma na a̱ ta̱wa̱i na aɗa'a suru i rono le atsuvu adama she ronoo aciyele unusu uba̱ta̱ A̱sulazuva wan. Na̱ ne shi upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ta̱ cipa̱ aciya̱ɗu oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ɗu. N ni i yuwan tsutoni na̱ a̱yi ndolo, yo ronoo aciya̱ɗu unusu shi. <verse eid="2CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" />&lt;&lt;A̱yi ɗa nda, Amariya ganu gbain ɗa a yuwan tsugbain tsa a̱ɗu a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na i ri za va̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu Zebadiya ulobo wa Isma'ila zagbain vu ugundo wa Yahuda yuwan tsugbain tsa̱ a̱ɗu o una̱ wi ili i na i burai tsugono. Nan Levi oto o'wo aza a na a̱da̱na̱ kambusa ɗu. I gbama asuvu a̱tsuma̱ o ulinga u ɗu. Lyawa A̱sulazuva a̱da̱na̱ oɓolo na aza a na a yuwusan ulinga u na u ri mejege.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="s">Yehoshafat lyuwa ta̱ Mowa na̱ Amon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />Ana yi ndolo kotoi a̱vu a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa na̱ Amon na̱ a̱za̱ o ro a Menuta a̱ ta̱wa̱ na a yuwan uvon na̱ Yehoshafat.<verse eid="2CH 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />A̱vu ama o ro a̱ ta̱wa̱ a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Apa a̱soja a̱bunda̱ diga Edom a̱ tu ɗe upasu u mala a̱ ta̱wa̱ wu nu uvon. Gogo a rawa tu ɗe Hazazon Tamar&gt;&gt; za na a̱yi ɗa En Gedi. <verse eid="2CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" />Yehoshafat uwwa ta̱ wovon lon, a̱vu u zami urewesu wa̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu u ca udammu a yuwan akuli e iɗa ya Yahuda suru. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />A̱vu ama e ilyuci yu upasu wa Yahuda oɓoloto adama a zami A̱sulazuva waru a yuwan izami yi ikambishi diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />A̱vu Yehoshafat 'yon mishin elime o oɓolo a ama a Yahuda na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Urishelima a̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva elime o ukowo u sa'avu. <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" />A̱vu u 'ya̱sa̱n uɗyo a̱tsuma̱ a avasa u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ nkaya ntsu, ashe a̱vu ɗa A̱sula̱ za na ri zuva shi? Ashe a̱vu ɗa va yuwusan tsugono tsa̱ tsugono tsu uvaɗi ma̱bula̱ shi? Ucira na̱ tsugbain a̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu, waru babu za na rawai na woo rono na̱ a̱vu. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" />A̱vu A̱sula̱ a̱tsu, ashe a̱vu ɗa vu gba̱ra̱i nda̱na̱ta̱ mu nɗa nda esu ama a̱ wu aza a Isra'ila shi? Ashe a̱vu ɗa vu cayi n'utsa̱ ma̱ wu Ibrahim agadu e iɗa i nda hali hali shi? <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />A̱vu a̱ da̱nu pe a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a, waru pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱yi ɗa a suwa nuwu Uba̱ta̱ wa Akiza adama a cuwa aala a̱ wu. <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" />Waru a ca ta̱ okolo adansa, &lt;N na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱tsu, ko uge'etosu, ko addama, ko ambulu. N na̱ tsundolo fara, tsu ta̱ ta̱wa̱ elime a̱ wu a̱tsuma̱ o U'wa u nda uba̱ta̱ u na a cuwai Aala a̱ wu, tsu shon a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ wu adama atakaci a̱tsu, a̱vu waru vu ta uwwa reve vu usu tsu.&gt;<verse eid="2CH 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" />&lt;&lt;Gogo gba, apa ili i na a̱soja Amon na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa na aza a Masasan ma̱ Seyi a yuwusan. Ele ɗa aza a na vu putsayi aza a Isra'ila na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ le nu uvon a mantsa ma na o uta̱i a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Masar. Adama o ndolo, a̱vu a kanzu'wa, agba o kototo le shi. <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" />To, gogo idana cine a cigai na a tsupaa a̱tsu! Ele ɗa a zama na a̱ gba̱ra̱ a̱tsu diga a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na vu ca ntsu wo o'wo agadu a̱tsu. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" />A̱vu A̱sula̱ a̱tsu, vee ge'eto le shi? Adama a na tsu ri nu ucira u na tsa yuwan uvon na̱ a̱soja a̱bunda̱, a na a̱ ri ɗe a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ tsu nu uvon shi. Tsu reve ili i na tsa yuwan shi, adama o ndolo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu u ɗa tsu zuwai esu a̱tsu e izami yi ikambishi. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />Suru ama a Yahuda a̱ da̱na̱ lo mishin elime A̱sulazuva oɓolo na̱ muwun ke'en ke'en nle na̱ a̱ma̱ci e le oɓolo na̱ muwun nle.<verse eid="2CH 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />A̱vu Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ cipa̱a̱ Yahaziye ulobo wa Zakariya, mawun ma tsukaya ma Benaya ulobo wa Jeyiye, ulobo wa Mataniya diga o u'wa wa Asaf vu ugundo wa̱ Levi.<verse eid="2CH 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" />A̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Uwwai suru nɗu, na̱ ama a Yahuda suru, na̱ nda̱na̱ta̱ ma̱ Urishelima oɓolo na̱ Mogono Yehoshafat. Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a damma n ɗu, &lt;She yuwan wovon wan, ko i kuɗa okolo a̱ɗu wan, adama a̱ a̱soja a̱bunda̱ a nda wan. Adama a na uvo'on za ɗu ɗa shi, amma za va A̱sula̱ ɗa. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Nfa'an yu uta̱ i zura̱ i yuwan uvon ne le. A̱ ta̱ uta̱ nu Uwata wa̱ Ziz, waru i ta cina le za̱la̱ vu uka̱ri na toniyi a̱ tyo a̱tsumona a Yeruye. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" />Amma a̱ɗu ɗa ya yuwan uvo'on shi. A̱ɗu de i yuwan ifoɓi yu uvon goon, i dara aciya̱ɗu yi isawan kpen, ye ene cine A̱sulazuva a̱tsura̱ u lyuwu wa a aci adama a̱ɗu. A̱ɗu ama o upasu wa Yahuda na̱ Urishelima, she yu uwwa wovon wan ko na ya kuɗa okolo a̱ɗu, adama a na A̱sulazuva oto oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu. Nfa'an yu uta̱ i yuwan uvon ne le!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" />A̱vu Mogono Yehoshafat ka̱ɗa̱to nu urewesu wa̱ yi a̱ tyo e iɗa. Ne ɗa fo ama a Yahuda suru na̱ nda̱na̱ta̱ ma̱ Urishelima a yuwain. A yuwayin A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" />A̱vu a̱za̱ a̱ Levi diga o ugundo wa̱ Koha na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Kora a̱ 'yon mishin adama a cuwa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila nu uɗyo gbain.<verse eid="2CH 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" />A̱vu a̱soja a Yahuda a̱ 'yon nu usana usana a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo a̱ A̱tsumona a Tekowa. A mantsa ma na a̱ ri a̱ mota̱a̱ a̱vu Mogono Yehoshafat me e isawan u damma le, &lt;&lt;Uwwa numu, a̱ɗu ama a Yahuda na̱ nda̱na̱ta̱ ma̱ Urishelima. I ca okolo a̱ɗu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ɗu, i ta̱ tsura̱ ulyuwu wa a aci. Waru i ca okolo a̱ɗu uba̱ta̱ wa ama̱sula̱ a̱yi, i tsura̱ ulyuwu we elime.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" />A mantsa ma na u yuwain a̱sa̱la̱ na a ama, a̱vu u ɗangula ama a na a̱ ka̱ra̱ elime a̱ a̱soja na a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ishipa yi ica a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, na a cuwusa niyi adama e isa'ani ya akiza a̱yi, adansa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CH 20:21">&lt;&lt;I godyowo A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CH 20:21">adama a na icigi ya̱ yi i tsu vadala shi hali hali.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22" />A mantsa ma na e remei ishipa yi ica'a, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a vawan a̱soja a Amon na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa na̱ a̱za̱ e iɗa ya Masasan ma̱ Seyi, a̱vu a̱soja'a a̱ ra̱pula̱ e teme uvon va̱ni le. <verse eid="2CH 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:23" />A̱vu a̱soja a̱ Amon na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa a̱ 'yon na a̱ riya̱a̱ nda̱na̱ta̱ m Masasan ma̱ Seyi adama o kototo le waru a̱ rukutsa̱ le kpa̱ra̱. A mantsa ma na o kotoi wupaɗu wa ama a̱ Seyi, reve a̱ ka̱mba̱ a̱ munulai va̱ niyi le.<verse eid="2CH 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />A mantsa ma na a̱ a̱soja a Yahuda a rawai aagaɗi a na a gura ene a̱tsumona uba̱ta̱ u na o oɓolo a̱soja o ndolo a̱ ri, a̱vu e ene a̱kwa̱kwa̱ a ama uba̱ta̱ suru! Babu za na la'ai. <verse eid="2CH 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Ana Yehoshafat na̱ a̱soja a̱yi a rawai uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ pura̱ itana yu uvon, a̱vu acina itana ya̱ a̱bunda̱ ni itana i wotosu ni ili yu ulobonu ya̱ a̱bunda̱ na a gura tanu le suru shi. Hali she na a yuwain rana ta'atsu ɗaɗa a gura pura̱i itana'a suru. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />O urana wa̱ na̱shi a̱vu oɓoloto o Uka̱ri wa Beraka, a̱vu a yuwan ica a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. Adama o ndolo a ɗa a̱ tsu ɗe uba̱ta̱'a̱ Uka̱ri wa Beraka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beraka </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urevu wa̱ yi u ɗa Aba'un.</char></note> hali na ana'an. <verse eid="2CH 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />A̱vu ama a Yahuda a̱ ka̱mba̱ a 'wa suru. A̱vu Mogono Yehoshafat walaa le elime a̱ ka̱mbusa̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ca le ta̱ ulyuwu wa a aci e ekere n'yuwatan nle. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Reve a uwa a̱tsuma̱ Urishelima a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ ma taɗa me igaraya ni ikumburu na̱ wi ivulusa̱ wa avana.<verse eid="2CH 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" />A mantsa ma na akapi a̱ nda̱na̱ta̱ n na ri uka̱nda̱ruwu ne ele a uwwai alabari e ili i na A̱sulazuva a yuwayin n'yuwatan ma aza a Isra'ila, reve wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva e reme ele. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" />Adama o ndolo ɗa tsugono tsa̱ Yehoshafat tsa̱ da̱na̱i na asuvu nden babu uvon. Adama a na A̱sula̱ a ca yi ta̱ nden n lafiya uba̱ta̱ suru.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukosu u tsugono tsa a Yehoshafat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 22:41-50">1 Ngo 22:41-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />Yehoshafat yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa a Yahuda. U da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a'wan mata'atsu no ozo ton a mantsa ma na u temei tsugono. Waru u yuwan tsugono a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a'wan ushin no ozo o ton. Aala a mma va̱ a̱yi ɗa Azuba usheli wa Shilihi. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />U yuwan ta̱ mmalu a̱tsuma̱ o ure u na u ri mejege tsa dada va̱ a̱yi Asa, u lyawa ure'e shi. U yuwan ta̱ ili i na i ri mejege o urewesu wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Suru na̱ ne, u kototo ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ shi, waru ama a Yahuda a zuwa okolo le uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ nkaya nle shi.<verse eid="2CH 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />Suru akapi o ulinga u na Yehoshafat yuwain, diga o ufaru acina o ukosu, a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ pe uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada a alabari a̱ Yehu ulobo wa Hanani. Waru a̱ ta̱ uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada a alabari o ngono ma Isra'ila.<verse eid="2CH 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />Ana a̱yi ndolo kotoi, a̱vu Yehoshafat mogono ma Yahuda yuwan muwwulai na̱ Ahaziya mogono ma Isra'ila za na yuwain iwuya. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" />A̱vu uɓolo ukere na̱ yi a yuwan antsun a̱ mini adama a̱ ma̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ma Tarshishi. Uba̱ta̱ u na a yuwain antsun a̱ mini'i a Eziyon Geba. <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" />A̱vu Eliyaza ulobo wa Dodawahu diga Maresha ɓara Yehoshafat u damma, &lt;&lt;Na wo o'woi vu yuwain tsu'utsa̱ na̱ Ahaziya, A̱sulazuva oto kototo suru ili i na vu suwai.&gt;&gt;Adama o ndolo a̱vu antsun a̱ mini'i oɓoso a gura yuwan mmalu waru a̱ tyo Tarshishi shi.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />Ana Yehoshafat kuwa̱i, a̱vu a̱ ciɗo a̱yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda. A̱vu ulobo wa̱ yi Jehoram o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsugono tsa Yehoram va Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 8:17-24">2 Ngo 8:17-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />Yehoram ulobo wa Yehoshafat da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ muwun ma̱ a̱na̱wun mo o olobo a̱ ta̱li. Ele ɗa: Azariya na̱ Yehiye na̱ Zakariya na̱ Azariyahu na̱ Mikaye na̱ Shefatiya. Suru nle olobo a Yehoshafat ɗa mogono ma Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Dada le Yehoshafat ca le ta̱ ne'e va̱ a̱bunda̱ u azurufa na̱ zinariya ni itana i na i ri ulobonu ni ilyuci i na i ri na̱ kari vu ucira a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda. Amma u ca ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi e ekere a Jehoram adama a na a̱yi ɗa mawun mo ufaru.<verse eid="2CH 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />A mantsa ma na Jehoram enei tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi tsa̱ shuwa̱ ta̱, reve wu una a̱za̱ a̱yi oɓolo na azagbain o ro a Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" />Jehoram da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan mata'atsu ne ejere na wo o'woi mogono, U yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa a'wan kunla̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" />U yuwan ta̱ mmalu ma̱ a̱yi cine ngono ma Isra'ila n yuwain, u yuwan ta̱ iwuya e ekere A̱sulazuva cine Ahabu yuwain. U yuwan ta̱ ne adama a na ka va̱ yi usheli wa Ahabu Mogono ma Isra'ila ɗa. <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" />Suru na̱ ne, adama a nzuwulai n na A̱sulazuva a yuwain na̱ Da̱wuda, A̱sulazuva a ciga na wo o kototo u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda shi. U yuwan ta̱ nzuwulai wa lamba za na a yuwan tsugono a̱tsuma̱ a limatan va̱ a̱yi hali hali shi.<verse eid="2CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ama Edom a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ a aci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />A mantsa mo tsugono tsa̱ Yehoram, a̱vu a ama a Edom a̱ 'ya̱sa̱a̱n tsugono tsa Yahuda a aci, a̱vu a katala aciyele mogono. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />A̱vu Jehoram ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo Edom, a̱yi na̱ a̱soja a̱yi ni ikeke yi ido ya̱ a̱yi. A̱vu a̱za̱ a̱ Edom a kandarai oɓolo na̱ nan yali yi ikeke yi ido ya̱ a̱yi, amma a̱vu a̱ 'yon na ayin a suma a la'a. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Diga lo hali acina a na'an a̱za̱ a̱ Edom a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱susa̱a̱n tsugono tsa Yahuda a aci.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 21:10">A mantsa mo o ndolo ma ɗa fo lyuci va Libina yuwain ne, tsundolo fara ta̱ adama a na Yehoram vadalayi A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya nle ucina̱. <verse eid="2CH 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />Yehoram suwa ta̱ ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ agaɗi a Yahuda na u zuwai nda̱na̱ta̱ ma̱ Urishelima n yuwain ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱, a̱vu a yuwan tsushakala uba̱ta̱ u mayan ma̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ uba̱ta̱ u musula̱, waru u zuwa aza a Yahuda a lyawa ure wa̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="2CH 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mepepelime ma̱ Iliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12" />A̱vu vumava̱sula̱ Iliya ɗanaa Yehoram mepepelime u damma: &lt;&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a dada va̱ wu Da̱wuda, dammai: &lt;Vu yuwan mmalu a̱tsuma̱ o ure u va̱ cine dada va̱ wu Yehoshafat yuwain, ko cine Asa Mogono ma Yahuda ma yuwain shi. <verse eid="2CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:13" />Amma vu yuwan ta̱ mmalu a̱tsuma̱ o ure wu ngono ma Isra'ila, a̱vu vu zuwa ama a Urishelima na̱ nda̱na̱ta̱ ma Yahuda e teme ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ cine u'wa wa Ahabu u zuwai Isra'ila yuwayin A̱sulazuva ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱. Reve fo vu una a̱za̱ a̱ wu aza a na i ri dada ta̱, aza a na ala'a nuwu a̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="2CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />Agba gogo, a̱mu A̱sulazuva n ta̱ lyungu na addama o usuɗuwu e ekere ama wu no olobo a̱ wu na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ wu ni ili i na vu ri na̱ yi suru. <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" />Agba a̱vu gba vu ta̱ reme mɓa̱la̱ n tsishi n wuya, za na a̱da̱na̱ a tamusa wu urana suru, hali she ni itana ya̱ a̱tsuma̱ ya̱ wu o uta̱ alanga.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n upan wa aza a Filistiya na̱ Araba aza a na a̱ ri nden zuzu na̱ Kush a aci o Mogono Jehoram. <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />A̱vu iɗa i ndolo a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ riya̱a̱ Yahuda nu uvon, a̱vu a̱ pura̱ itana i sa'ani i na a cinai o u'wa u mogono suru, oɓolo na̱ olobo a̱yi na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱yi. Za na lyawai goon a̱yi ɗa Ahaziya ulobo wu ukosu.<verse eid="2CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Ana ili nda i kotoi suru, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a lapa yi na̱ mɓa̱la̱ n tsishi za na ri na̱ a̱guma̱ shi. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" />Ele lo, na yuwain a'wan e re, a̱vu itana ya̱ a̱tsuma̱ ya Yehoram o uta̱ alanga adama o usa̱n wu mɓa̱la̱, reve u kuwa̱ a̱tsuma̱ o usa̱n lon. Ama a̱yi agba a 'yuwan ta na a zuwaa yi akina a̱ tsugbain, cine a yuwayin nkaya ma̱ yi. <verse eid="2CH 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />Yehoram da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a'wan mata'atsu ne ejere na wo o'woi mogono, waru u yuwan ta̱ tsugono a'wan kunla̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima. Waru babu za na la̱nga̱i a̱tsuma̱ nu ukwisa̱ wa̱ yi. A̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda, agba a ciɗo yi ason ngono shi.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="s">Ahaziya o'wo ta̱ mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 8:25-29">2 Ngo 8:25-29</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:21-28">9:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />A̱vu nda̱na̱ta̱ ma̱ Urishelima a katala Ahaziya ulobo wu ukosu wa̱ Jehoram mogono o una̱ wa dada va̱ yi, adama a na o oɓolo ama a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i diga Araba a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ nu uvon a̱tsuma̱ o uva̱la̱ta̱ wa aza a Isra'ila, reve o una aza a kpakpara o olobo suru. Ne ɗa Ahaziya farai tsugono tsa a Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" />Ahaziya da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan ushin ne ejere na wo o'woi mogono, u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ a̱ Urishelima a'wan a̱ ta̱. Aala a mma va̱ yi ɗa Ataliya, mawun ma tsukaya ma Omri.<verse eid="2CH 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />A̱yi fo u toni ta̱ ure wu u'wa wa Ahabu, adama a na mma va̱ yi casu yi ta̱ a̱sa̱la̱ na wa yuwan iwuya. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />U yuwan ta̱ iwuya uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva cine u'wa wa Ahabu u yuwain, adama a na a mantsa ma na dada va̱ yi kuwa̱i, ele ɗa a̱ da̱na̱i a casu yi a̱sa̱la̱ a na a̱ ta̱wa̱ niyi nu ukototosu. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />U yuwan ta̱ tsutoni na̱ a̱sa̱la̱ le a̱vu u ɓolo a aci na̱ Jehoram ulobo wa Ahabu mogono ma Isra'ila a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a yuwan uvon na̱ Hazayel mogono ma Suriya ɗe Ramot Giliyadu. A̱vu aza a Suriya amaton Yoram, <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />a̱vu u suma a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci va̱ Yezireyel adama o usa̱n u na amatoniyi ɗe a Rama uba̱ta̱ o uvon u na u yuwain na̱ Hazayel mogono ma Suriya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 22:6">Reve Ahaziya ulobo wa̱ Jehoram mogono ma Yahuda ma̱ 'ya̱wa̱ adama a na wa̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ Joram ulobo wa Ahabu adama o usa̱n u na amatoniyi.<verse eid="2CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />Amma adama o ka̱lyuwusa̱ wa Yoram, reve A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ nu ukototosu wa Ahaziya. A mantsa ma na Ahaziya rawai, a̱vu o uta̱ oɓolo na̱ Jehoram adama a na a ga'aton Yehu ulobo wa Nimishi, za na A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱a̱n mani'in u kototo u'wa wa Ahabu suru. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" />A mantsa ma na Yehu da̱na̱i o uge'etosu wu u'wa wa Ahabu, a̱vu uga'an na azagbain a Yahuda, oɓolo no olobo a mmaci ma Ahaziya, aza a na a yuwusan yi a̱ga̱nda̱, a̱vu wu una le. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" />Reve Yehu uwa izami ya Ahaziya, a̱vu ama a̱yi e remei cina upa'an a̱tsuma̱ a Samariya. A̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ yi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Yehu a̱vu o una yi. A̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi, adama a na a dammai, &lt;&lt;A̱yi ulobo wa̱ Yehoshafat ɗa, za na yuwayin A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱ no okolo a̱yi suru.&gt;&gt; Agba a̱ tsura̱ lo nanza a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa Azariya za na a gura yuwan tsugono tse e iɗa'a shi.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ataliya usa ta̱ tsugono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 11:1-3">2 Ngo 11:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />Ana Ataliya mma va Ahaziya mogono me enei ulobo wa̱ yi u kuwa̱ ta̱, a̱vu u kototo muwun mu u'wa n tsugono tsa Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Amma Yehosheba usheli u mogono Yehoram, iva̱ ta̱ Yowash ulobo wa Ahaziya a̱tsuma̱ a̱ muwun n mogono aza a na a zama o una oɓolo na̱ za vi ɓa̱ni va̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ aasula e nven. Adama a na Yehosheba usheli wa̱ Jehoram mogono na̱ ka va Yehoyida ganu muwun ma a̱na̱wun ma Ahaziya ɗa, a̱vu u soko mawu'un adama a na she Ataliya unai wan. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Yowash yuwan ta̱ a'wan a̱ ta̱li upa'awun a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱ oɓolo ne le, Ataliya gba a yuwusan tsugono tse e iɗa'a.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="s">A̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ Ataliya a aci</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 11:4-16">2 Ngo 11:4-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />A̱tsuma̱ a'wan a̱ cindere a̱vu Yehoyida ganu yuwan okolo o ugbamu, a̱vu u yuwan akucunu na̱ nan yali o oɓolo o ukpaku ukpaku: Azariya ulobo wa Yeroham na̱ Isma'ila ulobo wa Yehohana na̱ Azariya ulobo wa Obed na̱ Ma'aseya ulobo wa Adaya na̱ Elishafa ulobo wa Zikiri, <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />o uta̱ a̱ kuru ni iɗa ya Yahuda reve oɓoloto a̱za̱ a̱ Levi na azagbain a 'wa va aza a Isra'ila diga e ilyuci suru. Ana a̱ ta̱wa̱i a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, <verse eid="2CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" />a̱vu oɓolo suru a yuwan nzuwulai na̱ mogono a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 23:3">A̱vu Yehoyida ganu damma le, &lt;&lt;Apa ulobo u mogono, za na a lyuwa tsugono cine A̱sulazuva a yuwain nzuwulai adama o ugundo wa̱ Da̱wuda. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Apa ili i na ya yuwan: A mantsa ma na nan ganu na̱ nan Levi a̱ ta̱wa̱i na a yuwan ulinga a̱tsuma̱ o urana wa Ashibi, za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ aza a ta'atsu a̱ ɗu a ta yuwan ipiri yu una̱ntsu, <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ aza a ta'atsu a̱ ɗu waru u ta̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo o u'wa u mogono, za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ aza a ta'atsu gba u te e isawan uba̱ta̱ wu una̱ntsu wi ikyun wu uwata. Suru akapi ama o to ɓoloto o ukowo wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" />She i lyawa nanza uwa pe a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva wan, nan ganu ɗa goon na̱ nan Levi aza a na a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ pe ɗa a uwa adama a na le aza akiza ɗa. Amma akapi ama suru a yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na A̱sulazuva a damma nle. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Nan Levi a̱ ta̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ mogono'o, suru nle a̱ ta̱ guza̱ matsun me pe'eni e ekere ele. Suru za na ta̱wa̱i adama a na wa uwa pe A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a a̱ ta̱ o unai. Yi isawan zuzu na̱ mogono'o uba̱ta̱ u na u tyo yi biti. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />A̱vu nan Levi na̱ akapi ama a Yahuda suru a yuwan ili i na Yehoyida ganu damma nle suru. A̱vu azagbain a̱ ta̱wa̱ na aza a na a yuwan ulinga'a, na aza a na aa lyawa ulinga o urana wa Ashibi'i, adama a na Yehoyida ganu lyawa nanza na wa̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo o u'wa shi diga oɓolo'o. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />A̱vu Yehoyida ganu ca nan yali vu kpaku kpaku ibata na̱ a̱ra̱ga̱ a gbain gbain na̱ a̱za̱ ke'en ke'en a̱za̱ a̱ Mogono Da̱wuda na da̱na̱i A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱. <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />A̱vu u zuwa ama na a̱da̱na̱ u ka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ mogono, za suru ni itana yu uvon e ekere a̱yi, zuzu na̱ mogono na̱ masa'a na̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa, diga upasu wu uyagi acina upasu wu ugana wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa.<verse eid="2CH 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" />A̱vu Yehoyida ganu no o olobo a̱yi o uta̱a̱ ulobo u Mogono, a̱vu o oto yi okokolo, a̱vu a cayi aatagada a nzuwulai, a̱vu o'wo oto yi mogono. A̱vu a̱ tsuwa̱yin mani'in a sala, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu u jima, mogono!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Ana Ataliya uwwai elemu na̱ cine ama a̱ ri e ilaɗi na a yuwusayin ica ya aala o mogono, a̱vu u ka̱ra̱ u cina le pe A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />Ana u ka̱lyuwa̱i, a̱vu we ene mogono mishin atsura a̱yi o una̱ntsu. Azagbain na aza a na e ivulusa̱ avana uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ mogono, waru ama a nɗa'a suru a yuwusan ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ ivulusa̱ wa avana, na ashipi ni itana i malapa a matara me ishipa. Reve Ataliya kakara itana ya̱ yi u sala, &lt;&lt;I paala mu ta̱! I paala mu ta̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />A̱vu Yehoyida ganu lyungu nan yali o oɓolo o ukpaku ukpaku, aza a na a̱ ri azagbain o oɓolo, a̱vu u damma le: &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱i na̱ yi e memere ma̱ a̱soja, a̱vu yu una za na toni niyi biti na̱ matsun me pe'eni.&gt;&gt; Adama a na ganu damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;She yu unai pa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Reve e reme yi o uta̱ yi a̱ tyo o una̱ntsu u na ido ya usaan o ukobu u mogono, a̱vu o unai ɗe.<verse eid="2CH 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />A̱vu Yehoyida yuwan nzuwulai a̱yi na ama oɓolo na̱ mogono na o to o'wo ama A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" />A̱vu suru ama a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo a̱a̱'isa̱ a Ba'al, a̱vu o ɓosoi she e iɗa. A̱vu a̱ rukutsa̱ musa'a na̱ musula̱ ma̱ a̱yi a̱vu waru o una Matan ganu va Ba'al e elime a musa'a.<verse eid="2CH 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" />A̱vu Yehoyida zuwa aza a na a yuwan ipiri ya̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva e ekere a nan ganu, aza a na ele ɗa nan Levi, aza a na Da̱wuda foɓoi a̱da̱na̱ a yuwusan ulinga a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa, a ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, cine u ri uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ wila̱ wa̱ Musa, na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ ni ishipa ununa Da̱wuda dammai. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />Waru u zuwa ta̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri o una̱ntsu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, adama za na ri idaba suru uwa wan.<verse eid="2CH 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" />U tara ta̱ oɓolo na̱ yi nan yali o ukpaku ukpaku, na azagbain a ama na azagbain a̱ lyuci na̱ suru ama e iɗa, a̱vu a̱ cipa̱to mogono diga A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. A̱vu a uwa nu una̱ntsu wa zuva a̱vu a̱ da̱na̱to mogono ootogu o tsugono. <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" />A̱vu ama e iɗa'a suru a yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱. Lyuci'i waru u tsura̱ asuvu nden, adama a na o una ta̱ Ataliya na̱ matsun me pe'eni.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="s">Mogono Yowash lapula ta̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 12:1-21">2 Ngo 12:1-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />Yowash da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a'wan e cindere a na wo o'woi mogono. U yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ Urishelima a'wan amunga. Aala a mma va yi ɗa Zibiya diga lyuci va Biyasheba. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" />Yowash yuwan ta̱ ili i na i ri mejege e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva suru a̱tsuma̱ a'wan a na Yehoyida ganu da̱na̱i wuma. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Yehoyida ganu zuwa ta̱ a̱ma̱ci e re, waru a matsaan yi ta̱ olobo na̱ esheli.<verse eid="2CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Ana a tarai mantsa, a̱vu Yowash yuwan majiyan ma na wa lapula A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />A̱vu u ɓoloto nan ganu na̱ nan Levi a̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;Ka̱ra̱i a̱ tyo a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci ya Yahuda na ya̱ ushin ikebe ya a'wan diga e ekere aza a Isra'ila suru, adama o ulapulu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ɗu. I jika̱!&gt;&gt; Amma nan Levi a yuwan kazukazu shi.<verse eid="2CH 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" />Adama o ndolo a̱vu mogono ma̱ ɗe Yehoyida zagbain nan ganu a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Adama nye vu kuɗa̱i a zuwa nan Levi a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ Yahuda na̱ Urishelima a̱ ta̱wa̱ nu utafa u na aagbashi a̱ A̱sulazuva Musa zuwai, diga e iɓolo ya aza a Isra'ila adama a na tsa lapula Oogodo o Uga'asusan shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" />Adama a na ɗe na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ olobo a ka vama ndolo a Ataliya a uwa ta̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱, reve a̱ pura̱ itana ya akiza adama o ulinga wa Ba'al. <verse eid="2CH 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />Adama o ndolo a̱vu mogono ma zuwa a yuwan akpati, a̱vu a zuwayi alanga o una̱ntsu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" />Reve a sala e iɗa ya Yahuda na̱ Urishelima a na a̱ ta̱wa̱ nu utafa u le na Musa aagbashi A̱sulazuva a dammai aza a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ a mantsa ma na a̱ da̱na̱i ɗe a̱tsumona. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Azagbain suru na̱ ama suru a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ nu utafa u le na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱, aa zuwusa le pe a̱tsuma̱ akpati'i hali u shunwa. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Suru mantsa ma na nan Levi a̱ ta̱wa̱i na akpati'i u ba̱ta̱ wa azagbain o mogono reve e ene u shiwan ta̱, reve za vi iɗana i mogono na azagbain a nan ganu a̱ ta̱wa̱ o ko'o ili na i ri pe, a̱vu a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ yi uba̱ta̱ u na u tsu da̱na̱. A yuwusan ta̱ ne kuci hali a̱ tsa̱ra̱ ikebe ya̱ a̱bunda̱. <verse eid="2CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Mogono na̱ Yehoyida a ca ta̱ ikebe'e uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na e idanasa ulinga wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva'a. A̱vu a tara aza a na a yuwusan usaa na aza a mavara makpata adama a lapula A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, no ozo o ulinga wu rumu na̱ rumushili adama a lapula A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a.<verse eid="2CH 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />Ama a na a zuwai ulinga'a a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ta̱ ugbozu lon, ulinga'a waru u lyuwa ta̱ elime e ekere le. A lapula ta̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱'a̱ cine u da̱na̱i nu ufaru reve a̱ da̱shi yi ucira. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />A mantsa ma na o kotoi ulapulu'u suru, a̱vu a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ mogono na akapi e ikebe i na i buwai na̱ Yehoyida, na akapi e ikebe i ɗaɗa a yuwayin itana yu ulinga wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva: Itana yu ulinga ni itana adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu na akwanu na akapi e itana i zinariya na̱ azurufa. A wuma wa̱ Yehoyida, a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ a casu kucci vu kula̱tosu kuci a̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Gogo Yehoyida ganu gbain kutsa ta̱ lon, a̱vu u kuwa̱, u da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a'wan ukpaku na̱ mata'atsu (130). <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />A̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi oɓolo na̱ ngono a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda, adama a̱ɓula̱ a na u yuwain a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila na̱ A̱sula̱ na̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa fo.<verse eid="2CH 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwuya ya Yowash</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Ana Yehoyida ganu gbain kuwa̱i, a̱vu azagbain a Yahuda a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ kingyo elime o mogono Yowash, a̱vu akparai adama a na wa yuwan ili i na aa cigai. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" />A̱vu a vari A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya nle, a̱vu a yuwaan a̱shuwutsu a Ashera a̱ga̱nda̱. Adama o unusu le, a̱vu upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱cipa̱a̱ ama a Yahuda na̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Suru na̱ ne A̱sulazuva a̱ lyunguwa̱a̱ le ta̱ ama̱sula̱ adama u rono le a̱ ka̱mba̱ ya̱ a̱yi, a damma le ta̱ unusu ule, agba a uwwa shi.<verse eid="2CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />A̱vu Ruhu va̱ A̱sula̱ cipa̱a̱ Zakariya ulobo wa Yehoyida ganu. A̱vu wi isawan elime a ama a̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sula̱ a dammai: &lt;Adama nye ɗa i 'yuwain na ya yuwan tsutoni nu udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva? Yaa lyuwa elime shi. Adama a na i lyawai A̱sulazuva, a̱yi fo u lyawa ɗu ta̱.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" />Amma a̱vu Mogono Yowash na azagbai'in oɓolo aci a vara Zakariya o unai, o una̱ wu udammu u mogono o ukowo wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" />Agba Mogono Yowash cuwan ni isa'ani i na Yehoyida ganu dada va Zakariya yuwan niyi shi, reve wu una ulobo wa Yehoyida. Za na dammai a mantsa ma na u cigai u kuwa̱, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva ene ili i na yaa yuwusan a̱vu u tsupa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukosu u tsugono tsa̱ Yowash</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />O ukosu wa a'wan a̱vu a̱soja a Suriya a̱ riya̱a̱ Yowash nu uvon, a kandara ta̱ Yahuda na̱ Urishelima a̱vu o una azagbain a ama suru. A̱vu a̱ lyungu itana i na a̱ pura̱i suru a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u mogono me le a Dimaska. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" />Ko na wo o'woi a̱soja a Suriya a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱soja wa'a, A̱sulazuva a ca le ta̱ ulyuwu wa a aci e ekere a̱ a̱soja a̱ a̱bunda̱. Adama a na ama a Yahuda a lyawa ta̱ ure wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya nle, uge'etosu u da̱na̱ ta̱ a aci a Yowash. <verse eid="2CH 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" />A mantsa ma na aza a Suriya a̱ ka̱ra̱i, a lyawa ta̱ Yowash na̱ wuntsu lon. A̱vu azagbain a̱yi oɓolo aci o unai adama na wu una ta̱ ulobo wa Yehoyida ganu, a̱vu o una a̱yi a̱ga̱da̱ a̱yi, a̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi a̱tsuma̱ lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda, amma a̱ ciɗo yi a̱tsuma̱ ason o ngono shi.<verse eid="2CH 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Aza a na o ɓoloi a aci o una niyi ele ɗa: Zabad ulobo wa Shimeya vu ka va aza a Amon na̱ Yehozaba ulobo wa Shimri vu ka va̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Alabari o olobo a̱ Yowash ni ikaka ya adanshi aciya̱yi, na alabari o ulinga wu ulapulu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ aatagada alabari o ngono. A̱vu Amaziya ulobo wa̱ yi wo o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="s">Tsugono tsa Amaziya va Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 14:2-6">2 Ngo 14:2-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />Amaziya da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a'wan ushin no ozo o ton na wo o'woi mogono, u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa a'wan ushin na̱ kuci a̱ Urishelima. Aala a mma va a̱yi ɗa Yehowadi diga Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" />U yuwan ta̱ ili i na i ri mejege e ekere A̱sulazuva, amma u lamba unusu okolo a̱yi shi. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />A mantsa ma na we enei tsugono tsa̱ yi tsa̱ shuwa̱ ta̱, a̱vu wu una azagbain a na o unai dada va̱ yi Yowash mogono. <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" />Amma wu una olobo e le shi, u yuwan ta̱ cine u ri uɗanu a̱ wila̱ a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a Musa. Uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;She o una nan dada adama a̱ muwun nle wan, ko o una muwun adama a nan dada wan, za suru ta̱ kuwa̱ adama o unusu wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />A̱vu Amaziya ɓoloto ama o ugundo wa Yahuda a̱vu u zuwa le o una̱ wu 'wa le e ekere a nan yali vu ukpakukupa na̱ vu ukpaku ukpaku a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda na̱ Banyami suru. A̱vu e kece aza a na a̱ ri na̱ a'wan ushin a̱ tyo zuva, a̱vu a̱ tsura̱ ali ukpakukupa ukpakuta'atsu (300,000) aza a na a rawai uvon, aza a na a gura guza̱ ibata na̱ a̱ra̱ga̱. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Waru u kopo ta̱ a̱soja a na a gurai uvon ali ukpakukupa ukpaku (100,000) diga e iɗa ya Isra'ila na̱ azurufa na rawai kilo ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpakuna̱shi (3,400).<verse eid="2CH 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Amma a̱vu vuma va̱ A̱sula̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱ a̱yi u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱vu mogono, she vu lyawa a̱soja a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱ra̱ oɓolo na̱ vu wan, adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ ri oɓolo na aza Isra'ila ko na ama a Ifiramu shi. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" />Ko na̱ shi vu 'ya̱wa̱ vu yuwan uvon nu ugbamu wo okolo, A̱sula̱ a ta vari wu e ekere a n'yuwatan ma̱ wu, adama a na A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱ nu ucira u na wa wawa ko waru na wa vari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />A̱vu Amaziya ece vuma va̱ A̱sula̱'a̱, &lt;&lt;Gogo cine ma yuwan adama a azurufa ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpakuna̱shi (3,400) u na n tsupai adama a̱ a̱soja a Isra'ila?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:9">A̱vu vuma va̱ A̱sula̱'a̱ u usu, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a ta ca wu ili i na i la'ai ndolo a̱bunda̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />A̱vu Amaziya bete'we a̱soja a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i diga Ifiramu a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa. A̱vu a yuwan upan na aza a Yahuda a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa nu upan lon.<verse eid="2CH 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Amaziya yuwan ta̱ okolo o ugbamu a̱vu u ka̱ra̱ na̱ a̱soja a̱yi a̱ tyo upasu wu Uka̱ri wa Akpaɗi, uba̱ta̱ u na wu unai ali a Seyi ukpakukupa kupa (10,000). <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />A̱soja a Yahuda e reme ta̱ ali wuma u le ukpakukupa kupa, a̱vu a tara le a̱ tyo zuva va aatali a̱vu a vari shi le e iɗa adama suru nle a̱ rukutsa̱ miri miri.<verse eid="2CH 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Amma a̱soja a na Amaziya ka̱mba̱toi na a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uvon a̱ riya̱a̱ ta̱ ilyuci ya Yahuda na̱ Samariya hali a̱ tyo Bet Horon. O una ta̱ ama ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000), a̱vu a̱ pura̱ itana ya̱ a̱bunda̱.<verse eid="2CH 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />A mantsa ma na Amaziya ka̱mba̱i diga uba̱ta̱ u mona ma̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Edom, a̱vu u ta̱wa̱ na̱ musula̱ ma̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Seyi. A̱vu u zuwa le na wo o'wo musula̱ ma̱ yi, a̱vu u ka̱ɗa̱towa̱ le waru u casu le kucci vu ukula̱tosu. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" />Amma a̱vu A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan na̱ Amaziya lon, a̱vu u lyunguwa̱a̱ yi na̱ vumava̱sula̱, na dammai, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ nye ɗa vu zamiyi musula̱ ma a ama a nda aza a na a gura wawa ama e le diga e ekere a̱ wu shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" />A̱yi pe a̱tsuma̱ adanshi, a̱vu Amaziya usu yi u damma, &lt;&lt;Uwwa ne'e urana u ne u ɗa tsu katala nuwu za na a̱da̱na̱ a casu mogono a̱sa̱la̱? Rungwa̱! Ko n zuwa o una wu?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 25:16">A̱vu vumava̱sula̱'a̱ u ɓa̱ru una̱ wa̱ yi, amma u damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;N reve ta̱ a na A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ ifoɓi i na wo o kototo wu, vu yuwan ta̱ ili ya nda adama a na vu kuɗa̱i a uwwa a̱sa̱la̱ a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />Ana Amaziya mogono ma Yahuda ma zamiyi a̱sa̱la̱ uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na a casu yi a̱sa̱la̱, a̱vu u lyunguwa̱ Yowash ulobo wa Jehoha ulobo wa Yehu mogono ma Isra'ila, nu udammu, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱, lyawa tsu yuwan esu na̱ esu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Amma Yowash mogono ma Isra'ila ma̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ta̱ na̱ adanshi e ekere Amaziya mogono ma Yahuda u damma, &lt;&lt;Awanda A̱tsuma̱ a Lebanon lyunguwa̱a̱ ta̱ uɗanga u Sida u Lebanon ni ikaka, &lt;N ciga ta̱ na va ca ulobo u va̱ usheli wa̱ wu lolo.&gt; Amma a̱vu nama vu una na ri a̱ ma̱ka̱ra̱ wu dasa awanda'a. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />Agba a̱vu ɗa nda va̱ 'ya̱susa̱n aciya̱wu va adansa n tsura̱ ta̱ ulyuwu wa aci e ekere a̱ Edom, agba gogo vu ta̱ rocosu aciyogbamu nu uvaɗu. Amma vi isawan o u'wa! Adama nye vu ri e izami yi nla̱ngi na va̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ aciya̱wu na̱ ma̱riya̱ oɓolo na̱ ma̱riya̱ ma Yahuda fo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Amma suru na̱ ne, Amaziya 'yuwan ta̱ na wa uwwa, adama a na A̱sula̱ a ɗa a zuwai wo o'wo ne, adama a na wa ca le e ekere a Yehowash, adama a na a vadala ta̱ a yuwusan musula̱ ma̱ Edom a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />A̱vu Yowash mogono ma Isra'ila ma̱ riya̱a̱ le nu uvon. A̱vu a̱yi na̱ Amaziya mogono ma Yahuda a yuwan elime ne elime uba̱ta̱ o uvon ɗe Bet Shemesh a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />A̱vu aza a Yahuda o sowo a̱tsuma̱lima̱ e ekere aza a Isra'ila, a̱vu za suru suma a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ yi. <verse eid="2CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" />A̱vu Yehowash mogono ma Isra'ila me reme Amaziya mogono ma Yahuda ulobo wa Yowash ulobo wa Ahaziya ɗe Bet Shemesh. A̱vu Yehowash ta̱wa̱ na̱ Amaziya a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a̱vu wu ɓoso ukari wa̱ Urishelima diga o Uwata wa Ifiramu hali acina Uwata wu Mɓa̱nga̱, za na ri alanga udasuwu ukpaku kupota̱li (600). <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />U pura̱ ta̱ zinariya na̱ azurufa suru na akapi e itana ya̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱ na da̱na̱i e ekere Obed Edom suru, oɓolo nu utsuru wu ukobu u mogono suru na ama na u pura̱i a̱vu u ka̱mba̱ Samariya.<verse eid="2CH 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />Amaziya ulobo wa Yowash mogono ma Yahuda yuwan ta̱ a'wan kupa no ozo ton na Yehowash ulobo wa Jehoha mogono ma Isra'ila ma̱ kuwa̱i. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Akapi o ulinga u tsugono tsa a na Amaziya yuwain, diga o ufaru acina ukosu a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ ta̱ pe uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada alabari o ngono ma Yahuda na̱ Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />Diga a mantsa ma na Amaziya lyawai i toni ya̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu ama a Urishelima oɓolo a aci adama a na o unai, a̱vu u suma a̱ tyo Lakish, amma a̱vu a̱ lyunguwa̱ yi na ama a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ Lakish reve o unai ɗe. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />A̱vu a tara lipu va̱ yi zuva vi ido, a̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi oɓolo na̱ nkaya ma̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Lyuci va Da̱wuda a Yahuda.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="s">Uziya Mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 14:21-22">2 Ngo 14:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:1-7">15:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />A̱vu ama a Yahuda suru a tara Uziya, za na da̱na̱i na a'wan kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱li, a̱vu o o'woto yi mogono o una̱ wa dada va̱ yi Amaziya. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />A̱yi ɗa u suwai lyuci va Ela a̱vu u ka̱mbuwa̱i iɗa ya Yahuda cina Amaziya kuwa̱.<verse eid="2CH 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" />Uziya da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱li a mantsa ma na wo o'woi mogono, a̱vu u yuwan tsugono tsa̱ Urishelima a'wan kupoton ne ejere. Aala a mma va̱ a̱yi ɗa Yekoliya za va Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />U yuwan ta̱ ili i na i ri mejege e ekere A̱sulazuva, cine dada va̱ yi Amaziya yuwain. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" />A̱vu u ca aciya̱yi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ a rana va Zakariya, za na roco niyi ure u na wa uwwa wovon wa̱ A̱sula̱. Ana gba u zamiyi A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a ca yi ta̱ ulyuwu we elime.<verse eid="2CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />A̱vu u yuwan uvon na aza a Filistiya a̱vu u kototo kari vi ilyuci va Gat na̱ Yabine na aza a Ashido. A̱vu u suwisa ilyuci zuzu na̱ lyuci va Ashido na akapi a̱ ba̱ta̱ ro a̱tsuma̱ aza a Filistiya. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" />A̱sula̱ a kamba yi ta̱ u lyuwa a aci e ekere aza a Filistiya na̱ Araba na aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci ya Gur Ba'al na̱ Mewune. <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Aza a Amon a̱ ta̱wusa̱ ta̱ nu utafa u le uba̱ta̱ wa Uziya, waru u yuwan ta̱ aala hali a rawa upasu wi iɗa ya Masar, adama a na u yuwan ta̱ ucira lon.<verse eid="2CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Suru na̱ ne, Uziya suwa ta̱ atsura na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima o Uwata wu Mɓa̱nga̱ nu Uwata vu Uka̱ri nu uga'asatan wu uɓaɓu, a̱vu waru u da̱shi le ucira. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Waru u suwa ta̱ atsura a̱tsumona waru u ka̱pa̱ ta̱ oko'o na̱ a̱bunda̱, adama a na u ri na̱ iliyamunga lon e iɗa i mugaɗi na a agalaci. U da̱na̱ ta̱ na acimbi na aza a na e idanasa yi uɗuma̱ wa ataci a̱ inabi na ri agalaci nu uɗuma̱ wu umili u na u tsu casu yi itana yu uɗuma̱ na̱ a̱bunda̱ lon, adama a na a̱yi za na cigai cimba lon ɗa.<verse eid="2CH 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Uziya da̱na̱ na̱ a̱soja na a gurai uvon lon, a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ lo ufoɓu u na o uta̱ oɓolo oɓolo o una̱ wa̱ a̱bunda̱ le cine Jeyiye za vi iɗana na̱ Ma'aseya zagbain va a̱soja e kece nle, cine Hananiya za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ azagbain o mogono damma nle. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />A̱bunda̱ azagbain a 'wa va ali o uvo'on ele ɗa ama ukpakukupa ure na̱ ukpakuta̱li (2,600). <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />Za̱la̱ tsugbain tsa̱ le a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱soja ukpakukupa uta'atsu na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ cindere na̱ ukpakuton (307,500) aza a na a̱ ri ufoɓu adama o uvon, o oɓolo o ucira waru na ri ufoɓu adama a na a kamba mogono e ekere a n'yuwatan ma̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Uziya gba foɓoo ta̱ a̱soja a̱yi a̱ra̱ga̱ ni ibata na̱ melezu ma̱ rumu na̱ a̱tugu a̱ rumu nu utan ni iliya na̱ atali a̱bitsutsu. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />A̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a yuwan ta̱ ili makumba aza a na ama o urevu o foɓoi, a zuwa le ta̱ zuva va atsura na̱ mɓa̱nga̱, adama a na a̱ ni'wa̱n utan na atali a gbagbain. Aala a̱yi e isawan zuzu shi, adama a na u tsura̱ ta̱ ikambishi lon hali she na u yuwain ucira lon.<verse eid="2CH 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" />Amma a mantsa ma na Uziya yuwain u ucira lon, a̱vu uvaɗu wa̱ yi u ta̱wa̱a̱ yi na̱ a̱risa̱. Waru u da̱na̱ na̱ a̱ɓula̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱yi shi, hali u uwa a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva na wa̱ kuloto ili i ma̱guru a masa'a ma na a̱ tsu kuloto ili i ma̱guru. <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" />A̱vu Azariya ganu na̱ nan ganu kupa kunla̱ a̱za̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱za̱ o ugbamu wo okolo o toni yi. <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" />A̱vu a cina yi a damma yi, &lt;&lt;U ri mejege shi, mogono Uziya, na va̱ kuloto ili i ma̱guru uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva shi. A̱yi nda ulinga u nan ganu ɗa ugundo wa Haruna, aza a na a tawai na a yuwan ukula̱tosu wi ili i ma̱guru. Vu lyawa a̱a̱'isa̱ a nda, adama a na vu yuwan ta̱ ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱, waru A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a buwa da̱shi ca wu tsugbain shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" />Amma Uziya za na da̱na̱i lo mishin na̱ mataɗa ufoɓu na wa ca ukula̱tosu wi ili i ma̱guru yuwan upan. A mantsa ma na u da̱na̱i o upan na̱ nan ganu elime a masa'a mo ukula̱tosu wi ili i ma̱guru a̱vu mɓa̱la̱ mu ukutu mu uta̱i a̱ cin elime a nan ganu a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Ana Azariya ganu gbain na̱ nan ganu suru a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ niyi, a̱vu e ene u ta̱ na̱ mɓa̱la̱ mu ukutu a̱ cin va̱ yi! Reve a̱ jika̱ o uta̱ yi. Na amayun a̱yi fo u da̱na̱ ta̱ e izami i na wa lyawa uba̱ta̱'a̱ fo, adama a na A̱sulazuva a lapai ta̱ na̱ mɓa̱la̱.<verse eid="2CH 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" />Mogono Uziya da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ mɓa̱la̱ mu ukutu hali ukwisa̱ wa̱ yi. U da̱nu ta̱ utakatsuwu nu u'wa wa̱ a̱yi, adama a na o uta̱ yi ta̱ diga a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva. A̱vu Yotam ulobo wa̱ yi wo o'wo zagbain vu ukobu a yuwusan tsugono tsa ama e iɗa'a.<verse eid="2CH 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />Akapi o ulinga u tsugono tsa̱ Uziya, diga o ufaru acina ukosu, Ishaya ulobo wa Amoz Vumava̱sula̱ ɗa ɗana nle. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" />Uziya kuwa̱ ta̱ ucina nkaya ma̱ yi, a̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi zuzu ne le uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ ciɗosu ngono, adama a na ama a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱yi ma̱kutu ma ɗa&gt;&gt; A̱vu Yotam ulobo wa̱ yi wo o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="s">Yotam Mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 15:32-38">2 Ngo 15:32-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />Yotam da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan ushin no ozo o ton a mantsa ma na wo o'woi mogono, u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ Urishelima a'wan kupa na̱ a̱za̱ ta̱li. Aala mma va̱ a̱yi ɗa Yerusha usheli wa̱ Saduku. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" />Yotam yuwan ta̱ ili i na i ri mejege e ekere A̱sulazuva, cine dada va̱ a̱yi Uziya yuwain, gba u uwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva tsa dada va̱ yi shi. Amma a̱vu ama a lyuwa elime ni iwuya i le. <verse eid="2CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />Yotam suwisa ta̱ Una̱ntsu wa zuva wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, u yuwan ta̱ linga icu'un icu'un o ukari u na u ri aagaɗi a Ofe. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />Suru na̱ ne u suwa ta̱ ilyuci ya agaɗi a Yahuda, na̱ saa vu uga'an na atsura na ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱a̱rumbu.<verse eid="2CH 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />A̱vu Yotam yuwan uvon na̱ mogono ma aza a Amon a̱vu u tsura̱ ulyuwu wa aci. Aa'wan o ndolo u zuwa ta̱ aza a Amon a tsupa utafa u azurufa na rawai kilo ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpakuna̱shi (3,400) no oroci a yitabo ukpakukupa (1,000) na̱ yitabo ukpakukupa (1,000). Aza a Amon a̱ da̱shi ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ yi na̱ cu'un vu ukunzuwu uta̱ a'wan a̱ ire naa a'wan ata'atsu.<verse eid="2CH 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" />Yotam da̱na̱ ta̱ a̱da̱shishi ucira adama a na u yuwan ta̱ mmalu a̱tsuma̱ o ure u sa'ani a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" />Akapi a linga tsugono tsa na Yotam yuwain, nu uvon u na u yuwain biti, naa akapi e ili i na u yuwain biti, a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a alabari o ngono ma Isra'ila na̱ Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />U da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a'wan ushin no ozo o ton a mantsa ma na wo o'woi mogono, waru u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ Urishelima a'wan kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱li. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Yotam kuwa̱ ta̱ ucina nkaya ma̱ yi, a̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda. A̱vu Ahaz ulobo wa̱ yi wo o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="s">Ahaz Mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 16:1-4">2 Ngo 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />Ahaz da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan ushin a mantsa ma na wo o'woi mogono, u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ Urishelima a'wan kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱li. Agba u yuwan ili i na i ri mejege e ekere A̱sulazuva shi, cine akaya a̱yi Da̱wuda yuwain shi. <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" />Ahaz yuwan ta̱ mmalu o ure wu ngono ma Isra'ila, waru u zuɗa̱ ta̱ a̱ma̱li a Ba'al adama a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" />Reve u ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu o Uka̱ri wa Ben Hinom, a̱vu waru u ca olobo a̱yi kucci va akina. O tonishi re vi idaba vu nɗa n na A̱sulazuva a̱ gba̱ra̱i a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />U casu ta̱ kucci nu ukula̱tosu wi ili i ma̱guru ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱, ɗe zuva va agaɗi nu uɗanga u na u ri kpa̱la̱m.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />Adama o ndolo a̱vu A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱yi a ca yi e ekere o mogono ma Suriya. A̱vu aza a Suriya a lyuwa yi nu uvon, a̱vu a̱ pura̱ ama a̱yi na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ tyo Dimaska.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 28:5">Waru A̱sulazuva a ca yi ta̱ e ekere o mogono ma Isra'ila, za na lyuwa niyi nu uvon reve wu una yi a̱soja na̱ a̱bunda̱. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />A̱tsuma̱ o uranu uta̱ Peka ulobo wa Remaliya una ta̱ a̱soja aza a Yahuda ukpakukupa ukpaku nu ukpakukupa ushin (120,000). Adama a na aza a Yahuda a vadalaa ta̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ nkaya nle ucina̱. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Zikiri vuma ɗa na gurai uvon lon diga a̱ lyuci va Ifiramu wu una ta̱ Ma'aseya ulobo u mogono na̱ Azirikam zagbain vu ukobu u mogono na̱ Elikana kambi mogono. <verse eid="2CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" />A̱vu aza a Isra'ila a̱ pura̱ a̱za̱ le agbashi aza a na a̱ shi e remei, ama ukpakukupa ukpakure (200,000), a̱ma̱ci no olobo ne esheli diga ama a Yahuda. Waru a̱ pura̱ ta̱ itana ya̱ a̱bunda̱ aza a na a tarai a̱ ka̱mba̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Samariya.<verse eid="2CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oded vumava̱sula̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" />Amma vumava̱sula̱ va̱ A̱sulazuva za na tsu ɗe Oded da̱na̱ lo, a̱vu wu uta̱ adama a na wa ga'aton a̱soja a Isra'ila na a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga Samariya. A̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;Adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ nkaya nɗu a yuwain upan na̱ Yahuda, ɗaɗa u ca nle e ekere a̱ɗu. Amma yu una le ta̱ wa'a shi a̱tsuma̱ o upan u ɗa hali na u rawai zuva. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />Agba gogo i ta zama na ya̱a̱ ka̱mba̱to ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci a Yahuda na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Urishelima agbashi a̱ɗu. A̱vu yi icina na i yuwayin A̱sulazuva a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ɗu unusu? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />Gogo, yu uwwa a̱mu! I ka̱mbuwa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu aza a Isra'ila na i pura̱i a̱ tyo tsugbashi, adama a na upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ta̱ aciya̱ɗu. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />A̱vu azagbain o ro a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wa̱ Ifiramu, Azariya ulobo wa Yehohana na̱ Berekiya ulobo wa Meshilemo na̱ Yehizikiya ulobo wa Shalum na̱ Amasa ulobo wa Hadilayi, a̱ 'yon e isawaton aza a na a̱ ri amarawa diga uba̱ta̱ o uvo'on. <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />A̱vu a damma le, &lt;&lt;Yaa uwa na agbashi o ndolo pa shi, adama a na ili yo ndolo u ta̱ rono tsu unusu e ekere A̱sulazuva. I ciga ta̱ na ya̱a̱ da̱shi tsu unusu? Adama a na unusu u tsu u yuwan ta̱ ɗe a̱bunda̱, waru upan wa̱ yi u ta aciya aza a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />A̱vu a̱soja'a a lyawa agbashi'i oɓolo ni itana i na a̱ pura̱i lo elime azagbai'in no oɓolo a ama'a suru. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" />A̱vu ama a na e ɗeyi ala ele a̱ 'yon a tara agbashi'i, waru na̱ diga pe a̱tsuma̱ e itana i na a̱ pura̱i'i reve oto aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i ataɓu itana. A zamiya le ta̱ itana yu otosu naa atan, ni ilyalya ni ili yo oso na̱ mani'i adama a na a sukuma antsu le. Waru aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i nu ucira shi a kumbato le ta̱ zuva vu nloli. A̱vu a̱ ka̱mba̱to le uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱za̱ le a̱ Jeriko, Lyuci vu Shuwa, a̱vu a̱ ka̱mba̱ Samariya.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />A mantsa mo o ndolo ma ɗa Ahaz Mogono ma̱a̱ lyunguwa̱a̱ yi mogono ma Asuriya na wa kambai, <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" />adama a na a̱za̱ a̱ Edom a̱ da̱shi ta̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ nu uvon uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Yahuda a̱vu a tara agbashi a̱ ka̱ra̱. <verse eid="2CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" />A̱vu aza a Filistiya a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ nu uvon e iɗa i mugaɗi na̱ Nege va Yahuda. A̱vu a lyuwa a usa iɗa ya Bet Shemesh na̱ Ajalon na̱ Gedero hali acina Soko na̱ Timna na̱ Gimzo oɓolo na̱ mulyuci n na n ri uka̱nda̱ruwu ne le, reve a̱ da̱nu pe. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" />A̱sulazuva a̱ ka̱ɗa̱to ta̱ aza a Yahuda adama a Ahaz mogono ma Isra'ila, adama a na u da̱shi ta̱ iwuya a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda waru u da̱na̱ ta̱ nu ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" />A̱vu Tiglat Filesa mogono ma Asuriya ma̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi, reve u ca yi a̱tsuma̱lima̱ o una̱ wi ikambishi. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" />Ahaz mogono ma Isra'ila, ma̱ pura̱ ta̱ itana i ro diga a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, no ozo o ukobu u mogono, nu uba̱ta̱ wa azagbain a̱vu u ca mogono ma Asuriya. Agba ili ya̱ ndolo i kamba yi shi.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unusu wa Ahaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />A mantsa ma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ o Mogono Ahaz u da̱shishi ta̱ ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" />U casu ta̱ kucci a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u musula̱ ma Dimaska, aza a na a lyuwa niyi nu uvon. Adama a na u dammai, &lt;&lt;Na wo o'woi musula̱ mu ngono ma Suriya n kamba le ta̱, a̱mu fo n ta ca le kucci adama a na aa kamba mu.&gt;&gt; Amma e le ɗa a̱ ta̱wa̱ niyi na̱ ma̱riya̱ oɓolo na̱ ma̱riya̱ ma aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="2CH 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" />A̱vu Ahaz ɓoloto itana i na i ri ya̱ a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱ reve u tara le a̱ ka̱ra̱. A̱vu u ɓa̱ru suru na̱ntsu va̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva. A̱vu u suwa musa'a o ure suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ ma̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />A̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci ya Yahuda suru Ahaz suwa ta̱ ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ na a ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u musula̱ n ro, adama o ndolo u zuwa ta̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya ma̱ yi a yuwan upan.<verse eid="2CH 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />Akapi a linga tsugono tsa Ahaz na̱ re va̱ yi suru, diga o ufaru acina ukosu, a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ pe uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada alabari o ngono ma Yahuda na aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" />Ahaz kuwa̱ ta̱ ucina nkaya ma̱ yi reve a̱ ciɗo yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci va̱ Urishelima, amma a̱ ciɗo yi uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ ciɗosu ngono ma Isra'ila shi. A̱vu ulobo wa̱ yi Hezekiya wo o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="s">Hezekiya mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:1-3">2 Ngo 18:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />Hezekiya da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan ushin no ozo o ton a mantsa ma na wo o'woi mogono, u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ Urishelima a'wan ushin na̱ kuci. Aala a mma va̱ a̱yi ɗa Abija usheli wa Zakariya. <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" />U yuwan ta̱ ili i na i ri mejege uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, cine dada va̱ a̱yi Da̱wuda yuwain.<verse eid="2CH 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekiya da̱shi ta̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />A̱tsuma̱ o woto wu ufaru wa a'wan o ufaru u tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi, reve u kpa̱tu'wa̱ na̱ntsu va̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva a̱vu u lapula le. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />A̱vu u ta̱wa̱ na̱ nan ganu na̱ nan Levi, u ɓoloto le upasu wa asana, <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" />a̱vu u damma: &lt;&lt;Uwwa nu mu, a̱ɗu nan Levi! Yoo o'woto aciya̱ɗu na akiza, a̱vu waru i zuwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ A̱sula̱ a nkaya nɗu u da̱na̱ na̱ akiza. A̱vu yi uta̱a̱ suru ili i na i ri tsugya diga pe a̱a̱'isa̱'a̱. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" />Nkaya n tsu n da̱na̱ ta̱ nu ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱, a yuwan ta̱ iwuya uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱tsu a̱vu a vari yi. A vadala ta̱ urewesu u le diga uba̱ta̱ wu nda̱na̱ta̱ ma̱ A̱sulazuva a̱vu a vadala yi ucina̱. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />A̱vu waru a̱ ɓa̱ru na̱ntsu vu ukobu waru a̱ kimusa̱ ifitila. Agba a̱ kuloto ili i ma̱guru shi, ko waru na a ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu a̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila shi. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" />Adama o ndolo ɗa A̱sulazuva a yuwain upan na aza a Yahuda na̱ Urishelima. A̱vu u zuwa le o o'wo ili i wovon, ni iliya ya asalama, ni ili ya adanshi, cine ye enei ne e esu a̱ɗu a na'an. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" />Adama o ndolo a ɗa o unai nkaya ntsu na̱ matsun me pe'eni ɗaɗa olobo a̱tsu ne esheli oɓolo na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱tsu a tara nle a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ tsugbashi. <verse eid="2CH 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" />Gogo gba n zuwa ta̱ okolo a̱ va̱ n ta yuwan nzuwulai na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, adama o upan wu usuɗu wa̱ yi aciya̱tsu u von. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" />Olobo a̱ va̱, she i yuwan uro gogo wan, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ɗangula ɗu ta̱ adama yi isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi i yuwan yi a̱ga̱nda̱, waru i kuloto ili i ma̱guru. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />A̱vu nan Levi a fara ulinga:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">Diga o ugundo wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Koha,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">Maha ulobo wa Amasai na̱ Juwe ulobo wa Azariya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">diga o ugundo wa Merari,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">Kish ulobo wa Abidi na̱ Azariya ulobo wa Yehalele,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:12">diga o ugundo wa Gashon, Yowa ulobo wa Zima na̱ Adini ulobo wa Yowa,<verse eid="2CH 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" />diga o ugundo wa Elizafan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:13">Shimri na̱ Jeyiye,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:13">diga o ugundo wa Asaf,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:13">Zakariya na̱ Mataniya,<verse eid="2CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" />diga o ugundo wa Heman,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:14">Yehiyel na̱ Shimeyi,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:14">diga o ugundo wa Yedutun,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="2CH 29:14">Shemaya na̱ Uziyel.<verse eid="2CH 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" />Ana o ɓolotoi a̱za̱ ele reve a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ aciyele na akiza, a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ na a̱ ka̱mba̱to A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva cece, cine mogono ma damma nle, ununa A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />A̱vu nan ganu a uwa pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva adama a na a zuwai wo o'wo na akiza. Reve o uta̱a̱ suru ili i na i ri idaba i na a cinai a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva o ukowo. A̱vu nan Levi a̱ pura̱ le a tara le a̱ tyo o Uka̱ri wa̱ Kidron. <verse eid="2CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />E teme ta̱ uka̱mba̱tosu wa akiza'a o urana wu ufaru u woto wu ufaru, acina urana wa̱ kunla̱ u woto'o reve a rawa o ukobu wu u'uwata wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa. Waru a tarisa ta̱ rana kunla̱ o uka̱mba̱tosu u cece wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, reve o koto o rana u kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱li u woto wu ufaru.<verse eid="2CH 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />A̱vu nan ganu a̱ ka̱ra̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Hezekiya Mogono, a̱vu a dammai, &lt;&lt;Tsu ka̱mba̱to ta̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva suru cece, na̱ masa'a mo casu u kucci vu ukula̱tosu oɓolo na̱ itana yu ulinga ya̱ yi suru, na̱ apada a mazuwa ma̱ opopofu a na a tawai, oɓolo ni itana yu ulinga ya̱ yi. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" />Itana i na Mogono Ahaz tawai a mantsa ma wuma wu ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱yi, tsu foɓo le ta̱ waru tso o o'woto le ta̱ akiza. Gogo a̱ ta̱ lo elime a masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekiya ka̱mba̱to ta̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Nu usana a̱vu Hezekiya Mogono ɓoloto azagbain a lyuci uba̱ta̱ uta̱ a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" />A̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ ogono e inan a̱ cindere na̱ a̱giri'i a̱ cindere na̱ mukyokyon n cindere na̱ nga̱ji n cindere tsa̱ kucci vu unusu u tsugono na adama a̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ na ama a Yahuda. A̱vu Hezekiya mogono ma damma nan ganu a̱za̱ o ugundo wa Haruna, na a ca kucci a masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" />A̱vu a paɗa ogono e inan, a̱vu nan ganu a tara mpasa'a a̱vu a̱ kyo'onu le zuva masa'a. A̱vu waru a paɗa a̱giri'i a̱vu a̱ kyo'onu mpasa zuva va masa'a. A̱vu waru a paɗa mukyokyon a̱vu a̱ kyo'onu mpasa zuva va masa'a. <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" />A̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ nga̱ji na a yuwaan kucci vu unusu adama a na a yuwan le gafura vu unusu u le elime o mogono ne eleme o oɓolo a ama reve a̱ kuruwa̱ le ekere. <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" />A̱vu nan ganu a paɗa nga̱ji'i, a̱vu a zuwa mpasa'a zuva masa'a tsa kucci vu unusu, adama a na a yuwaan aza a Isra'ila gafura vu unusu le. Mogono ma ca ta̱ udammu na a ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu na a yuwan gafura vu unusu wa aza a Isra'ila suru.<verse eid="2CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />A̱vu mogono Hezekiya zuwa nan Levi a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ mupalu m malapa ni igaraya ni ikumburu, o una̱ wu udammu wa̱ Da̱wuda na̱ Gadu za yindi i mogono na̱ Natan vumava̱sula̱, ununa A̱sulazuva a zuwai a yuwan o una̱ wa ama̱sula̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" />A̱vu nan Levi e isawan ufoɓu ni itana i tsuwe'e ya̱ Da̱wuda, a̱vu nan ganu waru e isawan na avana ele.<verse eid="2CH 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" />A̱vu Hezekiya ca udammu na a ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu u le a masa'a. A mantsa ma na a farai ukula̱tosu'u, a̱vu a fara a canasa ishipa yi ica e ekere A̱sulazuva, a̱vu o toni na̱ wivulu wa avana ni itana i tsuwe'e ya̱ Da̱wuda mogono ma Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />A̱vu suru oɓolo ama a̱ ka̱ɗa̱to a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱, a̱za̱ e ishipa waru a yuwusan ishipa aza a avana waru e ivulusa̱ avana. A lyuwusa ta̱ elime suru hali acina mantsa ma na o kotoi ucasu u kucci vu ukula̱tosu'u.<verse eid="2CH 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" />A mantsa ma na o koto kucci'i, a̱vu mogono na̱ suru aza a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a̱ kingyo nu urewesu u le a̱ tyo e iɗa a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />A̱vu mogono Hezekiya na azagbain a̱yi a damma nan Levi a yuwan ica ya̱ A̱sulazuva ni ishipa ya̱ Da̱wuda na̱ Asaf za yindi. Reve a cana ishipa yi ica na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱, a̱vu a̱ kingyo nu urewesu u le a̱ tyo e iɗa a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="2CH 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />Hezekiya gba damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Gogo i tawa ta̱ aciya̱ɗu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. Ta̱wa̱i i ca kucci na̱ kucci vu ugodyusho a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt;Reve oɓolo'o a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ kucci oɓolo na̱ kucci vu ugodyusho'o, oɓolo na aza a na okolo le a ca nle na a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu ule. <verse eid="2CH 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />A̱bunda̱ o ukula̱tosu u na ama'a a̱ ta̱wa̱yi a rawa ta̱ inan kupocindere ni ikyon ukpaku (100) na̱ mukyokyon ukpaku ure (200) suru nle adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Iliyamunga i na a tawai adama a̱ kucci a rawa ta̱ ogono e inan ukpakukupa uta̱li (600) ni ikyon na̱ mgbele ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000). <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" />Amma nan ganu a̱da̱na̱ a̱bunda̱ shi, na a yuwan suru ucasu u kucci vu ukula̱tosu, a̱vu a̱za̱ e le nan Levi a kamba le hali acina ukosu wu ulinga'a, na̱ hali she na nan ganu'u fo a tawai aciyele, adama a na nan Levi a la'a ta̱ ca aciyele na wo o'wo na akiza ula'awu na̱ cine nan ganu a ciga nle na wo o'wo. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" />A̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ lo na̱ kucci va̱ a̱bunda̱, oɓolo na abaji a mani'in adama a̱ kucci muwwulai na̱ za vi ili yo oso za na a cayi oɓolo na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 29:35">Na̱ ne tsundolo tsa a ɗa o kotoi uka̱mba̱tosu wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Hezekiya na̱ akapi ama suru a yuwan ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ lon, adama e ili i na A̱sulazuva a yuwayin ama a̱yi. Adama a na ili i na a cigai u yuwan ta̱ go'o.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="s">Ifoɓi adama A̱buki a Mapasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1" />A̱vu mogono Hezekiya lyungu na adanshi a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱tsuma̱ aza a Isra'ila na̱ aza a Yahuda suru, a̱vu waru u ɗana mepepelime a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Ifiramu na aza a Manase. A̱vu u banu suru nle a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima na a yuwan A̱buki a Mapasa a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 30:2" />Reve mogono na azagbain a̱yi oɓolo no oɓolo ama a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima suru a paɗa a̱sa̱la̱ na a yuwan A̱buki a Mapasa o woto wa̱ ire. <verse eid="2CH 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:3" />A gura yuwan A̱buki a mantsa ma na u lobonoi na a yuwan a̱buki'i shi, adama a na nan ganu na ri na akiza a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ uka̱la̱mu, waru ama o oɓoloto a̱tsuma̱ a Urishelima shi. <verse eid="2CH 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Ifoɓi'i i da̱na̱ ta̱ ulobonu uba̱ta̱ u mogono oɓolo no oɓolo ama'a suru. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />A̱vu a paɗa a̱sa̱la̱ na a ca udammu a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila suru, diga a̱ lyuci va Biyasheba a̱ tyo Dan, a̱ ɗesu a ama na a̱ ta̱wa̱ Urishelima na a yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ ma̱ A̱buki a Mapasa a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila. Koto shi a̱da̱shi yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ a̱bunda̱ ama ununa u ri uɗanu shi.<verse eid="2CH 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" />O una̱ wu udammu u mogono ma ɗa a cayi aza a na a tsu yuwan uro shi suru a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila na̱ Yahuda na̱ mepepelime maa na ma adansa, &lt;&lt;A̱ɗu ama a Isra'ila, i ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Ibrahim na̱ Ishiyaku na̱ Isra'ila, adama a na a̱yi fo wa̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ uɗu, a̱ɗu na i buwai, a̱ɗu naa i la'ai e ekere o mogono ma Asuriya. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" />She yo o'wo cine nkaya nɗu n ri na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ɗu wan, aza a na a yuwain ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ e ekere A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya nɗu wan. Adama o ndolo ɗa u ka̱mbuwa̱ nle ili i wovon, cine yenishe ne esu a̱ɗu ana'an. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" />She i yuwan aciyogbamu cine nkaya nɗu yuwain wan, amma i ca aciya̱ɗu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. I ta̱wa̱ a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, uba̱ta̱ u na u tawai na u ri na akiza hali hali. Yuwayin A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ɗu a̱ga̱nda̱, adama upan wu usuɗu wa̱ a̱yi u tawa aciya̱ɗu. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" />N na̱ i ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱za̱ a̱ɗu na̱ muwun nɗu a̱ ta̱ roco le iliyali e ekere aza a na e reme nle waru a̱ ka̱mba̱ le e iɗa i nda, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ za vi icigi i ɗa, waru za na o rocosu iliyali i ɗa. Waru wa vadala urewesu wa̱ a̱yi diga uba̱ta̱ uɗu shi, hali ni i ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />A̱vu aza a na a tsu yuwan uro'o shi a̱ ka̱ra̱ diga a̱ lyuci a̱ tyo lyuci ya Ifiramu na̱ Manase hali acina Zebulun, amma a̱vu ama'a o zo'oso le waru a tara le i ili i ro shi. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Amma suru na̱ ne a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ na ama diga o upasu wa Asha na̱ Manase na̱ Zebulun aza na a tarai aciyele ili i ro shi, a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" />A̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda waru ukere wa̱ A̱sulazuva u da̱na̱ ta̱ oɓolo na ama adama a na wa ca le uɓolu wo okolo a̱ta̱ na a yuwan tsutoni nu udammu u mogono Hezekiya oɓolo na azagbain a̱yi, a yuwusan tsutoni na adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">A yuwan ta̱ A̱buki a Mapasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />O woto wa̱ ire, ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ oɓoloto ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima adama a na a yuwan A̱buki o opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi. <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" />A̱vu ama 'yon o kototo omoci a musa'a n kucci na a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, na̱ akapi omoci a̱ musa'a n na a yuwusan ukula̱tosu wi ili i ma̱guru, a̱vu a̱ pura̱ le a̱ tyo o Uka̱ri wa̱ Kidron.<verse eid="2CH 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" />A paɗa ta̱ kyon va̱ A̱buki a Mapasa a̱tsuma̱ o rana wa kupa na̱ a̱za̱ na̱shi u woto wa̱ ire. Amma nan ganu na̱ nan Levi a uwwa ta̱ wono, reve wo o'woto aciyele aza akiza a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" />A̱vu a tara tsugbain tsa le cine a dammai o uritosu wa Musa vuma va̱ A̱sula̱. A̱vu nan ganu o kyo'onu mpasa n na a̱ ushiyi diga e ekere a nan Levi. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Na wo o'woi ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱tsuma̱ oɓolo'o a̱ da̱na̱ na akiza shi, a̱yi ɗa i zuwai na̱ nan Levi a paɗa nle ikyon ya̱ A̱buki a Mapasa'a. Ne ɗa a tawai ama'a o'woi na akiza e ekere A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18" />Amma ko na wo o'woi ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ na o uta̱i diga o ugundo wa Ifiramu na aza a Manase na aza a Isaka na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Zebulun a̱ ka̱mba̱to aciyele cece shi. Suru na̱ ne a lyuwa ta̱ ilyalya ya̱ A̱buki a Mapasa, ununa u ri uɗanu a̱ wila̱ shi. Amma Hezekiya yuwaan le ta̱ avasa, u damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva za vi isa'ani yuwan ko yaa gafura, <verse eid="2CH 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:19" />za na zuwai okolo a̱yi suru uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya ntsu, ko na̱ shi uri cece shi o una̱ u wila̱ u na a̱a̱'isa̱ a dammai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />Amma reve A̱sulazuva a uwwa avasa a Hezekiya, a̱vu wo o'woto ama'a gbaga.<verse eid="2CH 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" />Ama a Isra'ila na a̱da̱na̱i a̱tsuma̱ Urishelima a yuwan ta̱ A̱buki o Opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi hali rana cindere na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ lon, a̱vu nan Levi na̱ nan ganu a canasa ishipa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva urana suru, ni itana i tsuwe'e wi ica.<verse eid="2CH 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" />Hezekiya ca ta̱ nan Levi a̱sa̱la̱ aza a na a yuwain ulinga babu uro uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva. Adama a na a rana cindere ndolo a lyuwa ta̱ upasu u na a ca nle, waru a ca ta̱ kucci muwwulai reve a ca A̱sulazuva ica, A̱sula̱ a nkaya nle. <verse eid="2CH 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Reve oɓolo a ama'a a̱da̱shi usu a yuwisan a̱ga̱nda̱ A̱buki a Mapasa'a hali acina rana cindere waru. A̱tsuma̱ a rana cindere'e a yuwan ta̱ A̱buki na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ lon. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" />Mogono Hezekiya va Yahuda ta̱wa̱ ta̱ no ogono e inan ukpakukupa (1,000) ni ikyo na̱ mgbele ukpakukupa kupocindere (7,000) adama oɓolo ama'a, reve azagbain fo a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ le no ogono e inan ukpakukupa (1,000) ni ikyon na̱ mgbele ukpakukupa kupa (10,000). Waru nan ganu na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ na akiza. <verse eid="2CH 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Oɓolo a ama a Yahuda suru a yuwan ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱, oɓolo na̱ nan ganu na̱ nan Levi, na aza a na o ɓolotoi suru diga o upasu wa Isra'ila, oɓolo no omocin a na a̱ ri na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila na̱ Yahuda. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" />A yuwan ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ lon a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, adama a na diga a mantsa ma Sulemanu ulobo wa̱ Da̱wuda mogono ma Isra'ila na a yuwain cu'un vi iɓolo i ndolo she a̱da̱shi yuwisan cu'un va̱ yi waru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima shi. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" />A̱vu nan ganu oɓolo na̱ nan Levi a̱ 'yon mishin adama a zuwaa ama'a aba'un, a̱vu A̱sula̱ a̱ usu le, adama a na avasa ele a rawai zuva, uba̱ta̱ wu nden wa akiza a̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />A mantsa ma na o kotoi a̱buki'i, a̱vu aza a Isra'ila suru aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i Urishelima o toni ilyuci ya Yahuda ni ilyuci ya Banyami ni ilyuci ya Ifiramu na̱ Manase. A̱vu o kototo atali a̱ga̱nda̱ na̱ a̱shuwutsu a Ashera. A̱vu o kototo ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ na̱ musa'a suru. Ana a yuwain ne a̱vu aza a Isra'ila a̱ ka̱mba̱ e ilyuci i le na̱ 'wa le.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />Mogono Hezekiya ne'eshe ta̱ nan ganu na̱ nan Levi oɓolo oɓolo aza a na a̱da̱na̱ aa yuwusan a̱ga̱nda̱ ko yan nu ulinga wa̱ yi. Aza a na aa ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu na̱ kucci muwwulai, a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱, waru o godyo a̱vu a cana ishipa yi ica a̱ na̱ntsu uba̱ta̱ wu nden wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" />Mogono ma ca ta̱ diga o utsuru wa̱ yi ikambi i na a yuwan kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu usana nu ulivu na̱ za na a yuwan kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana wa Ashibi na̱ za va̱ A̱buki o Woto u Sa'avu na̱ A̱buki a na a zuwai, cine u ri uɗanu o uritosu u Wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" />A̱vu mogono ma damma ama na a̱ ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a̱da̱na̱ a casu nan ganu na̱ nan Levi akunda e le, adama a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu u le suru uba̱ta̱ o uritosu u Wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />A mantsa ma na ama a uwwai udammu'u, a̱vu aza a Isra'ila a̱ ta̱wa̱ nu umatsun wu ufaru wi ishina na̱ masayan ma inabi ma sa'avu na̱ mani'in ma zetun ni ishiki na̱ cu'un vi itana ya̱ a̱ɗuma̱ suru. A̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ na̱ ili ya̱ a̱bunda̱, za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa vi itana yu una suru. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" />Ama a Isra'ila na aza a Yahuda, aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci ya Yahuda a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa le vi inan ni ikyon ni itana i na a tawai na a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ o ulinga wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ e le, a̱vu oɓoloto le oɓolo oɓolo. <verse eid="2CH 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />A̱vu ama a fara o ɓolotosu itana i le diga woto wa ta'atsu a̱vu o koto o woto wa̱ cindere. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />A mantsa ma na Hezekiya na azagbain a̱ ta̱wa̱i enei oɓolo oɓolo e itana i ndolo, a̱vu a yuwaan A̱sulazuva ica a̱vu u zuwaa ama a̱yi aza a Isra'ila aba'un.<verse eid="2CH 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />A̱vu Hezekiya ece nan ganu na̱ nan Levi u damma, &lt;&lt;E te ɗa itana i nda yu uta̱i?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" />A̱vu Azariya ganu gbain diga o umatsun wa Saduku usu Hezekiya u damma, &lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na ama a farai a̱ ta̱wusa̱ nu une'e u le a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, tsu tsura̱ ta̱ ilyalya a na tsa lyuwa hali tsu lyawa akapi, adama a na A̱sulazuva a zuwaa ta̱ ama a̱yi aba'un lon. Adama o ndolo ɗa akapi e itana i nda a buwai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />A̱vu Hezekiya damma le o ofoɓo asula e izuwa a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. A̱vu a yuwan ne. <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />Reve a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ ne'en le na amayun, za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa ni ili i na a tawai suru. A̱vu a zuwa Konaniya vu ugundo wa̱ Levi zagbain na a̱da̱na̱ e idanasa itana'a na̱ mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi Shimeyi za na o tonoi. <verse eid="2CH 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />Akapi a na a kamba nle na a yuwan ulinga'a ele ɗa: Yehiyel na̱ Azaziya na̱ Naha na̱ Asahel na̱ Yerimo na̱ Yozaba na̱ Eliyel na̱ Ismakiya na̱ Maha oɓolo na̱ Benaya. Ele ɗa a̱ da̱na̱i a̱za̱ o uka̱lyuwusa̱ za̱la̱ tsugbain tsa Konaniya na̱ Shimeyi mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ a̱yi. Mogono Hezekiya na̱ Azariya zagbain nan ganu va̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva ele ɗa a aza a na a ɗangulai ama a nda'a.<verse eid="2CH 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Kore ulobo wa Imna vu ugundo wa̱ Levi, a̱yi ɗa za na e idanasa una̱ntsu wa asana, a̱vu a zuwai wi idana itana yu une'e u na a̱ ta̱wusa̱a̱ A̱sula̱ nu ucigu wo okolo. A̱yi ɗa waru za na tsu ne'eshen une'e u na a tawai adama A̱sulazuva oɓolo ni itana i na i ri na akiza. <verse eid="2CH 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" />Aza a na a tsu kambusa Kore ele ɗa: Adini na̱ Miniyamin na̱ Jesuwa na̱ Shemaya na̱ Amariya na̱ Shekaniya. A̱tsuma̱ amayun ele a̱ tsu ne'eshe ta̱ itana i nda e ilyuci i nan ganu, adama a ca a̱za̱ ele nan ganu babu aɗangulu, diga uba̱ta̱ wu zagbain a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wu za ke'en, cine a̱ ri oɓolo oɓolo.<verse eid="2CH 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />A̱vu waru e ne'eshen ali aza a na a̱ ri na̱ a'wan ata'atsu a gawan aza a na a ɗanai ala e le a̱tsuma̱ o ucuɗuwu u nan Levi, aza a na a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva kuci cine a ca nle na a yuwan ulinga u le oɓolo oɓolo. <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" />A̱vu e ne'eshen nan ganu itana cine a̱ ri uɗanu o ucuɗuwu vu 'wa vu nkaya nle. Na̱ nan Levi fo aza a na a̱ ri na a'wan ushin a gawan, a tsu ca le ta̱ akunda e itana i le adama a̱ cu'un vu ulinga u le na̱ cine a̱ ri oɓolo oɓolo. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Oɓolo ta̱ na̱ muwun ke'en ke'en na̱ a̱ma̱ci no olobo ne esheli na̱ lyuci suru aza a na ala ele a̱ ri uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada o ucuɗuwu u nan ganu na̱ nan Levi, adama a na a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ na amayun uba̱ta̱ u matawa ma aciyele.<verse eid="2CH 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" />Waru adama a nan ganu, limatan va Haruna, aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden atsusa uka̱nda̱ruwu ni ilyuci, a̱vu a ɗangula ali o una̱ wa aala ele a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci'i suru, aza a na a̱da̱na̱ o une'esun wi itana, uba̱ta̱ wa ali a na a ɗanai aala le a̱tsuma̱ aatagada o ucuɗuwu u nan Levi, a̱vu a ca le akunda e le.<verse eid="2CH 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Ne ɗa Hezekiya yuwain a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Yahuda suru, u yuwan ta̱ ili i na i ri mejege na amayun na̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />A̱tsuma̱ o ulinga u na Hezekiya yuwain o ulinga wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱ suru, aza na a̱ ri pe a̱tsuma̱ o uritosu u wila̱ wa̱ Musa nu udammu wa̱ A̱sulazuva, waru u zami ta̱ A̱sula̱ a̱yi no okolo a̱yi suru, Adama o ndolo a̱vu u tsura̱ ulyuwu we elime.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="s">Senakerib ca ta̱ a aza a Yahuda wovon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:13-37">2 Ngo 18:13-37</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:14-19">19:14-19</ref>,<ref loc="2KI 19:35-37">35-37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:1-22">Ish 36:1-22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:8-38">37:8-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />Babu na̱ linga va amayun n na Mogono Hezekiya yuwain, a̱vu Senakerib mogono ma Asuriya ma̱ riya̱a̱ Yahuda nu uvon. Reve u ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ ilyuci vu kari vu ucira, a majiyan ma na wa lyuwa le nu uvon, adama o o'wo a̱za̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />A mantsa ma na Hezekiya enei Senakerib ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama u yuwan uvon na̱ Urishelima, <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />a̱vu Hezekiya yuwan adanshi na̱ azagbain a̱yi oɓolo na̱ nan yali ya̱ a̱soja a̱yi na e geshe esu a̱ mini a na a̱ ri o ucina̱ u lyuci'i, a̱vu a kamba yi. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />A̱vu a̱soja a̱bunda̱ o oɓoloto, a̱vu e geshe esu a̱ mini'i oɓolo na̱ mini ma na mee yeneshe a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a. Reve a damma &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ nye ɗa ngono ma Asuriya ma̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱vu acina mini ma̱ a̱bunda̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" />A̱vu u reme ulinga lon a lapulusa suru pasu na la̱nga̱i wu ɓaɓu reve u suwaa le kari. A̱vu waru u suwisa ukari u ro uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ za vu ufaru'u reve u lapula ma̱lyuci ma̱ Milo a̱ lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda. Waru u yuwan ta̱ itana yu uvon na̱ a̱ra̱ga̱ a̱bunda̱.<verse eid="2CH 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />A̱vu u ɗangulaa ama azagbain a̱soja a̱vu u oɓoloto le elime a̱yi agalaci a na a̱ ri o una̱ntsu u lyuci, a̱vu u ca le adanshi ni idanshi i nda: <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" />&lt;&lt;I kapanu yi isawan nu ucira. She yi uwwa wovon wan ko i kuɗa okolo wan adama o mogono ma Asuriya oɓolo na̱ a̱soja a na a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱yi wan, adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu, waru ucira wa̱ yi u la'a ta̱ ucira u le. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" />A zuwa ta̱ ucira u le uba̱ta̱ wu ucira wa ama, amma tsu ta̱ na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a na a kamba tsu waru u yuwan uvon adama a̱tsu.&gt;&gt; Adama o ndolo a̱vu ama'a a̱ da̱shi tsura̱ ukadu adama e ili i na Hezekiya mogono ma Yahuda ma dammai.<verse eid="2CH 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Ana a yuwain ne, a̱vu mogono Senakerib va Asuriya oɓolo na̱ a̱soja a̱yi suru a̱ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ lyuci va Lakish, a̱vu u lyungu nlingata ma̱ a̱yi a̱ tyo Urishelima ni ikaka i nda a̱ tyo ya̱ Hezekiya mogono ma Yahuda oɓolo na ama a Yahuda suru na ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima u damma,<verse eid="2CH 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />&lt;&lt;Apa ili i na mogono Senakerib va Asuriya dammai, a̱ nye ɗa va zuwusa ucira wa̱ wu, hali na vu buwai a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima uka̱nda̱ruwu? <verse eid="2CH 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Ana Hezekiya dammai, &lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ɗu a ta wawa a̱ɗu e ekere mogono ma Asuriya.&gt; &gt;&gt; U ta̱ lulumusa̱ ɗu na wa zama u lyawa ɗu i kuwa̱ a̱tsuma̱ ambulu na akuli. <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" />Ashe Hezekiya na aciya̱yi ɗa wu tawai musula̱ mu ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ na̱ musa'a adansaa Yahuda na̱ Urishelima, i yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ a masa'a ma̱ ta̱ waru i ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu ɗe shi? <verse eid="2CH 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />&lt;&lt;I reve ili i na a̱mu na̱ nkaya n va̱ tsu yuwain na akapi a ama e iɗa i ro shi? Musula̱ mu nɗa ndolo a gura ta̱ wawa iɗa i ndolo diga e ekere a̱ va̱? <verse eid="2CH 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" />Musula̱ mu nɗa suru aza a na nkaya va̱ o kototoi a gura ta̱ wawa ama e le diga e ekere a̱ va̱? Cine a yuwan A̱sula̱ a̱ɗu a wawa a̱ɗu e ekere a̱ va̱? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />Gogo she i lyawa Hezekiya luluma̱ ɗu wan waru na wa̱ pusa̱n ɗu tsu nda wan. She i usu yi wan, adama a na babu musula̱ mu nɗa ko tsugono tsa na tsa gura wawai ama a̱yi diga e ekere a̱ va̱ ko e ekere a nkaya n va̱. Cine a yuwan A̱sula̱ a̱ɗu a wawa ɗu e ekere a̱ va̱!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />A̱vu a̱soja o mogono Senakerib a yuwan adanshi a vanvama uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ oɓolo na aagbashi a̱yi Hezekiya. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Senakerib ɗana ta̱ waru mepepelime a̱vu u ka̱ra̱ e isulusa a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila. A̱vu u damma a̱tsuma̱ mepepelime'e, &lt;&lt;Cine musula̱ mu nɗa n ro n gura wawai ama a̱yi e ekere a̱ va̱ shi ne ɗa fo A̱sula̱ a̱ Hezekiya a gura wawa ama a̱yi e ekere a̱ va̱ shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />A̱vu a yuwan adanshi nu uɗyo u gbain na̱ elentsu a tsu Yahuda e ekere ama a̱ Urishelima aza a na a̱da̱na̱i o ukari u lyuci, adama a ca le wovon waru a da'waton le, tsura̱ a lyuwa lyuci'i. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />A̱vu a yuwusan adanshi adama A̱sula̱ a̱ Urishelima, she damma u ta̱ una̱ uta̱ na akapi a̱ musula̱ ma ama o uvaɗi, aza a na ama yuwain ne e ekere e le.<verse eid="2CH 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva a wawa ta̱ Hezekiya ekere a Senakerib</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:35-37">2 Ngo 19:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:36-38">Ish 37:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />A̱vu Mogono Hezekiya na̱ vumava̱sula̱ Ishaya ulobo wa Amoz e showen A̱sulazuva adama adanshi o ndolo, a̱vu a yuwan avasa a̱ tyo zuva adama A̱sulazuva a kamba le. <verse eid="2CH 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ lyungu malingata na wo kototo a̱soja a na a gurai uvon suru, na azagbain na̱ nan yali ya̱ a̱soja, aza a na a̱ ri o uva̱la̱ta̱ u mogono ma Asuriya. Adama o ndolo a̱vu Senakerib ka̱mba̱ e iɗa ya̱ a̱yi na̱ wono. Mantsa ma na u uwai a̱a̱'isa̱ urana u ro a yuwusaan ma̱sula̱ ma̱ a̱yi a̱ga̱nda̱, a̱vu ozo o ro a̱tsuma̱ olobo a̱yi o kototo yi na̱ matsun me pe'eni. <verse eid="2CH 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a wawai Hezekiya na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Urishelima suru diga e ekere o mogono Senakerib va Asuriya na̱ n'yuwatan nle suru. A̱vu u ca le asuvu nden na̱ nɗa nle n na n ri u ka̱nda̱ruwu ne le suru. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ nu une'e u le uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, a̱vu waru a̱ ta̱wa̱ nu une'e wi itana isa'ani uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Hezekiya mogono ma Yahuda. Diga a mantsa mo ndolo, Hezekiya tsura̱ ta̱ tsugbain esu a̱za̱ o tsugono na̱ aza a tsugbain tsu nɗa suru.<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubanakun wa Hezekiya na̱ aciyogbamu a̱yi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:1-3">2 Ngo 20:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 12">12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:1-3">Ish 38:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">39:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />A̱tsuma̱ a rana ndolo a̱vu Hezekiya reme mɓa̱la̱ hali u rawa a gan ma̱a̱ kuwa̱. A̱vu u yuwan avasa e ekere A̱sulazuva, reve u usu yi, waru u ca yi iroci na wa̱ tsura̱ gbaga. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" />Amma adama aciyogbamu a̱yi, Hezekiya yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ adama e isa'ani i na a yuwaan niyi shi. Adama o ndolo a̱vu A̱sulazuva a yuwan upan na̱ yi oɓolo na ama a Yahuda na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" />Ɗaɗa Hezekiya vadalai diga aciyogbamu wa̱ yi oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Urishelima. Adama o ndolo upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva u cipa̱a̱ le a mantsa ma wuma wa̱ Hezekiya shi.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Hezekiya da̱na̱ ta̱ nu utsuru lon, waru ama suru a casu yi ta̱ tsugbain. A̱vu u suwa asula e izuwa adama a azurufa na̱ zinariya na atali e ikebe ni itana yu ucita na̱ a̱ra̱ga̱ na̱ cu'un vi ili isa'ani biti. <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />Avu waru u suwa asula adama a na a yuwan uzuwa wi ishina na̱ masayan ma inabi na̱ mani'in ma̱ zetun. A̱vu waru u shuwa̱ ogodo adama cu'un vi inan ni iliyamunga suru. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />Agba waru u suwa ta̱ mulyuci na̱ a̱bunda̱, waru u da̱na̱ ta̱ ni iliyamunga ya̱ a̱bunda̱ ni inan, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ca yi ta̱ utsuru wa̱ a̱bunda̱ lon.<verse eid="2CH 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />Adama a na Hezekiya ɗa za na geshei mini ma na me yeneshe diga o ɗolu wa̱ Gihon, a̱vu u vadalai na wa̱ ka̱ra̱ e yeneshe a̱ tyo a̱ Lyuci va̱ Da̱wuda. Hezekiya gba tsura̱ ta̱ ulyuwu we elime a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na u yuwain suru. <verse eid="2CH 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" />Amma a na nlingata n na azagbain a Babila a̱ lyunguyi a rawai ecei e ili ya asalama i na A̱sula̱ a yuwan niyi, a̱vu A̱sula̱ a lyawa Hezekiya damma ili i na a̱yi aciya̱yi u shi ucigai na wa damma, adama u lyungwa̱i ko Hezekiya ta damma A̱sula̱ a ɗa a yuwain ili ya asalama'a.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />Akapi o ulinga u tsugono tsa̱ mogono Hezekiya ni ili isa'ani i na u yuwain, a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ pe uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada a vumava̱sula̱ Ishaya ulobo wa Amoz, na akapi aatagada a̱za̱ a̱ tsugono a Yahuda na aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Hezekiya kuwa̱ ta ucina nkaya ma̱ yi, a̱vu a̱ ciɗo yi aagaɗi uba̱ta̱ u na aason a limatan va Da̱wuda a̱ ri. A̱vu aza a Yahuda na̱ Urishelima suru a ca yi tsugbain a mantsa ma na u kuwa̱i. A̱vu ulobo wa̱ yi Manase wo o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="s">Manase mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 21:1-9">2 Ngo 21:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />Manase da̱na̱ta̱ na a'wan kupa ne ejere a mantsa ma na u temei tsugono, u yuwan ta̱ tsugono a'wan kupoton no ozo o ton a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" />Manase yuwan ta̱ iwuya e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, na u yuwain tsutoni na̱ wuma wi idaba yi nɗa n na A̱sulazuva a̱ gba̱ra̱i elime aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" />U da̱shi ta̱ suwisa ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ n na dada va̱ yi Hezekiya shi kototoi, reve u suwisa musa'a ma Ba'al na̱ a̱shuwutsu a Ashera a̱vu waru u kingyowa̱ italyo'o ya zuva u yuwan le a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" />Waru u suwa ta̱ musa'a a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, uba̱ta̱ u na A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;Lo ɗa Aala a̱ va̱ a̱da̱na̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima hali hali.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />Waru lo okowo wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva'a, u suwaa ta̱ lo italyo'o ya zuva suru musa'a. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" />Manase ca ta̱ olobo a̱yi kucci vu ukula̱tosu o Uka̱ri wa̱ Ben Hinom, reve u ɓoloso aci na̱ ruhu va̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ na̱ yindi. Agba waru u da̱na̱ ta̱ a yuwusan tsuboci. U yuwan ta̱ iwuya lon elime a̱ A̱sulazuva za na zuwai A̱sulazuva yuwain upan lon.<verse eid="2CH 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" />U tara ta̱ a̱ma̱li a na u she'ein reve u zuwa le a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, za na A̱sulazuva a dammai Da̱wuda nu ulobo wa̱ a̱yi Sulemanu, &lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a nda a̱ Urishelima, za naa n ɗangulai a̱tsuma̱ o gundo suru va aza a Isra'ila, naa ma zuwa Aala a̱ va̱ hali hali.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:3-5">1 Ngo 9:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:12-18">2 Alb 7:12-18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />Ma̱a̱ da̱shi tawa waru ana aza a Isra'ila na a lyawa iɗa i na n cayi nkaya nle shi, n na a yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na n damma nle adama a̱ wila̱ suru, nu udammu nu uritosu u na aagbashi a̱ va̱ Musa cuɗuwai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Amma Manase zuwa ta̱ ama a Yahuda na ama a̱ Urishelima a lyawa ure, na a yuwain iwuya lon na la'ai nɗa n na A̱sulazuva a̱ gba̱ra̱i elime aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manase vadala ta̱ diga o unusu wa̱ yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwan adanshi na̱ Manase na ama a̱yi, amma a̱vu a 'yuwan na a uwwa. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a zuwa nan yali ya̱ a̱soja o mogono Asuriya, aza a na a tarai Manase a̱ tyo tsugbashi, na̱ makawani a̱ vunu, a̱vu a̱ nla̱ a̱yi na akani a̱ rumushili a̱vu a tara a̱yi a̱ tyo Babila. <verse eid="2CH 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" />Amma a mantsa ma na u da̱na̱i a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon, u tara aciya̱yi ili i ro shi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ a nkaya ma̱ a̱yi a̱vu u zami urewesu wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" />Ana u yuwain avasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva reve we ene iliyali ya̱ a̱yi a̱vu wu uwwa avasa a̱yi, a̱vu u ka̱mba̱to yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima Ootogu o tsugono tsa a̱yi. A mantsa mo ndolo ɗa Manase revei A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a ɗa. <verse eid="2CH 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Ana a̱yi ndolo kotoi reve u suwisa ukari u Lyuci wa̱ Da̱wuda. Za na ka̱ra̱i a̱ tyo upasu wa̱ a̱livu wu Uɗolu wa Gihon a̱tsuma̱ o uka̱ri, hali acina una̱ntsu u mugula a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ acina upasu wa aagaɗi a Ofe uba̱ta̱ u na a suwa niyi uga'an lon. A̱vu u zuwa nan a̱soja a̱yi suru a̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci i na i ri na̱ kari vu ucira a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda.<verse eid="2CH 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />A̱vu Manase kototo musula̱ mo omocin a̱vu u tawa iroci i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva, oɓolo na̱ musa'a n na u suwai a̱tsuma̱ a masasan ma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa na̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima. Reve wo oco le ɗe a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ lyuci. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />A̱vu u da̱shi lapula masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva, reve u ca kucci muwwulai na̱ kucci vu ugodyusho zuva va̱ yi. A̱vu fo u damma ama a Yahuda a yuwaan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />Suru na̱ ne ama'a a lyuwa ta̱ elime nu ucasu u kucci a̱ ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱, amma a̱vu a casu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ le goon.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukosu u tsugono tsa Manase</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 21:17-18">2 Ngo 21:17-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Akapi o ulinga u tsugono tsa Manase, oɓolo na avasa a na u yuwain e ekere A̱sula̱ a̱yi, na adanshi a na aza a yindi a yuwaan niyi adama a Aala A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ pe uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada alabari o ngono ma Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />Na avasa a̱yi na̱ cine A̱sula̱ enei a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱yi, na̱ nusu va̱ yi suru nu ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱yi, na̱ ba̱ta̱ na u suwai ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ na̱ a̱shuwutsu a Ashera na̱ musula̱ babu u ka̱ɗa̱to aciya̱yi, a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ suru uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada a̱za̱ a̱ yindi. <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />A̱vu Manase kuwa̱ ucina nkaya ma̱ yi reve a̱ ciɗo yi a̱tsuma̱ o ukobu wa̱ yi. A̱vu ulobo wa̱ yi Amon wo o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amon mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 21:19-26">2 Ngo 21:19-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />Amon da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a'wan ushin ne ejere, a mantsa ma na wo o'woi mogono, waru u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ Urishelima a'wan e re. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" />U yuwan ta̱ iwuya e ekere A̱sulazuva cine Dada va̱ a̱yi Manase yuwain. Amon ca ta̱ kucci uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ma̱li n na dada va̱ yi yuwain, waru u yuwaan le a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />Amma Amon ka̱ɗa̱to aciya̱yi ununa dada va̱ yi yuwain shi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, waru u da̱shi ta̱ nusu va̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />A̱vu azagbain Amon oɓolu una̱ a̱vu o unai a̱tsuma̱ o ukobu wa̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />A̱vu a ama e iɗa ya Yahuda o una aza a na o ɓoloi una̱ o unai Mogono Amon, a̱vu a zuwa ulobo wa̱ yi Josiya wo o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="s">Josiya mogono ma Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 22:1-2">2 Ngo 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />Josiya da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ a'wan kunla̱ na wo o'woi mogono, agba u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa a'wan mata'atsu na̱ za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" />Agba u yuwan ta̱ ili i na i ri mejege e ekere A̱sulazuva. U yuwan ta̱ mmalu ma̱ a̱yi mejege a̱tsuma̱ o ure wa akaya a̱yi Da̱wuda, agba u vadala uba̱ta̱ u ro shi ko usa'ani ko ugula̱ shi.<verse eid="2CH 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josiya kototo ta̱ ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:4-20">2 Ngo 23:4-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" />A̱tsuma̱ a a'wan kunla̱ o tsugono tsa̱ a̱yi, a mantsa ma na u da̱na̱i a mawun, a̱vu u lyuwa elime ni izami yu urewesu wa̱ A̱sula̱ akaya a̱yi Da̱wuda. A̱tsuma̱ a'wan kupa ne ejere a̱yi, a̱vu u teme o kototosu ba̱ta̱ va̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ va Yahuda na̱ Urishelima na̱ a̱shuwutsu a Ashera na̱ a̱ma̱li a na e she'ein ni iroci i na a̱ zuɗa̱i. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" />O udammu wa̱ yi u zuwa ta̱ o kototo musula̱ n na n ri lo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a Ba'al. Waru wi ira ta̱ masa'a ma na a̱ kula̱tosu ili i ma̱guru na ri zuva le, a̱vu u kototo a̱shuwutsu a Ashera na̱ a̱ma̱li ni iroci i na e she'ein. Ele nda wi ira le ta̱ suru a̱vu u kusha'wa okomo'o uba̱ta̱ wa ama a na a casu yi ukula̱tosu u ndolo ason e le. <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" />U kula̱to ta̱ fo eetele a nan ganu zuva musa'a nle, na̱ ne tsundolo tsa ɗa wo o'wotoi Yahuda na̱ Urishelima cece. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" />A̱tsuma̱ e ilyuci yu ugundo wa Manase nu ugundo wa Ifiramu nu ugundo wa Saminu hali acina ugundo wa Nafutali no okongo e le, <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" />u kototo ta̱ musa'a na̱ a̱shuwutsu a Ashera a̱vu wi ira a̱ma̱li o o'wo okomo waru u kototo ta̱ musa'a suru n na a̱ kula̱tosu ili i ma̱guru a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila. Reve u ka̱mba̱ Urishelima.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱ tsura̱ ta̱ aatagada o Uritosu wa Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 22:3-20">2 Ngo 22:3-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />A̱tsuma̱ a'wan a̱ kunla̱ o tsugono tsa Josiya, na wo o'wotoi iɗa'a na̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a cece, a̱vu u lyungu Shafa ulobo wa Azaliya na̱ Ma'aseya gwamna lyuci gbain, na̱ Yowa ulobo wa Yowaha za maɗana ma alabari na a lapula A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="2CH 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Reve a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Hilikiya ganu gbain a ca yi ikebe i na a̱ ta̱wa̱yi a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sula̱, aza a na nan Levi na a yuwusan ipiri yu una̱ntsu a̱ ushiyi diga uba̱ta̱ wa ama o ugundo wa Manase na̱ Ifiramu na akapi ama a Isra'ila na̱ uba̱ta̱ wa ama a Yahuda suru na̱ Banyami na̱ nda̱na̱ta̱ ma̱ a̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />A̱vu a ca ikebe'e e ekere aza a na a ɗangulai na e idana ulapulu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva'a. Ama a nda e le ɗa aza a na a tsupa ozo o ulinga wu ulapulu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa'a, adama a na a̱ ka̱mba̱to A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva cine u da̱na̱i nu ufaru. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />A̱vu waru a ca ikebe'e e ekere a nan kafinta na aza a na a yuwusan usaa na a tsula atali na e she'ein na̱ akpata adama o usaa na ngono ma Yahuda n lyawai o ocoi o'woi okongo.<verse eid="2CH 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" />Ama'a a yuwan ta̱ ulinga'a na̱ a̱ɓula̱. Aza a na a ɗangulai na e idana ulinga'a ele ɗa: Jaha na̱ Obadiya nan Levi diga o ugundo wa̱ Merari na̱ Zakariya na̱ Meshulam diga o ugundo wa̱ Koha. Oɓolo na̱ nan Levi na a gurai ishipa ni itana i tsuwe'e. <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />Ele ɗa aza a na e idanasa aza a na a tanusu itana. Waru ele ɗa aza a na o rocosu vuma suru cu'un vu ulinga u na waa yuwan. Ozo o ro a nan Levi gba a̱za̱ e iɗana i ɗa, ozo o ro waru azagbain, ozo o ro waru aza a na a yuwusan ipiri yu una̱ntsu ɗa.<verse eid="2CH 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />A mantsa ma na a̱ da̱na̱i o uta̱su ikebe i na i da̱na̱i a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu Hilikiya ganu tsura̱ aatagada a̱ wila̱ A̱sulazuva, za na a cayi e ekere a Musa. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />A̱vu Hilikiya damma Shafa za vi iɗana i mogono, &lt;&lt;N tsura̱ ta̱ aatagada a̱ wila̱ a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Hilikiya ca Shafa aatagada'a.<verse eid="2CH 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />A̱vu Shafa tara aatagada'a u 'ya̱wa̱a̱ mogono u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Azagbain a̱ wu a ta yuwusan suru ili i na a zuwa nle a yuwan. <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />A tara ta̱ ikebe i na i da̱na̱i pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu a ca aza a na e idanasa ulinga'a no ozo o ulinga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />A̱vu Shafa za vi iɗana damma mogono, &lt;&lt;Hilikiya ganu ca a̱mu ta̱ aatagada.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Shafa ɗe nu una̱ elime o mogono.<verse eid="2CH 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />A mantsa ma na mogono ma uwwai udammu u wila̱ u na a ɗanai a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada'a, a̱vu wukara a̱tugu a̱yi adama a̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu. <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />A̱vu mogono ma ca udammu e ekere a Hilikiya na̱ Ahikam ulobo wa Shafa na̱ Abadon ulobo wa Mika na̱ Shafa za vi iɗana na̱ Asaya za na a yuwusaan mogono a̱ga̱nda̱, u damma, <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />&lt;&lt;Ka̱ra̱i i zami ya a̱mu urewesu wa̱ A̱sulazuva na adama akapi ama a Isra'ila na̱ Yahuda adama e ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ aatagada a nda za na a̱ tsura̱i. Upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ta̱ a̱bunda̱ aciya̱tsu, adama a na nkaya ntsu n 'yuwain a yuwan tsutoni na adanshi A̱sulazuva. Waru a yuwan tsutoni ni ili i na a ɗanai a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada'a shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />A̱vu Hilikiya oɓolo na aza a na mogono ma̱ lyungu yi oɓolo na̱ yi a̱ ka̱ra̱ a yuwan adanshi na̱ vumava̱sula̱ Hulda, za na da̱na̱i ka va Shalum ulobo wa Toha ulobo wa Hasra na a yuwusan ipiri yi itana yu otosu yu ulinga. Hulda da̱na̱ ta̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a Urishelima wu Upasu u Sa'avu.<verse eid="2CH 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23" />Reve u damma le, apa ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila a dammai, dammai vuma na lyungu n ɗu uba̱ta̱ u va̱, <verse eid="2CH 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:24" />&lt;&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, n ta̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ meleshe uba̱ta̱ u nda na̱ nda̱na̱ta̱ ma̱ a̱yi. Suru una̱ u na u ri pe uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada a na e ɗeyi nu una̱ elime o mogono ma Yahuda u ta shiwan aciyele. <verse eid="2CH 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" />Adama a na a vari mu ta̱, a̱vu a ca ukula̱tosu wi ili i ma̱guru a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u musula̱ n ro na zuwa numu n yuwain upan o una̱ we e ekere e ili i na a yuwain, upan u va̱ u ta̱ cipa̱ uba̱ta̱ u nda agba wa̱ fa̱la̱shi shi. <verse eid="2CH 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26" />Amma i damma mogono ma a Yahuda za na lyungu nɗu na ya zami ya yi urewesu wa̱ A̱sulazuva, apa ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila a dammai, o una̱ wi idanshi i na vu uwwai, <verse eid="2CH 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:27" />adama a na okolo a̱ wu a̱ tsu la̱pa̱ vadala shi waru vu ka̱ɗa̱to ta̱ aciya̱wu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ na vu uwwai ili i na u dammai adama o uba̱ta̱ u nda na ama a̱yi, a na wo o'woi vu ka̱ɗa̱to ta̱ aciya̱wu uba̱ta̱ u va̱ a̱vu vukara a̱tugu a̱ wu a̱vu vu shon elime a̱ va̱, a̱mu waru A̱sulazuva mu uwwa wu ta̱. <verse eid="2CH 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />Gogo adama o ndolo n ta lyawa wu vu yuwan wuma ma̱ wu na asuvu nden, a̱ ta̱ ciɗo wu vu cina nkaya ma̱ wu waru esu a̱ wu ene'e cu'un va̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ na ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ uba̱ta̱ u nda shi oɓolo na̱ nda̱na̱ta̱ ma̱ a̱yi shi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 34:28">A̱vu a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ mogono nu udammu u ndolo.<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josiya yuwan ta̱ nzuwulai na̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:1-20">2 Ngo 23:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />Reve Josiya mogono mo ɓoloto suru mbara ma Yahuda na̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />A̱vu u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, oɓolo na ama a Yahuda na̱ Urishelima oɓolo na̱ nan Levi na̱ nan ganu, na ama suru, zagbain na̱ za ke'en. A̱vu u ɗenuna̱ atsuvu e le suru idanshi i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ Aatagada a Nzuwulai, za na a cinai a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" />A̱vu mogono me isawan uba̱ta̱ u wisawatan wa̱ a̱yi, a̱vu u yuwisan akucunu elime a̱ A̱sulazuva no o toni ya̱ A̱sulazuva waru a yuwan tsutoni na̱ wila̱ wa̱ a̱yi, ni ili i na u zuwai nu udammu wa̱ a̱yi no okolo a̱yi suru na̱ wuma wa̱ a̱yi suru, na̱ waru a yuwan tsutoni ni idanshi yi nzuwulai n na ri uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada a nda.<verse eid="2CH 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />Reve u zuwa za suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima na̱ Banyami na a yuwan nzuwulai ndolo, a̱vu ama a̱ Urishelima a yuwan ne ununa nzuwulai na̱ A̱sula̱, A̱sula̱ a nkaya nle n ri.<verse eid="2CH 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" />Josiya gba tawa ta̱ suru a̱ma̱li e idaba a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Isra'ila. A̱vu u zuwa a ama suru na a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ tyo wu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ e le. A̱tsuma̱ a rana wuma wa̱ yi suru a̱ kuɗa̱ na a yuwan tsutoni na̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a nkaya nle shi.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="s">Josiya yuwan ta̱ A̱buki a Mapasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:21-23">2 Ngo 23:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />Mogono Josiya yuwan ta̱ A̱buki a Mapasa adama A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, a̱vu a paɗa ikyon adama A̱buki a Mapasa a̱tsuma̱ o urana wa kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi u woto wu ufaru. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" />Josiya zuwa ta̱ nan ganu na a yuwan ulinga ule, a̱vu waru u cuɗuwa le na a yuwan ulinga a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva ulobonu. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" />A̱vu u damma nan Levi, aza a na o uritosu aza a Isra'ila, waru aza na a tawai na akiza adama A̱sulazuva, &lt;&lt;I zuwa Akpati a Nzuwulai a̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa na mogono Sulemanu ulobo wa̱ Da̱wuda mogono ma Isra'ila suwai a̱tsuma̱ Isra'ila. Wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ ulobonu na ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ a tanusu yi e lyungu shi. Gogo yuwaan yi A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ɗu a̱ga̱nda̱ oɓolo na ama a̱ɗu aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" />I foɓo aciya̱ɗu o una̱ wu 'wa oɓolo oɓolo, cine a ɗanai e ekere o udammu u mogono Da̱wuda va Isra'ila nu ulobo wa̱ yi Sulemanu.<verse eid="2CH 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu yi isawan uba̱ta̱ wa akiza, oɓolo na̱ nan Levi na a kamba ugundo u na wa̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ kucci le a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" />A̱vu i paɗa ikyon adama A̱buki a Mapasa, a̱vu i tawa aciya̱ɗu i foɓo ikyon adama a̱za̱ a̱ɗu, a yuwusan ununa A̱sulazuva a dammai o una̱ wa Musa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Josiya ca ta̱ ikambishi ya̱ a̱yi diga a̱tsuma̱ o oɓolo e ikyon na̱ mgbele ma̱ a̱yi ukpaku mata'atsu (30,000), adama a̱ kucci va̱ A̱buki a Mapasa. Oɓolo no ogono e ina ukpakukupa uta'atsu (3,000) diga o utsuru u mogono.<verse eid="2CH 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />Waru azagbain a̱yi fo a ca ta̱ une'e u le nu ucigu wo okolo a̱ tyo e ekere ama oɓolo na̱ nan ganu na̱ nan Levi. Hilikiya na̱ Zakariya na̱ Jehiyel aza a na a tsu idanusan A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva, a ca ta̱ nan ganu ikyon ukpakukupa ure nu ukpaku uta̱li (2,600) adama a na a yuwan A̱buki a Mapasa, ni inan ukpaku uta'atsu (300). <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />A̱vu Konaniya oɓolo na̱ Shemaya na̱ Netane mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ a̱yi, na̱ Hashabiya na̱ Jeyiye na̱ Jozaba azagbain a nan Levi a ca ta̱ ikyon ukpakukupa uton (5,000) adama a̱ A̱buki a Mapasa, ni inan ukpakuton (500) adama a nan Levi.<verse eid="2CH 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />A mantsa ma na o foɓoi ili suru adama a na a yuwan A̱buki a Mapasa'a, a̱vu nan ganu e isawan uba̱ta̱ ule, reve nan Levi e isawan oɓolo oɓolo cine mogono ma dammai. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" />A̱vu a paɗa ikyon ya̱ A̱buki a̱ Mapasa'a, reve nan ganu o kyo'onu mpasa n na a ca nle, a̱vu nan Levi a̱da̱na̱ amunusa inama'a. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />A̱vu a tawa kucci vu ukula̱tosu'u adama a na e ne'eshen ama cine e ne'eshen nle oɓolo oɓolo o una̱ wu 'wa vu nkaya nle, adama a na a ca A̱sulazuva, cine u ri uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada a Musa. Ne ɗa fo a yuwain ni inan. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" />Reve nan Levi azatsu inama ya̱ A̱buki a Mapasa'a cine a damma nle a yuwan. A̱vu a aralu kucci na ri na akiza a̱tsuma̱ o pondo na̱ npondo mgbain mgbain na akwanu, reve a̱ jika̱ a̱ delyo wa ama suru. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Ana a yuwain ne o kotoi, a̱vu nan Levi a yuwan ifoɓi adama aciyele na adama a nan ganu, adama a na nan ganu ugundo wa Haruna a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ a casu kucci vu ukula̱tosu nu upasu wa abaji a mani'in hali ayin. A̱vu nan Levi a yuwan ifoɓi adama aciyele na adama a nan ganu olobo a Haruna.<verse eid="2CH 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" />Aza a na a yuwusan ishipa diga o ugundo wa Asaf, a̱da̱na̱ lo uba̱ta̱ u na a zuwa nle ununa Da̱wuda dammai. Asaf na̱ Heman na̱ Yedutun a̱za̱ a̱ yindi o mogono. Aza na a yuwusan ipiri yu una̱ntsu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva a lyawa uba̱ta̱ wu ulinga u le shi, adama a na a̱za̱ e le nan Levi o foɓoo le ta̱ fo.<verse eid="2CH 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />A̱tsuma̱ o urana ndolo ili i na wuntsayi a yuwan biti a yuwain ta̱ adama a̱ga̱nda̱ A̱sulazuva. A yuwan ta̱ A̱buki a Mapasa, a̱vu a ca kucci vu kucci vu ukula̱tosu u le zuva Masa'a ma̱ A̱sulazuva cine mogono Josiya dammai a yuwan. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" />Suru aza a Isra'ila a na a̱ da̱na̱i lo uba̱ta̱'a̱ a yuwan ta̱ A̱buki a Mapasa a̱tsuma̱ a mantsa'a, oɓolo na̱ opopofu a na a̱ ri na̱ wolilo shi hali acina arana cindere. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" />Ɗee nu ufaru a mantsa ma vumava̱sula̱ Sama'ila Koto ofoɓo cu'un va̱ A̱buki a Mapasa tsundolo shi. Waru babu mogono ma na maa yuwain cu'un va̱ a̱ A̱buki a Mapasa cine Josiya yuwain na̱ nan ganu na̱ nan Levi na aza a Yahuda suru na̱ Isra'ila aza a na a̱da̱na̱i lo oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />A̱tsuma̱ a'wan a kupa na̱ kunla̱ o tsugono tsa Josiya ɗa a yuwain A̱buki a Mapasa'a.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwa̱ wa̱ Josiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />Ana a yuwain tsundolo suru, a mantsa ma na Josiya kotoi ulapulu wa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sulazuva, a̱vu mogono Neko va Masar ta̱wa̱a̱ nu uvon a̱tsuma̱ a Karkemi wu upasu wa̱ Yufiriti. A̱vu Josiya uta̱ adama a na wa yuwan uvon na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Amma a̱vu mogono Neko lyunguwa̱a̱ yi na̱ nlingata a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Nla̱ngi n ne ɗa n ri ekere a̱ va̱ na̱ a̱vu, a̱vu mogono ma Yahuda? A̱vu ɗa ma zama n riya̱a̱ nu uvon a mantsa ma nda shi, amma u'wa u na ma yuwusan uvon na̱ a̱yi. Waru A̱sula̱ a damma ta̱ n jika̱, to, adama o ndolo vu lyawa tsushu'un na̱ A̱sula̱ za na ri oɓolo na̱ a̱mu, ko gba shi u kototo wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Amma suru na̱ ne Josiya vadala u lyuwa yi shi, a̱vu u pusa̱n iroci ya̱ yi u uwa uvon adama she e revei wan. U 'yuwan ta̱ na wa uwwa ili i na Neko damma niyi o una̱ wi ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, reve u ka̱ra̱ na wa yuwan uvon na̱ a̱yi agalaci a̱ Megido.<verse eid="2CH 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />A̱tsuma̱ a ali o uvon wa aza a Masar a tawan ta̱ Mogono Josiya. A̱vu u damma a̱soja a̱yi, &lt;&lt;U ta̱ numu diga pa, adama a na amaton mu ta̱ lon!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CH 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />A̱vu a tarai o uta̱ yi pe a̱tsuma̱ keke vi ido ya̱ yi, reve a zuwai e keke ro na u ri na̱ a̱yi a̱vu a̱ tyo na̱ yi Urishelima, uba̱ta̱ u na u kuwa̱i. A̱vu gba a̱ ciɗo yi uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ ciɗoi nkaya ma̱ yi. A̱vu aza a Yahuda na̱ Urishelima a yuwan nden n wirota̱ adama a̱ Josiya.<verse eid="2CH 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" />Irimiya ɓatsa ta̱ ishipa ya̱a̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu adama a̱ Josiya, za na hali acina a na'an ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci suru a canasa a cuwan na̱ Josiya a̱tsuma̱ a̱tsuma̱la̱ngu. A̱yi nda wo o'wo ta̱ ili i na aza a Isra'ila a̱ ri kurusu waru a ɗanai ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱tsuma̱la̱ngu.<verse eid="2CH 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26" />Akapi o ulinga u tsugono tsa a na Josiya yuwain, nu ulinga wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ na u yuwain, ununa u ri uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, <verse eid="2CH 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:27" />nu ulinga u na u yuwain suru diga o ufaru hali acina ukosu, a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ pe uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada o ngono ma aza a Isra'ila na aza a Yahuda.<verse eid="2CH 35:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="s">Yehowaha mogono ma aza a Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:30-35">2 Ngo 23:30-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />A̱vu ama a Yahuda a tara Jehowaha ulobo u mogono Josiya, a̱vu a katalai okokolo adama a na wo o'wo mogono a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima o una̱ wa dada va̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Jehoha da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan ushin na aza a ta'atsu a mantsa ma na u temei tsugono. Waru u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ Urishelima woto ta'atsu. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />A̱vu mogono ma Masar ma̱ cipa̱to a̱yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, a̱vu u zuwa aza a Yahuda na a tsupa utafa u azurufa na rawai kilo ukpakukupa uta'atsu nu ukpakuna̱shi (3,400), na̱ zinariya na rawai kilo mata'atsu na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" />A̱vu mogono ma Masar ma zuwa Eliyakim mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ Jehoha na o'woi mogono ma Yahuda na̱ Urishelima, reve u vadala ala a̱ Eliyakim a̱ tyo Yehoyakim. Amma a̱vu Neko tara Eliyakim mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma Yehowaha a̱ tyo Masar.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoyakim mogono ma aza a Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 23:36">2 Ngo 23:36</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:7">24:7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />Yehoyakim da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan ushin no ozo o ton a mantsa ma na u temei tsugono. Waru u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ Urishelima a'wan kupa na̱ za ta̱. Amma u yuwan ta̱ iwuya elime A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" />Amma a̱vu mogono Nebukanaza riya̱a̱ yi nu uvon a̱vu wu nla̱ yi na akani a̱ rumushili adama a na wa tarai a̱ tyo Babila. <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" />Nebukanaza fo pura̱ ta̱ akapi e itana i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱vu u zuwa le a̱tsuma̱ o ukobu u mogono a Babila.<verse eid="2CH 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" />Akapi o ulinga u tsugono tsa na Yehoyakim yuwain, ni ili yi idaba i na u yuwain, nu unusu u na e reme niyi biti, a̱da̱na̱ ta̱ pe uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ aatagada o ngono ma aza a Isra'ila na̱ Yahuda. A̱vu Yehoyakin ulobo wa̱ yi wo o'wo mogono o una̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoyakin mogono ma aza a Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 24:8-17">2 Ngo 24:8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />Yehoyakin da̱na̱ ta̱ na a'wan kunla̱ a mantsa ma na u temei tsugono, waru u yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ Urishelima woto ta'atsu na̱ rana kupa. A̱yi fo u yuwan ta̱ iwuya elime a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" />Ana a'wan a̱ da̱shi ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i, a̱vu mogono Nebukanaza lyunguwisa̱ na a̱ ta̱wisa̱ na̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a Babila, oɓolo ni itana i isa'ani ya̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. A̱vu u katala Zedekiya dada ke'en va̱ Yehoyakin mogono ma Yahuda na̱ Urishelima.<verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zedekiya mogono ma aza a Yahuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 24:18-20">2 Ngo 24:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:1-3">Irm 52:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />Zedekiya da̱na̱ ta̱ na̱ aa'wan ushin na̱ za ta̱ a mantsa ma na u temei tsugono. U yuwa ta̱ tsugono a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a'wan kupa na̱ za ta̱. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" />U yuwan ta̱ iwuya elime A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱yi, a̱vu u 'yuwan na wa̱ ka̱ɗa̱to aciya̱yi uba̱ta̱ u vumava̱sula̱ Irimiya za na tsu dansaa yi ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="2CH 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" />Zedekiya 'ya̱sa̱a̱n ta̱ mogono Nebukanaza a aci, za na zuwa niyi u yuwain akucunu a na ucigai shi na ala a̱ A̱sula̱. Amma a̱vu Zedekiya yuwan aciyogbamu no okolo o ugbamu, a̱vu u 'yuwan na wa vadala a̱ tyo wu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ A̱sula̱ aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Suru na̱ ne, azagbain a nan ganu suru no oɓolo ama'a a̱da̱shishi ta̱ ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱, e itoni yi ili yi idaba yi nɗa n ro, waru a̱ ka̱mba̱to ta̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva za na u tawai pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima idaba.<verse eid="2CH 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱risa̱ a̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 25:1-21">2 Ngo 25:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:3b-11">Irm 52:3b-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />A̱sulazuva gba, A̱sula̱ a nkaya nle, u lyungusa̱a̱ le ta̱ nu udammu e ekere a nlingata ma̱ yi babu ukotu, adama a na we e nda iliyali ya ama a̱yi oɓolo nu uba̱ta̱ wu nden ma̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" />Amma a̱vu aa yuwusaan nlingata ma̱ A̱sula̱'a̱ ulamu ni idanshi i le suru a̱vu o zo'oso ama̱sula̱, hali upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva a yuwan a̱bunda̱ aciya ama a̱yi, hali na babu lo ili i na yaa wawa le. <verse eid="2CH 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />Reve A̱sulazuva 'ya̱sa̱n mogono ma Babila na wa̱ 'ya̱wa̱ le nu uvon, za na unai olobo ele na̱ matsun me pe'eni a̱tsuma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, wu uwwa iliyali yi nanza shi, ko zagbain ko ke'en ulobo ko vali ko usheli ko abara ko za na kutsai suru suru. A̱vu A̱sulazuva a ca suru nle e ekere Nebukanaza vuma va Kaldiya. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" />Mogono ma Babila ma̱ pura̱ ta̱ suru itana i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sula̱, aza gbain gbain na̱ a̱za̱ ke'en ke'en, na asula e izuwa ya̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva ni izuwa i mogono oɓolo na aza azagbain a̱yi. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" />Reve a zuwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa A̱sula̱ akina, a̱vu o kototo ukari wu ucira wa̱ Urishelima, a̱vu a̱ kula̱to suru ukobu u tsugono oɓolo ni ili isa'ani i na i ri pe uba̱ta̱'a̱.<verse eid="2CH 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" />A̱vu mogono'o u pura̱ suru aza a na a̱ tsura̱i o unai na̱ matsun me pe'eni shi a̱ tyo Babila. Reve wo o'wo agbashi a̱yi oɓolo no olobo a̱yi hali acina a mantsa ma na a̱ tsura̱i tsugono tsa Pashiya. <verse eid="2CH 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" />Iɗa yu uwwa ta̱ uyo'o wu urana wa Ashibi a̱yi, a̱tsuma̱ a rana na u da̱na̱i okongo suru u tsura̱ ta̱ wivuwun, hali o shiton a'wan kupocindere cine A̱sulazuva a dammai o una̱ wa Irimiya.<verse eid="2CH 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mogono Sayiru lyawa ta̱ aza a Yahuda a̱ ka̱mba̱</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EZR 1:1-4">Ezr 1:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />A̱tsuma̱ a'wan o ufaru u Sayiru mogono ma Pashiya, adama a na o shiton adanshi A̱sulazuva na u yuwain o una̱ u vumava̱sula̱ Irimiya, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ ju'wa̱n okolo o mogono Sayiru va Pashiya na a lapa ulingi suru upasu wa̱ yi waru a zuwai uɗanu:<verse eid="2CH 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" />&lt;&lt;Apa ili i na mogono Sayiru va Pashiya dammai:</para>
  <para style="pi1" vid="2CH 36:23">&lt;A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a zuva, a ca mu ta̱ tsugono tsu uvaɗi suru waru u ɗangula mu ta̱ na maa suwaa yi A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a Yahuda. Lyawa ama a̱yi suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ɗu, A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱yi a̱da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱yi, waru u gawan a̱ tyo Urishelima.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>